(3289, 'C2112251004040002', 13, 676, '18', NULL, 'We have received the update from the IGA lounge in Terminal 1 Concourse D in Dubai International Airport. Unfortunately, they were not able to recall any incidents of them denying access to MTB LoungeKey customers. Our vender has also checked the records and found that this lounge has been checking in LoungeKey customers regularly and there were also recent check-ins for other Mutual Trust Bank customers as well. Nevertheless, a refresher training has been provided to the lounge and the vendor has reminded the lounge of the best practices when handling LoungeKey customers. It deems some unfortunate communication gap on part of this particular customer has happened. We have engaged Contact Center to explain customer accordingly.', 'We have received the update from the IGA lounge in Terminal 1 Concourse D in Dubai International Airport. Unfortunately, they were not able to recall any incidents of them denying access to MTB LoungeKey customers. Our vender has also checked the records and found that this lounge has been checking in LoungeKey customers regularly and there were also recent check-ins for other Mutual Trust Bank customers as well. Nevertheless, a refresher training has been provided to the lounge and the vendor has reminded the lounge of the best practices when handling LoungeKey customers. It deems some unfortunate communication gap on part of this particular customer has happened. We have engaged Contact Center to explain customer accordingly.', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-01-24 11:15:07', '2022-01-24 11:15:07', NULL, '104', NULL),
