(3481, 'C2111301004600011', 10, 460, '222', NULL, 'From the very beginning all branches aware that using of our group email instead of single user selects and branches are used to this practice. In this specific one branch also select the single user instead of group email who was in actually mandatory leave and that\'s why it was missed.', 'First of all thank you for your email. As you know that the delay reason of execution below request. From the very beginning all branches aware that using of our group email instead of single user selects and branches are used to this practice. In this specific one branch also select the single user instead of group email who was in actually mandatory leave and that\'s why it was missed. Later on it was addressed and it\'s executed. I believe it will be permanently resolution while VOC deployed all the branch network and practices of one channel request receive instead of multiple channels like outlook mail,Mnet mail, Hard copy CR form etc. I appreciate your understanding the overall scenario.', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-01-27 16:15:04', '2022-01-27 16:15:04', NULL, '88', NULL),
