(3822, 'C2202081005890031', 14, 589, '166', NULL, 'Ms. Shakila had informed us that Ms. Sadia Afrin had deposited Tk. 26000/- in her credit card today and she also gave 500/- excess of deposit amount to Ms. Shakila. After receiving the same Ms. Shakila had returned excess amount 500/- taka to the complainer on spot. Prior to this  transaction, the credit card holder observed that Shakila delivered service another customer named Mr. Mashuk Mollah  who was not queue  on that moment. Actually he was in the queue but at time payment he came to know that the  account is marked \" debit cash tran. restricted\"  by Madaripur branch . Then due to that complex situation,  Ms. Shakila requested that client to wait for some time and requested to solve the issue with help of our customer service officer. Mitigating the issue of  restricted  transaction when Mr. Mashuk  came to Shakila for receive payment , Shakila provide him service which created misunderstanding to our valued card holder  Ms. Sadia Afrin who was queue . That incident made her annoyed.  Mr.  Mashuk  Mollah,  client of Madaripur branch,  was not known to Ms. Shakila . Shakila served since Mr Mashuk was waiting from earlier but our valued Credit card holder thought that Shakila served her in other means.', 'Branch tried to reach the customer but she didn\'t receive call.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-02-09 13:40:59', '2022-02-09 13:40:59', NULL, '79', NULL),
