(8220, 'C2205311005890044', 14, 589, '104', NULL, 'I would like to inform you that Ms. ZAKAIA NASRIN STUDENT FILE NO 22/MSF/216/2022 opened her student file with MTB Gulshan Student Center in March, 2022 by Mr. Moniruzzaman (Gulshan Student Centre RM). Customer didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t have any conversation with me and  The STUDENT FILE OPENING PROCESS was fully handled by MD. MONIRUZZAMAN. I can recall that her husband requested Mr. Moshiur Rahman (Gulshan Branch RM) to send their visa fees together which is more than USD 300. Mr. Moshiur Rahman ask me does it supported by Student File as I said if it is not related to tuition, accommodation or Health Insurance so it is not Supported by Student File. Than My team member Moniruzzaman come to ask me how can customer make the payment I tell him to talk concern department (as card operations does not permitted more than USD 300). However customer talk for the payment with our call center as they advised Mr. Mashiur Rahman. Mr. Mashiur Rahman also talk with card operations department as well and they informed it is not possible.', 'I would like to inform you that Ms. ZAKAIA NASRIN STUDENT FILE NO 22/MSF/216/2022 opened her student file with MTB Gulshan Student Center in March, 2022 by Mr. Moniruzzaman (Gulshan Student Centre RM). Customer didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t have any conversation with me and  The STUDENT FILE OPENING PROCESS was fully handled by MD. MONIRUZZAMAN. I can recall that her husband requested Mr. Moshiur Rahman (Gulshan Branch RM) to send their visa fees together which is more than USD 300. Mr. Moshiur Rahman ask me does it supported by Student File as I said if it is not related to tuition, accommodation or Health Insurance so it is not Supported by Student File. Than My team member Moniruzzaman come to ask me how can customer make the payment I tell him to talk concern department (as card operations does not permitted more than USD 300). However customer talk for the payment with our call center as they advised Mr. Mashiur Rahman. Mr. Mashiur Rahman also talk with card operations department as well and they informed it is not possible.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-06-02 13:29:21', '2022-06-02 13:29:21', NULL, '107', 'No'),
