(10733, 'N2206300004', 18, 498, '72', NULL, 'As a freelancer, the customer won\'t get incentive. \r\nAs per dlocal response- We have looked into the matter both internally and with our client Gusto to provide the best possible resolution for the complaint. We discovered a remittance disbursement request from one of our customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s client and the amount was USD 3940.03 after deducting the fees we provided 350008 BDT based on the customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s instruction. Gusto, one of our clients, consistently discloses the account receivable to the client after intermediate costs and FX rate. However, they (Gusto) used Bloomberg Rate and displayed it to the customer, who accepted the terms and rate and moved forward with the disbursement.\r\nGusto is unable to make any adjustments because the recipient accepted the displayed rate that was offered by the platform. Even so, we are unable to do anything about the aforementioned issue.', 'Resolved', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2022-08-10 15:40:43', '2022-08-10 15:40:43', NULL, '6', 'No'),
