(10752, 'C2208042003980004', 14, 608, '174', NULL, 'With due respect & reference to the captioned subject we would like to inform you that Mr. Md. Joynal Abedin had come to cash counter of our Mutual Trust Bank Ltd. Shyamoli branch on August 02, 2022 (Tuesday) with some Claimed Notes. He has shown all the Notes to our respective officer in Cash & wanted to know the procedure to exchange such kind of Notes. After reviewing the notes the respective officer has informed him that whereas the notes are damaged/eaten by Bugs & already lost its temper (i.e. Damp Note) he has to makes an application to change the Notes. The application with his Claimed Notes will be forwarded to Bangladesh Bank. After getting the exchange value of the Claimed Notes from Bangladesh Bank we will be able to provide the Fresh Notes against your Claimed Notes & the procedure requires at least 8 weeks as per Bangladesh Bank PORIPOTRO NO. EHISHA: 23 (POLICY)/2013-15 er PORISHISTO: KA, DHARA: 3, dated January 14, 2013. After hearing the above procedure Mr. Md. Joynal Abedin had left the counter.', 'With due respect & reference to the captioned subject we would like to inform you that Mr. Md. Joynal Abedin had come to cash counter of our Mutual Trust Bank Ltd. Shyamoli branch on August 02, 2022 (Tuesday) with some Claimed Notes. He has shown all the Notes to our respective officer in Cash & wanted to know the procedure to exchange such kind of Notes. After reviewing the notes the respective officer has informed him that whereas the notes are damaged/eaten by Bugs & already lost its temper (i.e. Damp Note) he has to makes an application to change the Notes. The application with his Claimed Notes will be forwarded to Bangladesh Bank. After getting the exchange value of the Claimed Notes from Bangladesh Bank we will be able to provide the Fresh Notes against your Claimed Notes & the procedure requires at least 8 weeks as per Bangladesh Bank PORIPOTRO NO. EHISHA: 23 (POLICY)/2013-15 er PORISHISTO: KA, DHARA: 3, dated January 14, 2013. After hearing the above procedure Mr. Md. Joynal Abedin had left the counter.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-08-11 10:05:18', '2022-08-11 10:05:18', NULL, '140', 'No'),
