(11603, 'C2208301001990048', 9, 199, '19', NULL, 'The last date of card payment was July 10, 2022 and he received the grace period for paying the bill for another 2 days, i.e. until July 12, 2022. But the customer paid the bill on July 14, 2022, which incurred the late payment fee. However, we have reversed the charge on request of the customer as an exception.', 'We have reversed the charge on request of the customer as an exception.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-09-06 12:06:59', '2022-09-06 12:06:59', NULL, '104', 'No'),
