(11606, 'C2209051004370033', 10, 437, '22', NULL, 'a credit card was issued in favor of our valued customer, Mr. Mohammad Hasan on June 23, 2022 and delivered to his residence on June 29, 2022 through courier as per our policy.', 'We have already made the customer aware of the POD (Proof of Delivery) through our contact center.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-09-06 12:33:08', '2022-09-06 12:33:08', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(11607, 'N2209050010', 4, 684, '42', NULL, 'according to Bank wise Receiving Parameters for IBFT through NPSB that MTB receives only the transactions sent to accounts. As a result, the IBFT transaction initiated by the customer to his prepaid card account was not successful.', 'our concerned department has communicated with Bank Asia and found that the transaction was not successful from their end. The amount has been refunded to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Bank Asia account the next day.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Internet Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-09-06 12:39:32', '2022-09-06 12:39:32', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(11608, 'C2209051004090036', 10, 253, '23', NULL, 'the salary certificate that the customer provided on June 19, 2022 for availing credit card was expired. As such, he was requested to provide the latest salary certificate. In the meantime, the CPV team went to withdraw bank statement. But the account had no sufficient money. After depositing money, the CPV team withdrew the bank statement. On submission of the latest salary certificate on June 30, 2022, CPV team went to his office address for verification but nobody was available.', 'after completing all the process, the card was delivered on June 06, 2022.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-09-06 12:42:38', '2022-09-06 12:42:38', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(11609, 'C2209051000440040', 12, 672, '20', NULL, 'the cardholder was trying to make an e-commerce payment for Google Storage with local currency (BDT) where terminal country was United States of America. As per management decision, currently BDT Currency Transaction is not allowed from foreign country terminal through any MTB card to ensure transaction security.', 'Card division has informed the same to the customer through our contact center.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-09-06 13:03:35', '2022-09-06 13:03:35', NULL, '104', 'No'),
