(12146, 'C2209052000210030', 1, 21, '170', NULL, 'the customer visited MTB Pallabi branch to open a regular savings account. As per the procedure, he duly signed the account opening form and submitted necessary documents. Later on, after opening the savings account, he wanted to convert the existing savings account into MTB Graduate account which is against our policy. Respective staff from MTB Pallabi branch suggested the customer to close the existing account and open a graduate account. But he disagreed to do so. On the other hand, Tk. 138 was deducted for issuing cheque book as per MTB schedule of charges (SOC). This is also mentionable that the customer applied for debit card by signing the account opening form. Our concerned department issued the card as per customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request.', 'The customer has been informed.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-09-19 16:13:08', '2022-09-19 16:13:08', NULL, '16', 'No'),
