(12600, 'C2209254000200026', 10, 265, '90', NULL, 'Reply from respective team: While we designed the customer communication, we also included the same message. Now, from the chain email, what we could identify that customer had misunderstood the offer given from the developerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s side. Here, from the two option available, it was up to developerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s choice which option will be given to customer. Please note these are special complimentary benefits offered to customer as a good gesture to the bank, hence, from bankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s side we donÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t have much say in this regard. While customer communicated to me, I also informed him the same.', 'Necessery communication has been done as per reply.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2022-10-03 11:06:32', '2022-10-03 11:06:32', NULL, '107', 'No'),
