(12612, 'N2209120011', 12, 652, '293', NULL, 'we have investigated the issue with the cooperation of our concerned department. Our investigation reveals that ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œGustoÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â received a remittance disbursement request from one of customers where the amount was USD 3940.03 and after deducting the fees, BDT 350008 was provided to the beneficiary bank account based on the customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s instruction. Gusto, consistently discloses the account receivable amount to the client after deducting intermediate costs and FX rate. However, they (Gusto) used Bloomberg Rate and showed it to the customer and customer accepted the terms & condition with rate and moved forward with the disbursement (e-mail attached). Hence, Gusto is unable to make any adjustments.', 'Replied BB accordingly.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2022-10-03 13:51:13', '2022-10-03 13:51:13', NULL, '6', 'No'),
