(12737, 'C2210042004030046', 8, 403, '49', NULL, 'After receiving the complaint team GS&FSD has investigated the incident. After investigation, interrogation and as per statement of the duty security guard Mr. Obaidul Islam (ID- 41141) it has been found that the guard was performing his duty at the outside of the ATM Booth on dated 04 Oct 2022, time 1700 Hrs.(Approx.). \r\n\r\nThe customer who complained tried to enter inside the ATM while other customers were withdrawing money from the ATM. Security guard was just requested to the customer to wait outside until the others came out. But the customer took it wrongly and complained against him as he stopped him. The guard had just performed his duty properly and no offense found.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the guard has been asked to be more polite to the customer in near future.', 'Anyways, the guard has been asked to be more polite to the customer in near future.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Miscellaneous', NULL, NULL, '2022-10-06 15:32:06', '2022-10-31 10:34:38', NULL, '6', 'No'),
