(13637, 'C2210121004040011', 8, 404, '20', NULL, 'There is no scope for double charge , we only charge markup fee 3% on his settled USD amount which is mentioned in SoC & settlement rate is provided by network not MTB ( VISA or MC). Then whenever a customer pays his/her credit cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s USD bills, he/she effectively buys dollars from the bank and a customer can buy dollars from the bank at the prevailing exchange rate. Hence, a customer needs to pay his/her credit cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s USD bills at the exchange rate prevailing on the Payment Date. So there is no scope for double charge. Transaction NRI is shown on his SMS ( when he done the transaction), so customer may collect it from his SMS ,not possible to provide it into statement from our-self.', 'CC sent him an email.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-10-30 12:11:57', '2022-10-30 12:11:57', NULL, '104', 'No'),
