(14203, 'C2210231006290017', 13, 629, '18', NULL, 'We had contacted both the partners with the below said mishap and they both apologies for the mistake happened. It was due to the new joiners in the specific segment whom were not fully educated about all banking partners. We also requested the partners to contact the customer personally and take initiative to leverage the wound in service promise. Although the customer was called several times he did not pick up the phone. Thus, it is to inform you that the below offerings has been made to the customer for his next visit to SPA from the partners to show a gesture of service promise: Grace21 Smart Hotel: 25% Discount on SPA. Best Western Plus Maple Leaf: 30% Discount on SPA. ** Please convey it specifically (if only we are going to), to the customer that he needs to inform us through call center before his next visit to these vendors to avoid repetition of error and get esurience of discounts promised by the partners. If he calls, contact center has to inform us immediately so that we can get in touch with the partners as well.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-13 16:37:35', '2022-11-13 16:37:35', NULL, '104', 'No'),
