(14597, 'C2211125000860030', 6, 86, '298', NULL, 'Dear concern, please be informed that mentioned transaction is 3D secured E-commerce transaction. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801742336493) prior executing these transactions. That means using the card credentials mentioned transaction was took place. This is not under fraud purview. As customer wants the benefiary document and we will mail the acquiring bank to share with us the relevant documents where the mentioned amount was transferred. For receiving this type of relevant documents we have to wait 7-30 days minimum. After receiving the document from acquiring bank we will give you the full feedback. Until that we may hold the case.', 'As per the feedback of Cards Fraud Risk Management Unit \"After receiving the document from acquiring bank, we have talked with the client about the Bkash account benefiary number (01750604943) and customer informed us that his close person/ colleague knows his card credential and also knows the cards OTP, for these circumstances mentioned transaction was took place. We informed client that bank will not take any responsibility regarding this issue as customer card credential information was shared with the close person/ colleague. Here we close the issue from our end. We informed client about the replacement of the card as client card credential was shared and customer informed us that he has already been take a replacement request through our contact center. \"', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-21 17:52:38', '2022-11-21 17:52:38', NULL, '104', 'No'),
