(14661, 'C2211171000930051', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'As per the feedback of Cards Fraud Risk Management Unit \"Dear concern, please be informed that we have talked with the primary client regarding the dispute issue and primary client confirmed that as his supple was resides in USA for the tourist purpose and after that his relative may subscription from this card in wallmart.com so that he has no issue regarding the dispute problem and client wants to withdraw the complaint. We informed client if he felt unsecured about this card issue that time, we advise him please replaced the card for security reason. Here we close the issue from our end. \"', 'As per the feedback of Cards Fraud Risk Management Unit \"Dear concern, please be informed that we have talked with the primary client regarding the dispute issue and primary client confirmed that as his supple was resides in USA for the tourist purpose and after that his relative may subscription from this card in wallmart.com so that he has no issue regarding the dispute problem and client wants to withdraw the complaint. We informed client if he felt unsecured about this card issue that time, we advise him please replaced the card for security reason. Here we close the issue from our end. \"', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-21 19:49:12', '2022-11-21 19:49:12', NULL, '104', 'No'),
