(14771, 'N2211130005', 18, 498, '293', NULL, 'the customer is a freelancer, hence not eligible for 2% incentive as per Bangladesh Bank circular: FEPD(LDA)/147(1)/2019-7600, dated, 07.10.2019, Sl no- 4. However, the customer can enjoy 4% incentive as a freelancer if he complies with Bangladesh Bank FE circular no. 29, dated, 20.09.2021.', 'CC informed the case to the customer.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-27 14:36:10', '2022-11-27 14:36:10', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(14772, 'N2211130007', 18, 498, '293', NULL, 'the customer is a freelancer and not eligible for 2% incentive as per Bangladesh Bank circular: FEPD(LDA)/147(1)/2019-7600, dated, 07.10.2019, Sl no- 4. As per the circular, the customer will be eligible to receive 4% cash incentive, if he has a registered freelancer ID issued by government and the income from the market place is confirmed from Information and Communication Technology Division. The incentives which the customer received earlier were disbursed since he was unidentified as a freelancer due to system glitch at our end.', 'Replied to BB.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-27 14:38:59', '2022-11-27 14:38:59', NULL, '105', 'No'),
