(14891, 'C2211151000930003', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Dear concern, please be informed that mentioned transaction is 3D secured E-commerce transaction. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801924159414) prior executing this transaction. That means using the card credentials mentioned transaction was took place. This is not under fraud purview. Customer informed us through our detection analyst that she shared the card credential with the fraudster and our analyst was informed to client that as she shared her card credential with the fraudster that time bank will not take any liability regarding this issue. As customer wants the benefiary document and we will mail the acquiring bank to share with us the relevant documents where the mentioned amount was transferred. For receiving this type of relevant documents, we have to wait 7-30 days minimum. After receiving the document from acquiring bank we will give you the full feedback. Until that we may hold the case.', 'CC informed the beneficiary details to the customer through email.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-28 15:49:39', '2022-11-28 15:49:39', NULL, '104', 'No');
