(14997, 'C2211241000750043', 8, 404, '33', NULL, 'According to last meeting with the respective client dated 28-11-2022 presence of Mr. Mohammad Zakaria Hossain, Unit Head, Special Asset Management Division , Md. Asadur Rahman Manager, Special Asset Management Division, Corporate Head Office & Kazi Ali Imam Manager, MTB Collection Department for SME, Retail and Cards, Corporate Head Office got to reach a solution by unanimously that, Client has to pay BDT 40,000.00 out of BDT 57539.58 for settlement of the Credit Card. Client demand an official letter regarding this meeting settlement issue. Collection will send the letter as early as possible.', 'Issue closed as per doscussion with Customer & relevant department.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-29 11:50:46', '2022-12-06 17:01:45', NULL, '107', 'No'),
