(14999, 'C2209182004330016', 10, 433, '15', NULL, 'As per customer\'s application we have issued Three months Profit Based Sanchaypatra on 17.07.22(application enclosed). So the Interest was credited through BEFTN from Bangladesh Bank on 18/10/22 in her account. The said sanchaypatra was not Family Sanchaypatra where customer get the interest monthly.', 'As per customer\'s application we have issued Three months Profit Based Sanchaypatra on 17.07.22(application enclosed). So the Interest was credited through BEFTN from Bangladesh Bank on 18/10/22 in her account. The said sanchaypatra was not Family Sanchaypatra where customer get the interest monthly.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-29 15:01:51', '2022-11-29 15:01:51', NULL, '6', 'No'),
