(15008, 'C2209013007160052', 14, 724, '230', NULL, 'Dear Sir It is mandatory that customer has to write on his won documents & forms, as we see the account has been opened on 27/08/2015 & customer wrote his won card requisition form & we have send the requisition form to Card Division then, there is no document preserved at our end since after 5 years all documents has been destroyed by branch as per roles .', 'Customer declared the branch that he will use the existing card and replace it later.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-29 17:07:37', '2022-11-29 17:07:37', NULL, '22', 'No'),
(15009, 'C2210212004030012', 8, 403, '203', NULL, 'Branch reply: Actually customer informed me that the amount of encashment of DPS was crying need for his family. After that I also try to understand him the benefit of the maturity date of encashment of the DPS. Repetitively, he requested us to encashment the DPS for meet up his financial expenses .So as per the customer constant request I supposed to encash the DPS accordingly.', 'Branch reply: Actually customer informed me that the amount of encashment of DPS was crying need for his family. After that I also try to understand him the benefit of the maturity date of encashment of the DPS. Repetitively, he requested us to encashment the DPS for meet up his financial expenses .So as per the customer constant request I supposed to encash the DPS accordingly.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-29 17:09:55', '2022-11-29 17:09:55', NULL, '20', 'No'),
