(15014, 'C2211291000930004', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'As per Cards Fraud Risk Management Unit, they have checked the customer transaction history and found that customer made similar transaction at the disputed merchant dated at 19/10/22 in MADMUSCLES.COM, NICOSIA, CY amounting USD 15.19. After that they have talked with the client regarding the dispute issue and informed customer to check with the merchant as it is a recurring transaction.', 'Customer confirmed the relevant unit that he will contact the merchant regarding the dispute issue and also informed client please take the replacement of the card for avoiding the recurring transaction. Customer agreed with the statement. He will inform contact center if any issue arises further.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-30 10:30:03', '2022-11-30 10:30:03', NULL, '104', 'No'),
