(15018, 'C2210281004040014', 8, 404, '2', NULL, 'On 11/09/2022 supplementary card holder (Name - SHAWN SAMUEL GOMES) of ARUN PHILIP GOMES  visited at Air Lounge HSIA Dhaka Domestic along with two guests. As per our lounge policy, VISA Signature supplementary card holder can avail one complementary guest access every time when he travel. As respected card holder has additional guest, therefore, for additional guest access our duty officer informed the lounge policy in details. In this regards, duty officer asked if customer would like to make payment for additional guest through card BDT 850 or lounge membership card so we can count one additional guest. So customer agreed to provide loungekey card in order to take one access. Later it has been found on customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s monthly credit card statement that heÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s been charged USD 27. Following that issue, customer ask for USD 27 refund and he will make the payment for additional guest by alternate option (BDT 850 Card Payment).', 'The refund has been done.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-30 11:21:07', '2022-12-06 16:53:09', NULL, '119', 'No'),
(15019, 'C2210242006080042', 10, 252, '78', NULL, 'Md. Fattaul Momin Apu was working in one of our CEPP listed company name Oxford Shirts Ltd and his salary was transfer to MTB account but at present applicant is working in our non CEPP company Beacon Knitwear Ltd, Shalna, Gazipur as swing sewing supervisor and his salary BDT 22,000.00 transfer to MTB savings account from UCB through BEFTN process.\r\nAs per MTB PPG, Md. Fattaul Momin Apu is fall under our non-target segment due to RMG other Bank salary, salary less than PPG allowable and No-Management employee of RMG.', 'Source has informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-30 11:21:25', '2022-11-30 17:05:32', NULL, '6', 'No'),
