(15059, 'C2211092004030027', 8, 403, '268', NULL, 'Branch reply: It was late for several reason. 1. It hasn\'t been 2 months, but it was hardly 3 weeks. 2. Client was not aware as when I/We asked for correct information or confirmation he said he will visit the branch 3. The E-mail Id the client provided was not clear, as jnu,delwar222@gmail.com instead of correct information- (jnu.delwar222@gmail.com), for reference i have attached the IB main registration form. 3. He always came late like after 4/5 days. 4. We have him, understand how to do the self registration as well as branch verification, instead he chooses to use self registration, when he actually signed Branch Verification process as per his verbal declaration . 5. It was clear to us (at that time) that only card related services will be done through VOC. 6. At that we were not informed that the E-mail address can not be change, & we need to delete the previous one to change the email id. Therefore, the mention complain was closed. Azadul Talukder Shantu', 'Branch reply: It was late for several reason. 1. It hasn\'t been 2 months, but it was hardly 3 weeks. 2. Client was not aware as when I/We asked for correct information or confirmation he said he will visit the branch 3. The E-mail Id the client provided was not clear, as jnu,delwar222@gmail.com instead of correct information- (jnu.delwar222@gmail.com), for reference i have attached the IB main registration form. 3. He always came late like after 4/5 days. 4. We have him, understand how to do the self registration as well as branch verification, instead he chooses to use self registration, when he actually signed Branch Verification process as per his verbal declaration . 5. It was clear to us (at that time) that only card related services will be done through VOC. 6. At that we were not informed that the E-mail address can not be change, & we need to delete the previous one to change the email id. Therefore, the mention complain was closed. Azadul Talukder Shantu', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-11-30 16:07:49', '2022-11-30 16:07:49', NULL, '77', 'No'),
