(15550, 'N2211300012', 1, 408, '63', NULL, 'Due to delay in providing the acceptance of LC, complaint was raised. Investigation reveals that, there were some issues with the client named ASR Sweater Ltd related to BRPD circular No BRPD circular 10 dated 11-Jul-2012 and 13 dated 09-Sep-2012 regarding confirmation of delivery of goods. The client could not confirmed the delivery of goods for which it took times. After getting the  confirmation from the client regarding the payment of these bills, the acceptance has been given accordingly.', 'The mentioned bills have already been accepted by the bank on 07 November 2022 which is duly communicated to Bangladesh bank through email dated 08.12.2022.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', 'The mentioned bills have already been accepted by the bank on 07 November 2022 which is duly communicated to Bangladesh bank through email dated 08.12.2022. The issue is resolved now.', NULL, 'Export Related', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-11 11:47:40', '2022-12-11 11:47:40', NULL, '6', 'No'),
