(15616, 'C2212022004030004', 8, 403, '30', NULL, 'As per Central Verification Unit, their team went to guarantor office address(provided in CPV request form) two times for guarantor signature but guarantor was not available in office and guarantor 2nd time over phone informed that currently she is in OSD(Officer in special duty) and no one at the office known to her which CVU team mentioned in the CPV report provided on 13th November 2022. Later on Source today(04.12.2022) requested through mail(Mail copy attached) to collect guarantor signature from her Residence address since she is not available at office due to internal issue and after getting the request today CVU team collected the signature today and CPV report also submitted.', 'Issue solved as per customer voice.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-12 16:07:35', '2022-12-12 16:07:35', NULL, '107', 'No'),
