(15625, 'C2209261005940007', 5, 78, '33', NULL, 'We have listened to the call record with high importance, it was Mr. Musabbir Rahim who first began to speak in uncivilized language. He even talks hurtfully about religion of Mr. Proloy. Kindly be informed that this call was not the first call with Mr. Musabbir Rahim. He is not settling his Credit Cards liability with MTB since November 2017. Every month he promised to settle his Cards liability but didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t settled yet. He always gives us fake payment commitment. According to Mr. Musabbir Rahim, he willfully gives us fake payment commitment. He always misbehaves with us when we talk about his Cards liability. This is how he is not settling his liability for years. Mr. Musabbir Rahim do not gives us his present office and residence address. He is a very tricky and problematic client. His payment status furnished at attached file. The classification status of the said liability is Bad & Loss since October 2018. Now his Credit Cards liability stands at BDT 87097.21 (Ledger balance BDT 71567.95 + Unapplied interest BDT 15529.26).Collection unit has been trying to reach him to settle this issue but he is unreachable.', 'We have listened to the call record with high importance, it was Mr. Musabbir Rahim who first began to speak in uncivilized language. He even talks hurtfully about religion of Mr. Proloy. Kindly be informed that this call was not the first call with Mr. Musabbir Rahim. He is not settling his Credit Cards liability with MTB since November 2017. Every month he promised to settle his Cards liability but didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t settled yet. He always gives us fake payment commitment. According to Mr. Musabbir Rahim, he willfully gives us fake payment commitment. He always misbehaves with us when we talk about his Cards liability. This is how he is not settling his liability for years. Mr. Musabbir Rahim do not gives us his present office and residence address. He is a very tricky and problematic client. His payment status furnished at attached file. The classification status of the said liability is Bad & Loss since October 2018. Now his Credit Cards liability stands at BDT 87097.21 (Ledger balance BDT 71567.95 + Unapplied interest BDT 15529.26).Collection unit has been trying to reach him to settle this issue but he is unreachable.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-12 17:53:22', '2022-12-12 17:53:22', NULL, '107', 'No'),
