(15702, 'C2211222002520014', 18, 498, '101', NULL, 'Customer is a Student File customer of our Moulivibazar Branch and processes his student banking payments through Principal Branch Student Center. His requested remittance amount was processed on the same date 20 Nov 2022, however, our CRFCAD department did not processed the request reasoning that, \"Customer\'s earlier payment was refunded and to make payment in new institution a new file need to opened and this is Central Bank rule\". Accordingly we opened a new file and processed the request on 22 Nov 2022. Customer and BM of Moulivibazar Branch is notified. The issue is resolved.', 'Customer is a Student File customer of our Moulivibazar Branch and processes his student banking payments through Principal Branch Student Center. His requested remittance amount was processed on the same date 20 Nov 2022, however, our CRFCAD department did not processed the request reasoning that, \"Customer\'s earlier payment was refunded and to make payment in new institution a new file need to opened and this is Central Bank rule\". Accordingly we opened a new file and processed the request on 22 Nov 2022. Customer and BM of Moulivibazar Branch is notified. The issue is resolved.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-14 13:52:53', '2022-12-14 13:52:53', NULL, '107', 'No'),
