(15900, 'C2212121005890015', 14, 589, '2', NULL, 'This is to inform you, On 11/12/2022 MD NAJMUL HOQUE YAHIA (498851******1936)  visited at Air Lounge HSIA Dhaka Domestic along with one guest. Hence, card member was carrying his card which was in ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œRestrictedÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â status due to replacement issue. Besides, we checked and found card memberÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s new card has been issued already showed in our software which was also not active (Embossed) status and customer not received yet. According to Air Lounge access policy card member has to present active card in order to get air lounge access. On a good faith, card member will get the card soon and discussed with the supervisor we provide lounge access and he availed all the lounge facilities during his visiting time. As per air lounge standard practice, we must comply the air lounge access policy and share with customer politely. Also request him to consider our policy from his next visit.', 'This is to inform you, On 11/12/2022 MD NAJMUL HOQUE YAHIA (498851******1936)  visited at Air Lounge HSIA Dhaka Domestic along with one guest. Hence, card member was carrying his card which was in ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œRestrictedÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â status due to replacement issue. Besides, we checked and found card memberÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s new card has been issued already showed in our software which was also not active (Embossed) status and customer not received yet. According to Air Lounge access policy card member has to present active card in order to get air lounge access. On a good faith, card member will get the card soon and discussed with the supervisor we provide lounge access and he availed all the lounge facilities during his visiting time. As per air lounge standard practice, we must comply the air lounge access policy and share with customer politely. Also request him to consider our policy from his next visit.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-18 17:22:06', '2022-12-18 17:22:06', NULL, '6', 'No'),
