(15983, 'C2212122004030031', 14, 608, '163', NULL, 'I have personally communicated with the client regarding the issue. Where I informed that the complain of the client is that, he provided his email address while he opened his account. On the other hand the account was opened on 27/06/2010. That time email was not mandatory to issue debit card. Client complain is that he provided email address to his account opening form which should automatically add to his debit card. In the mean while I collected a CR form from the client & request sent to our card division through VOC & which is executed. I also confirmed it to the client over phone.', 'I have personally communicated with the client regarding the issue. Where I informed that the complain of the client is that, he provided his email address while he opened his account. On the other hand the account was opened on 27/06/2010. That time email was not mandatory to issue debit card. Client complain is that he provided email address to his account opening form which should automatically add to his debit card. In the mean while I collected a CR form from the client & request sent to our card division through VOC & which is executed. I also confirmed it to the client over phone.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-19 17:01:42', '2022-12-19 17:01:42', NULL, '21', 'No'),
