(16154, 'N2212190001', 18, 498, '293', NULL, 'The mentioned client is a freelancer and freelancers are not eligible for 2.5% cash incentive as per Bangladesh Bank circular number FEPD(LDA)/147(1)/2019-7600, dated 07.10.2019, point no- 4 (attached herewith). As a freelancer, the client may be eligible for 4% cash incentive as per Bangladesh Bank FE circular no. 29 dated 20.09.2021 (attached herewith). To avail the same, the captioned client needs to comply with the terms & conditions of the circular and submit all the required documents.', 'The mentioned client is a freelancer and freelancers are not eligible for 2.5% cash incentive as per Bangladesh Bank circular number FEPD(LDA)/147(1)/2019-7600, dated 07.10.2019, point no- 4 (attached herewith). As a freelancer, the client may be eligible for 4% cash incentive as per Bangladesh Bank FE circular no. 29 dated 20.09.2021 (attached herewith). To avail the same, the captioned client needs to comply with the terms & conditions of the circular and submit all the required documents. In this regard, we have communicated with the client and informed him about the information through email dated November 28, 2022', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-22 11:46:52', '2022-12-22 11:46:52', NULL, '6', 'No'),
