(16265, 'C2211301003660048', 7, 366, '20', NULL, 'Plz find the reply from SSL, We found the following number in GPÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s DND (Do not Disturb) list. GP maintains a database for the customers who do not want to receive any System Generated Push SMS. All Push SMS sent to the number have failed from GP end from the time of DND entry. GP enables DND for a number if number-owner specifically requests for the option. Hence, Customer needs to communicate GP to remove his/her number from DND list. Or you can advise the customer to send us an email via you, which we can forward to GP.\"', 'The customer is receiving sms now.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Mobile Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-26 12:28:53', '2022-12-26 12:28:53', NULL, '104', 'No'),
