(16273, 'C2211102004030017', 14, 608, '283', NULL, 'As part of our conversation with Mr. Shah Md Abdul Wadud (CSO) & Mr. Istiaque Ahmed Tarafder( Branch Manager) confirmed that the said cardholder did not visit on the mention date( 09.11.2022). We as a branch always try is optimize customer satisfaction subject to banking law & practices also availability of resource. If a customer wish to withdrawal big sum of money they have to acknowledge the bank in advance so that the branch can arrange the amount. This is worth mentioning that the card holder doesnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t maintain regular transaction with us but his transaction is very suspicious as it been observed by the transaction pattern. Large amount of fund deposit & withdrawal in the same date. After analysis of his statement it found that for the period of 1.07.2022-13.11.2022 is withdrawal 359 times from Habiganj branch ATM , 9 ATM transaction from lagdigirpar branch and only 10 cheque withdrawal & IB Transfer 20. He is a Bkash agent and uses our ATM machine to collect cash. The entire district is suffering from physical cash problem. We are collecting cash from various financial institute and try to meet the customer demand at the upmost. It is worth mentioning in ATM we can only use good quality cash otherwise the ATM services will interrupt. Branch communicate with the accountholder and explain him with the current physical money crisis. He understood and also aware of the issue. We also offer him a better service and request him to visit our branch for any banking need. We will ensure further delightful service to the customer.', 'As part of our conversation with Mr. Shah Md Abdul Wadud (CSO) & Mr. Istiaque Ahmed Tarafder( Branch Manager) confirmed that the said cardholder did not visit on the mention date( 09.11.2022). We as a branch always try is optimize customer satisfaction subject to banking law & practices also availability of resource. If a customer wish to withdrawal big sum of money they have to acknowledge the bank in advance so that the branch can arrange the amount. This is worth mentioning that the card holder doesnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t maintain regular transaction with us but his transaction is very suspicious as it been observed by the transaction pattern. Large amount of fund deposit & withdrawal in the same date. After analysis of his statement it found that for the period of 1.07.2022-13.11.2022 is withdrawal 359 times from Habiganj branch ATM , 9 ATM transaction from lagdigirpar branch and only 10 cheque withdrawal & IB Transfer 20. He is a Bkash agent and uses our ATM machine to collect cash. The entire district is suffering from physical cash problem. We are collecting cash from various financial institute and try to meet the customer demand at the upmost. It is worth mentioning in ATM we can only use good quality cash otherwise the ATM services will interrupt. Branch communicate with the accountholder and explain him with the current physical money crisis. He understood and also aware of the issue. We also offer him a better service and request him to visit our branch for any banking need. We will ensure further delightful service to the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-26 12:50:49', '2022-12-26 12:50:49', NULL, '60', 'No'),
