(16330, 'C2211281006650026', 13, 665, '109', NULL, 'The card issuance failed since customer wanted gift card on his own name. Customer reversal 12500 point was added in spend points. Customer will see this in Earned Point Tab in MRewardz account. Before redemption customer total point was 21288. After redemption Gift card, total point was 21288 - 12500 = 8788, after reversal, Point was added to Spend points, so spend point now 21288+12500 = 33788. So total point is 33788 - 12500 = 21288 So before redemption and after reversal point stays same.', 'CC tried to reach the customer but failed.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-26 15:53:54', '2022-12-26 15:53:54', NULL, '6', 'Yes'),
