(16522, 'C2210161004040032', 10, 460, '21', NULL, 'The said customer didn\'t cross check his endorsement update through air lounge or call center. In the mean time when he tried to use his card, it didn\'t work for the short period of time. But after that his purpose was successfully served. After informing us, we have asked him several times to visit us. But unfortunately, he didn\'t visit us and not even communicated over phone properly. We have communicated with the customer and appolosized for the dealy though we didn\'t do the delay purposely. The customer already lodged a complaint regarding the issue and we solved the issue earlier by communicating with him. As he is not satisfied enough with our stand, we are requesting you for considering the situation please do the needful. We have tried our level best for consolidating the client.', 'The said customer didn\'t cross check his endorsement update through air lounge or call center. In the mean time when he tried to use his card, it didn\'t work for the short period of time. But after that his purpose was successfully served. After informing us, we have asked him several times to visit us. But unfortunately, he didn\'t visit us and not even communicated over phone properly. We have communicated with the customer and appolosized for the dealy though we didn\'t do the delay purposely. The customer already lodged a complaint regarding the issue and we solved the issue earlier by communicating with him. As he is not satisfied enough with our stand, we are requesting you for considering the situation please do the needful. We have tried our level best for consolidating the client.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-29 09:16:48', '2022-12-29 09:16:48', NULL, '104', 'No'),
