(16632, 'C2212161004040005', 13, 619, '18', NULL, 'Our meet and great service provider company feedback us with the apologies email as follows: Travel Shop Bd our Meet and great service provider merchant they are really sorry to hear about the incident happened with our valuable customer, after the complaint they discovered the problem as follows- firstly they contacted with passenger before 4-5 hours and let her know please contact us by phone at our hotline 01841330303 when you will cross Le meridian hotel. But maÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢am called us when she was at gate 4 but all of our staff was busy, after that we send our people but she refused our service. As you know we are always busy with our clients and tried to give our best support to them. I also called maÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢am but she didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t pick up the phone. We are really sorry for the inconvenience, hope this will not happen again!', 'Our meet and great service provider company feedback us with the apologies email as follows: Travel Shop Bd our Meet and great service provider merchant they are really sorry to hear about the incident happened with our valuable customer, after the complaint they discovered the problem as follows- firstly they contacted with passenger before 4-5 hours and let her know please contact us by phone at our hotline 01841330303 when you will cross Le meridian hotel. But maÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢am called us when she was at gate 4 but all of our staff was busy, after that we send our people but she refused our service. As you know we are always busy with our clients and tried to give our best support to them. I also called maÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢am but she didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t pick up the phone. We are really sorry for the inconvenience, hope this will not happen again!', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2022-12-29 17:47:19', '2022-12-29 17:47:19', NULL, '104', 'No'),
