(16672, 'C2212121000930057', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'We have talked with the primary client regarding the dispute issue and client informed that his supple card was captured in UK ATM and first ATM transaction was (12/12/2022 22:18:13 amount 80.00 approval code-046943, Pound sterling 826) tried by her child (supple cardholder) but she did not receive any cash from this ATM as per primary cardholder statement and after that card was captured and she did not get the card. In the meantime, there were some transactions took place through different ATM and another transaction was happed through the contactless method. We informed that mentioned transaction were chip and pin-based transaction and we have no chargeback rights about this issue. We informed client bank will help him to provide the ATM transaction journal, but client need the ATM video footage. Dear Cards Settlement & Accounts Team, Refer to the below Complaint, please arrange to initiate chargeback option for the following disputed transaction as client denied the mentioned transactions. Please be informed that mentioned card status is blocked in the TWCMS.', 'Chargeback Processed', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-02 09:43:20', '2023-01-02 09:43:20', NULL, '104', 'No'),
