(16896, 'C2301031000930056', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'we have checked the customer transaction history and found that customer made similar transaction at the disputed merchant dated at 30/12/2022 in FUTURE PUBLISHING LTD amounting USD 43.25 . After that we have talked with the client regarding the dispute issue, and we informed customer that please check with the merchant as mentioned transaction was a recurring transaction. Customer confirmed us that he will contact the merchant regarding the dispute issue and also informed client please take the replacement of the card for avoiding the recurring transaction. Customer informed us that he will be informed our contact center, if any issue arises after communicated with the merchant. Here we close the issue from our end.', 'we have checked the customer transaction history and found that customer made similar transaction at the disputed merchant dated at 30/12/2022 in FUTURE PUBLISHING LTD amounting USD 43.25 . After that we have talked with the client regarding the dispute issue, and we informed customer that please check with the merchant as mentioned transaction was a recurring transaction. Customer confirmed us that he will contact the merchant regarding the dispute issue and also informed client please take the replacement of the card for avoiding the recurring transaction. Customer informed us that he will be informed our contact center, if any issue arises after communicated with the merchant. Here we close the issue from our end.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-05 11:11:11', '2023-01-05 11:11:11', NULL, '104', 'No'),
