(16957, 'C2301021000930042', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Dear concern, please be informed that mentioned transaction is 3D secured E-commerce transaction. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801817211009) prior executing these transactions. That means using the card credentials mentioned transaction was took place. This is not under fraud purview. We already talked with the client regarding this issue and customer informed that she was received a call from the fraudster, and she shared the card credential with the fraudster including OTP. We informed client that bank will not take any liability as client shared the card credential with the fraudster. Customer wants the benefiary document and we will mail the acquiring bank to share with us the relevant documents where the mentioned amount was transferred. For receiving this type of relevant documents, we have to wait 7-30 days minimum. After receiving the document from acquiring bank we will give you the full feedback. Until that we may hold the case.', 'CC informed the same to the customer and they have shared the beneficiary details.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-05 15:38:40', '2023-01-05 15:38:40', NULL, '104', 'No'),
