(17121, 'N2212290003', 18, 498, '308', NULL, 'The mentioned transaction has been returned to the sending end & also credited to the respective beneficiary account at the same time due to internal system glitch at our end. For this reason, our concerned division needed to take initiative for a refund of the said amount from the beneficiary bank. Thus the stop payment email was initiated from our bank.', 'The mentioned transaction has been returned to the sending end & also credited to the respective beneficiary account at the same time due to internal system glitch at our end. For this reason, our concerned division needed to take initiative for a refund of the said amount from the beneficiary bank. Thus the stop payment email was initiated from our bank. In the meantime, our concerned department also communicated with both the sender and beneficiary  and both of them have agreed to refund the amount accordingly. We have replied back to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 09.01.23 (attached).', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- Yes', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-09 15:30:37', '2023-01-09 15:30:37', NULL, '105', 'No'),
