(17520, 'C2301122004030058', 8, 403, '243', NULL, 'Branch reply: Dear Sir, Accept the best complement from MTB Malibagh Chowdhurypara Branch. Refer to the above Complaint of our Client, please be informed verifying others NID without our Banking use is completely doing Undue favor to a client and Integrity issue as well. Reasons not to execute the Service: 1. This out of our service rules verifying others NID without Bank use. 2. The given NID holder is not our client, he wanted to verify his Employees NID from us. 3. This is undue favor 4. Integrity Issue. 5. I was in Zoom Meeting name-ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œRoll-out of Centralized IT service Desk in Branch Banking DivisionÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â from 4:30 Pm to 5:30 PM when he called me thatÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s why response couldnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t his call. 6. We did not give any assurance about the verbal requesting service we said we will check it upon permission. 7. Client call me on 8:44 PM After Service hour then I narrate issue however, he is humiliating me as entry Level officer and start charging me after informing the rules. This is to inform For Each Verification of NID we have to Pay BDT 11.50 to Bangladesh Election Commission (BEC) as NID verification Charge. To avail this service he have to submit a written application based on it we will seek BOD permission after receiving BOD permission we can do it upon realizing charge. Thank you. with best Regards, Hasan', 'Branch staff had communicated with customer and made the customer understand.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-16 12:59:55', '2023-01-25 15:52:32', NULL, '99', 'No'),
