(17740, 'N2301100007', 18, 498, '293', NULL, 'The beneficiary is receiving remittance from various sources. The sending address is mentioned as ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œBangladeshÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â in last few transactions but the sender is not same person always. As such, confusion arises whether it is Wage Earners or Freelancer Payment. \r\n\r\nThe beneficiary will not receive any cash incentive if it is a Freelancer Payment; but if it is proved that remittance is under Wage Earners, he will get 2.5% cash incentive. Therefore, we have requested the sender to provide further documents (valid work permit or visa). However, we are yet to receive the documents.', 'The beneficiary is receiving remittance from various sources. The sending address is mentioned as ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œBangladeshÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â in last few transactions but the sender is not same person always. As such, confusion arises whether it is Wage Earners or Freelancer Payment.   Please note that, the beneficiary will not receive any cash incentive if it is a Freelancer Payment; but if it is proved that remittance is under Wage Earners, he will get 2.5% cash incentive. Therefore, we have requested the sender to provide further documents (valid work permit or visa). However, we are yet to receive the documents.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-19 16:39:27', '2023-01-19 16:39:27', NULL, '105', 'No'),
