(17816, 'C2301102004990057', 14, 598, '36', NULL, 'The customer (Mr. Sajib Chandro Das) made a transaction on December 23, 2022 using his UnionPay Debit Card in other Bank\'s ATM but the transaction was not successful. Customer called to our Contact Center and the dispute settlement request was taken on the same date. As per other Bank\'s ATM dispute settlement process, it may take approximately 30 to 45 days to get feedback from the acquiring bank. We have communicated with the customer, informed him about the time frame regarding dispute settlement process and also apologized to him for the inconvenience. Customer is now satisfied and convinced by our communication.', 'The customer (Mr. Sajib Chandro Das) made a transaction on December 23, 2022 using his UnionPay Debit Card in other Bank\'s ATM but the transaction was not successful. Customer called to our Contact Center and the dispute settlement request was taken on the same date. As per other Bank\'s ATM dispute settlement process, it may take approximately 30 to 45 days to get feedback from the acquiring bank. We have communicated with the customer, informed him about the time frame regarding dispute settlement process and also apologized to him for the inconvenience. Customer is now satisfied and convinced by our communication.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Internet Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-22 17:01:07', '2023-01-22 17:01:07', NULL, '107', 'No'),
