(17883, 'C2301191000930032', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Rely from Cards Fraud Risk Management Unit: Dear concern, please be informed that after receiving the document from acquiring bank, we have talked with the client about the Nagad account benefiary number (01618533627) & another Nagad account benefiary number (01616740582). Fraudster called to the customer through (+16219) number and took all card credentials from the Card member. Our cardholder shared all card credential including OTP with the fraudster, for these circumstances mentioned transactions were took place. We informed client that bank will not take any responsibility regarding this issue as customer card credential information was shared with the fraudster', 'As per Cards Fraud Risk Management Unit confirmation ticket has been resolved.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-24 11:53:19', '2023-01-24 11:53:19', NULL, '104', 'No'),
