(18121, 'C2301181000900049', 6, 90, '218', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that Mr. A. K. Faruque Ahmed, S/O- A.K. Fayez Ahmed has been availing a MTB Personal Loan and a MTB Platinum Credit Card facility from Mutual Trust Bank, CoxÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Bazar Branch. Recently, the above mentioned customer has applied for top up of his existing loan facility in our bank. To expedite the process, we have collected customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s CIB report and observed that another two loans are showing in his CIB Report (CIB report attached). Therefore, we have requested customer to provide the loan statements and sanction advices of the other 02 loans which he is availing from another bank. However, he could not provide the documents. As per customer, he does not have any other loans except the loan and credit card from MTB which he declared before.', 'Mr. A. K. Faruque Ahmed, S/O- A.K. Fayez Ahmed has been availing a MTB Personal Loan and a MTB Platinum Credit Card facility from Mutual Trust Bank, CoxÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Bazar Branch. Recently, the above mentioned customer has applied for top up of his existing loan facility in our bank. To expedite the process, we have collected customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s CIB report and observed that another two loans are showing in his CIB Report (CIB report attached). Therefore, we have requested customer to provide the loan statements and sanction advices of the other 02 loans which he is availing from another bank. However, he could not provide the documents. As per customer, he does not have any other loans except the loan and credit card from MTB which he declared before. It is mentionable here that, the customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s top up loan application has been declined due to high DBR issue. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email & letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/01 dated 26.01.2023', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-29 12:01:57', '2023-01-29 12:01:57', NULL, '52', 'No'),
