(18124, 'C2301182001030040', 6, 103, '283', NULL, 'M/s New Shuhag Brick Field is a BL client of our MTB Habiganj Branch since 30-09-2019. For loan recovery purpose, concerned officials of our bank have visited clientÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s house, business address and sent several reminder letters, however did not get any response from the client. In addition, a legal notice was also served to client but the client did not communicate with us upon receiving the same. Lastly, we have published Auction Notice at ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œDaily Manob JaminÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â and ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œDaily Habiganj ShomacharÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â on 15-03-2022. However, client still did not take any initiative to regularize the loan. Later we got approval letter from MTB Asset Management Division and received authorization letter from Senior Management, for auctioning and sale the mortgaged property to Mrs. Nurun Nahar (As highest bidder of the auction).  After that, we have received a letter from Mr. Md Abdul Awal (Proprietor of M/s New Shuhag Brick Field) on 02-01-2023 at 12.34 pm.  This is mentionable here that, a mismatch was found between the dates in submission and dispatch. The letter was prepared on 14-09-2021 but was dispatched on 02-01-2023. Therefore, it is clear that the intention of the client was not right.', 'M/s New Shuhag Brick Field is a BL client of our MTB Habiganj Branch since 30-09-2019. For loan recovery purpose, concerned officials of our bank have visited clientÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s house, business address and sent several reminder letters, however did not get any response from the client. In addition, a legal notice was also served to client but the client did not communicate with us upon receiving the same. Lastly, we have published Auction Notice at ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œDaily Manob JaminÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â and ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œDaily Habiganj ShomacharÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â on 15-03-2022. However, client still did not take any initiative to regularize the loan. Later we got approval letter from MTB Asset Management Division and received authorization letter from Senior Management, for auctioning and sale the mortgaged property to Mrs. Nurun Nahar (As highest bidder of the auction).  After that, we have received a letter from Mr. Md Abdul Awal (Proprietor of M/s New Shuhag Brick Field) on 02-01-2023 at 12.34 pm.  This is mentionable here that, a mismatch was found between the dates in submission and dispatch. The letter was prepared on 14-09-2021 but was dispatched on 02-01-2023. Therefore, it is clear that the intention of the client was not right.  Accordingly, we have replied to BB through email and letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/02 dated 26.01.2023', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-01-29 12:09:19', '2023-01-29 12:09:19', NULL, '60', 'No'),
