(18345, 'C2301291000930042', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Reply from Cards Fraud Risk Management Unit: Dear concern, Customer denied the online transactions happened at RAZ*STATS2ECONO APPLIED, Approval code 352036 date 01/01/2023. Please be informed that mentioned transaction was 3D secured e-commerce transaction. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801712782023) prior executing these transactions. That means using the card credentials mentioned transaction was took place. This is not under fraud purview. Also check the TWCMS memo and found that ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œAs per C/HÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request, E-Commerce has been enabled by setting the value of E-Commerce Times and Amount: 01 USD 100.ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â Also, customer made service request S2301011002700397 for foreign part enable. In these circumstances, we can say that it is not fraud transaction and informed the issue accordingly to the customer end.', 'OB tried to reach customer several times but was unreachable', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-02-05 12:16:46', '2023-02-05 12:16:46', NULL, '104', 'Yes'),
