(18570, 'C2302012005880016', 14, 588, '170', NULL, 'After checking with customer, branch officials and CCTV footage, we have come to a conclusion that the dealing officer wasnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t professional enough while providing service to the customer. It is clearly mentioned in our Operational Manual how to register and keep record of Debit Cards of mother branch and other MTB branches. If we follow that, we donÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t even need to ask the customers to show relevant SMS to us. All we need is account number to search/look for the desired card, because in the tracker sheet required information are available. Unfortunately, most of the MTB branches do not follow the Branch Operational Manual (BOM) when it comes to security items and reconciliation.\r\n\r\nThe dealing officer should have been more courteous and have followed the instruction given in the BOM.', 'After checking with customer, branch officials and CCTV footage, we have come to a conclusion that the dealing officer wasnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t professional enough while providing service to the customer. It is clearly mentioned in our Operational Manual how to register and keep record of Debit Cards of mother branch and other MTB branches. If we follow that, we donÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t even need to ask the customers to show relevant SMS to us. All we need is account number to search/look for the desired card, because in the tracker sheet required information are available. Unfortunately, most of the MTB branches do not follow the Branch Operational Manual (BOM) when it comes to security items and reconciliation.  The dealing officer should have been more courteous and have followed the instruction given in the BOM.', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-02-12 14:04:14', '2023-02-13 16:31:14', NULL, '16', 'No'),
