(18629, 'C2302072004980043', 18, 498, '308', NULL, 'Reply from Regulators, Branch and Remittance Partners Relationship Management: \"As per information received from our respective MTO Partner through Application Program Interface, this account holder falls under the category of Enhanced Due Diligence at our Remittance Management System. As such, incentive disbursement is on hold as per Bangladesh Bank guideline. We may work on releasing incentive if you arrange to provide us the following documents in this respect: ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ SenderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Valid Visa Copy ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ SenderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Valid Work Permit Copy ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ SenderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Resident Permit ID Copy.\"', 'OB informed customer accordingly', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-02-13 12:05:16', '2023-02-13 12:05:16', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(18630, 'C2302062003680039', 7, 368, '267', NULL, 'Mr. Abdul Khaleque proprietor of Rahmania City was the owner of prescribe no.01911971312 which is found in AOF but in 2013 he lost his phone with this SIM card. He didn\'t replace his SIM due to which the problem took place.', 'Branch has updated new phone no. 01711890507 of the actual account.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-02-13 12:07:26', '2023-02-13 12:07:26', NULL, '46', 'No'),
(18631, 'N2212070003', 1, 19, '50', NULL, 'Mr. Mohiuddin Sikder, the complainant, sent a letter dated 06.12.2022 stating that Mr. S M Abul Bashar, Officer, Chak Mogholtoly branch is not returning the money which he invested in Share business along with Mr. Bashar. He requested for the intervention in recovery of the due money from Mr. Bashar.', 'Our concerned Division (HR) sent the complaint letter to Mr. Abul bashar, Chak Mogholtoly Branch for further action. Accordingly, Mr. Bashar has taken necessary steps to return back the money to the complainant Mr. Mohiuddin Sikder. Finally, Mr. Mohiuddin Sikder (complainant) withdrawal his complaint through letter dated  12.02.2023 (attached)', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Miscellaneous', NULL, NULL, '2023-02-13 12:10:42', '2023-02-13 12:10:42', NULL, '6', 'No'),
