(18635, 'C2212114003260044', 6, 326, '278', NULL, 'We have received Bangladesh BankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s letter(s) (Ref:FICSD/5045(1)(D)/2427) dated 19.10.2022 and (Ref: FICSD/5045/(D)(1)/2022/2932) dated 19.12.2022, regarding exemption of loan, investigation on irregularities and corruption of the project of Sherpa, Rahim Afroze Solar Shech Pump under green energy loan. Bangladesh bank has requested to provide an Investigation report by Internal Audit of the bank.', 'With reference to Bangladesh BankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s letter(s) (Ref:FICSD/5045(1)(D)/2427) dated 19.10.2022 and (Ref: FICSD/5045/(D)(1)/2022/2932) dated 19.12.2022, we had forwarded the same to our Group Internal Control & Compliance Division for their necessary action. Subsequently, they conducted a special audit/investigation on the issue and submitted their report through a letter ref: MTB/ICC/WW TOWER/INVESTIGATION/REPORT/THAK/41/2023 to us which is enclosed herewith. The investigation report is containing 165 page. As such, we could not attached the soft copy. The hard copy is sent to BB and the receipt copy is attached herewith.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- Yes', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-02-13 14:07:02', '2023-02-13 14:07:02', NULL, '63', 'No'),
