(18882, 'C2302081001990022', 9, 204, '20', NULL, 'The cardholder made an online transaction at Google Tinder (650-2530000, US) on dated 05-01-2023. The original transaction amount was BDT 805/- but Google settled the transaction in USD due to which markup fee and NBR VAT were imposed on the transaction amount. As such, the cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s settlement amount was USD 9.12. The bank imposes VAT on transactions associated with Google transaction as per BRPD Circular Letter No. 4 dated 03 March 2019.', 'The original transaction amount was BDT 805/- but Google settled the transaction in USD due to which markup fee and NBR VAT were imposed on the transaction amount. As such, the cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s settlement amount was USD 9.12. The bank imposes VAT on transactions associated with Google transaction as per BRPD Circular Letter No. 4 dated 03 March 2019. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh bank through letter MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/06 dated Feb 16, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-02-22 10:48:07', '2023-02-22 10:48:07', NULL, '104', 'No'),
