(18888, 'C2302081004040020', 9, 204, '20', NULL, 'Due to overcharged issue, complaint was raised. The mentioned transaction was made using MTB credit card at Brac BankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s merchant (Hill Tech Pro). Since MTB Card Division does not have any control over other banksÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ merchant charges, we are unable to take any action against the mentioned merchant.', 'The mentioned transaction was made using MTB credit card at Brac BankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s merchant (Hill Tech Pro). Since MTB Card Division does not have any control over other banksÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ merchant charges, we are unable to take any action against the mentioned merchant. Accordingly, we have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/09 dated Feb 16, 2023', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-02-22 10:57:56', '2023-02-22 10:57:56', NULL, '104', 'No'),
