(19115, 'C2302191000930003', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Dear Concern, talked to client about the fraud related complaint and customer informed us that he was received a call from +88016219 and he received a Phishing mail and after clicking the mail, fraudster may control his mobile set phone and his email address. After that mentionable transactions were done with using the OTP. Clent informed us that as fraudster control his email address and his google drive link and download some valuable info from his drive for these circumstances using the OTP these were took place. Bank informed that these types of MFS Fraud transaction refund from MFS is too impossible cause fraudster withdraw the money within short span of time. Customer wants the benefiary document and we will mail the acquiring bank to share with us the relevant documents where the mentioned amount was transferred. For receiving this type of relevant documents, we have to wait 7-30 days minimum.', 'Contact center have already been shared the benefeciary details to customer', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-02-28 10:05:02', '2023-02-28 10:05:02', NULL, '104', 'No'),
