(19489, 'C2302281000930032', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'mentioned transactions were 3D secured e-commerce transaction. As per customer statement, he received a call from (+16219) customer shared the card number, expiry date and CVV number with the fraudster. After that customer click a link, for this circumstances, customer registered email address hacked by the fraudster and mentioned transactions were took place.', 'Contact Center has already informed this issue to customer through email regarding the resolution', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 13:27:16', '2023-03-12 13:27:16', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(19490, 'C2302271006290013', 13, 629, '18', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that as per MTB valentineÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s day campaign terms and conditions, the selected winners were required to confirm the reservation through our 24/7 contact center by 09-02-2023 (within 2.00 PM). The terms and conditions were also mentioned in MTB website. Our contact center executive could not accept the reservation request because customer called after the said timeline. As a result, complaint was raised.', 'MTB valentineÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s day campaign terms and conditions, the selected winners were required to confirm the reservation through our 24/7 contact center by 09-02-2023 (within 2.00 PM). The terms and conditions were also mentioned in MTB website. Our contact center executive could not accept the reservation request because customer called after the said timeline. We have already explained the issue to customer via email on 12-02-2023 (Email attached). Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/25 dated March 07, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 13:34:24', '2023-03-12 13:34:24', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(19491, 'C2302272005880016', 14, 588, '170', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that the concerned officer lacked professionalism and pro-activeness while providing service to the customer. As a result, customer dissatisfaction occurred.', 'The concerned officer lacked professionalism and pro-activeness while providing service to the customer. The responsible officer has been cautioned and advised not to repeat the same mistake in future. We have also sought apology from the customer over phone and she is now satisfied with our service. Accordingly, We have replied to BB through letter ref MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/26 dated March 07, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- Yes', NULL, NULL, 'No', 'This issue has already been resolved earlier. Customer directly complained to us and we resolved it. Previous complaint no. C2302012005880016.', NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 13:48:09', '2023-03-12 13:48:09', NULL, '16', 'No'),
(19492, 'C2302271002190017', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'Investigation reveals that MPP (MTB protection plan) fee was imposed against the mentioned credit card. As a result, complaint was rasied.', 'MTB Protection Plan is an insurance coverage program offered to all credit cardholders. However, if any cardholder is not willing to avail the insurance coverage then he/she may de-enroll the plan. Regarding this cardholder, our concerned division has already de-enrolled the Protection Plan and is going to reverse his MPP charge according to his request. Accordingly, We have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/27 dated March 07, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 13:55:33', '2023-03-12 13:55:33', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(19493, 'C2302271000660020', 4, 66, '20', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that the mentioned customer has been availing an NFC (Near Field Communication) enabled card which allows for contactless transaction to a certain limit. Customer requested to de-activate the NFC.', 'The mentioned customer has been availing an NFC (Near Field Communication) enabled card which allows for contactless transaction to a certain limit. All MTB Credit Cards are NFC enabled and we do not have any option to deactivate NFC for a particular card. Customer may do contactless transaction up to a certain amount, right now the amount is BDT 3,000 only. Accordingly, We have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/28 dated March 07, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 14:06:02', '2023-03-12 14:06:02', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(19494, 'C2303063006940041', 3, 694, '36', NULL, 'CC checked and found that customer has already made successful transaction on dated 07/03/2023 12:01:14.', 'Issue has been resolved', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 14:09:43', '2023-03-12 14:09:43', NULL, '116', 'No'),
