(19499, 'C2302271002190012', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'The customer wrongly made payment against his cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s BDT part instead of USD part on 15-01-2023 for outstanding of December, 2022. Although he placed a request for credit balance transfer from BDT to USD part of his card through our contact centre on same day, due to calling at 7:24 PM (after banking hour), it was executed on next day accordingly. As a result, late payment fee was charged on his card account on 15-01-2023.', 'The customer wrongly made payment against his cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s BDT part instead of USD part on 15-01-2023 for outstanding of December, 2022. Although he placed a request for credit balance transfer from BDT to USD part of his card through our contact centre on same day, due to calling at 7:24 PM (after banking hour), it was executed on next day accordingly. As a result, late payment fee was charged on his card account on 15-01-2023. However, based on customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request our concerned division has reversed the late payment fee on 12-02-2023. Accordingly, We have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/29 dated March 07, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 14:12:42', '2023-03-12 14:12:42', NULL, '104', 'No');
