(19500, 'C2302271006290019', 13, 629, '18', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that as per the policy of MTB valentine campaign offer, the complementary stay reservation was subject to availability. Due to occupancy unavailability in mentioned cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s preferred resort, he could not avail the offer in his desired resort. As a result, complaint was raised.', 'As per the policy of MTB valentine campaign offer, the complementary stay reservation was subject to availability. Due to occupancy unavailability in mentioned cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s preferred resort, our concerned division offered to arrange occupancy in another resort within a short time. The cardholder agreed to the offer and availed the service on 14-02-2023 accordingly. We have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/30 dated March 07, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 14:19:43', '2023-03-12 14:19:43', NULL, '104', 'No'),
