(19516, 'C2302271000660011', 4, 66, '36', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that customer called to our contact centre on 01-02-2023 and enquired about the service availability of enabling and disabling foreign part through MTB Smart Banking Apps. Our contact centre executive informed him about the service accordingly. Meanwhile the customer went abroad and failed to enable the foreign part by himself. Therefore, he made a call to our contact centre from overseas using an unregistered number. Our contact centre could not provide the service as the customer called from an unregistered number. As a result, complaint was raised.', 'Customer called to our contact centre on 01-02-2023 and enquired about the service availability of enabling and disabling foreign part through MTB Smart Banking Apps. Our contact centre executive informed him about the service accordingly. Meanwhile the customer went abroad and failed to enable the foreign part by himself. Therefore, he made a call to our contact centre from overseas using an unregistered number. Our contact centre could not provide the service as the customer called from an unregistered number. However, based on customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s email confirmation on 04-02-2023, our concerned division enabled his cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s foreign part and e-commerce facility accordingly. We have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/31 dated March 07, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 14:52:11', '2023-03-12 14:52:11', NULL, '116', 'No'),
