(19519, 'C2302271000440014', 3, 44, '20', NULL, 'Customer complained that he cannot do transactions using his credit card. As a result, complaint was raised. We have checked the issue and did not find any declined transactions in our system against the mentioned card.', 'We have checked the issue and did not find any declined transactions in our system against the mentioned card. Therefore, we have requested customer to make the transaction again. Afterwards, the customer made several successful e-commerce transactions using his card. Customer made his last e-commerce transaction on 02-03-2023 and he is happy with our service now. Accordingly, we have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/32 dated March 07, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 15:03:21', '2023-03-12 15:03:21', NULL, '104', 'No'),
