(19521, 'C2302271002190021', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'MPP (MTB protection plan) fee was imposed against the mentioned credit card. As a result, complaint was raised. Investigation reveals that MTB Protection Plan is an insurance coverage program offered to all credit cardholders. Initially, MTB Protection Plan facility was complementary for Signature credit cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s but now the bank has decided to impose an MPP fee on Signature cardholders from October 2022 after notifying the customer through SMS.', 'MTB Protection Plan is an insurance coverage program offered to all credit cardholders. Initially, MTB Protection Plan facility was complementary for Signature credit cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s but now the bank has decided to impose an MPP fee on Signature cardholders from October 2022 after notifying the customer through SMS. However, if any cardholder is not willing to avail the insurance coverage then he/she may de-enroll the plan. Regarding this cardholder, our concerned division has already de-enrolled the Protection Plan and also reversed the MPP fee of BDT 773.59 on 08-02-2023. Accordingly, We have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/33 dated March 07, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-12 15:10:26', '2023-03-12 15:10:26', NULL, '104', 'No'),
