(19884, 'C2303122005980031', 14, 598, '36', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that the customer made a call to our contact centre on 12-02-23 and made a query regarding the transaction which was initiated from Bkash wallet to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s MTB debit card account on 09-02-23. Since the amount was not credited to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s respective debit card account till then, our contact centre executive politely suggested customer to communicate with Bkash for further inquiry.', 'The transferred amount of BDT 14,400/- has already been credited from Bkash to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s MTB debit card account on 12-02-23 at 02.23 PM. Accordingly, we have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/35 dated 20.03.23 .', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-21 17:08:01', '2023-03-21 17:08:01', NULL, '116', 'No'),
