(19888, 'C2303124002200030', 9, 220, '9', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that the excise duty amount of BDT 3,000/- was charged against the customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account. But due to insufficient account balance, it was not fully recovered from customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account earlier. Therefore, the said amount was charged as partial excise duty for the year 2022.', 'The excise duty amount of BDT 3,000/- was charged against the customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account. But due to insufficient account balance, it was not fully recovered from customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account earlier. Therefore, the said amount was charged as partial excise duty for the year 2022. We have already communicated with customer and informed him the same on 26-02-2023. Accordingly, We have replied to BB through letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/36 dated 20.03.23', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-21 17:13:59', '2023-03-21 17:13:59', NULL, '6', 'No'),
