(19985, 'C2303161006090007', 1, 1, '38', NULL, 'CC ref no - CC60821, we received the file on 7th march & given first query on 9th March for source O/S in documents & CIB unavailability. on 15th March query was solved by source but still CPV report was pending. After that we found out CSU has send CPV request with card number instead of CC ref no and due to that we were unable to find the CPV report from CPV portal. Today we have communicated with CVU (Central Verification unit) & found out the problem. Later We found CPV report with the help of CVU & sent the file to cards operation at 4.21 PM today after approval. It has been approved for BDT 6.5 lac with VISA Signature card. All the related mail are attached here.', 'CC ref no - CC60821, we received the file on 7th march & given first query on 9th March for source O/S in documents & CIB unavailability. on 15th March query was solved by source but still CPV report was pending. After that we found out CSU has send CPV request with card number instead of CC ref no and due to that we were unable to find the CPV report from CPV portal. Today we have communicated with CVU (Central Verification unit) & found out the problem. Later We found CPV report with the help of CVU & sent the file to cards operation at 4.21 PM today after approval. It has been approved for BDT 6.5 lac with VISA Signature card. All the related mail are attached here.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-22 17:06:11', '2023-03-22 17:06:11', NULL, '107', 'No'),
