(20028, 'C2303211006720028', 12, 672, '162', NULL, 'The client placed his stipulated cheque for crediting his credit card payment through BACH where there was mismatch found between figure & written inward on the cheque. Later on, the client attended at our branch on 20-03-2023 (as 17th & 18th March were holidays) to make necessary correction. We have placed the said corrected cheque as Regular Value on the same date through BACH & the same was passed in the evening session on 20-03-2023. We have credited the amount to the client\'s Credit Card account in the evening session on the same date (i.e. 20-03-2023). The amount was found uploaded in the client\'s Credit Card on the following morning & the client confirmed for the same.', 'Branch informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-23 14:30:30', '2023-03-23 14:30:30', NULL, '66', 'No'),
(20029, 'C2303211004790011', 12, 479, '162', NULL, 'The client placed his stipulated cheque for crediting his credit card payment through BACH where there was mismatch found between figure & written inward on the cheque. Later on, the client attended at our branch on 20-03-2023 (as 17th & 18th March were holidays) to make necessary correction. We have placed the said corrected cheque as Regular Value on the same date through BACH & the same was passed in the evening session on 20-03-2023. We have credited the amount to the client\'s Credit Card account in the evening session on the same date (i.e. 20-03-2023). The amount was found uploaded in the client\'s Credit Card on the following morning & the client confirmed for the same.', 'Branch informed the same to the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-23 14:31:32', '2023-03-23 14:31:32', NULL, '66', 'No'),
