(20199, 'C2303281006720050', 12, 672, '162', NULL, 'Branch reply: The card holder placed his cheque for payment against his credit card bill on 16-03-2023 at afternoon through bearer. But the cheque amount & inward found mismatched. Customer wrote in the cheque : \"One Lac Seventy Two Thousand Forty\" (missed Four Hundred). 17 & 18th March were holidays. Later on the client attended our branch on 20-03-2023, corrected the cheque for placement in the BACH. In the evening session the amount was passed & subsequently we have transferred the amount in the evening session on 20-03-2023. But the fund was found up on the following day. The fact is, that the client placed the cheque which was differed with inward & amount. but he is not ready to admit his such fault. Secondly, we have transferred the amount on 20-03-2023 (evening session, after successful passing of all BACH) but the rest of the works depends on our Card Division.', 'Branch communicated with the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-29 12:57:44', '2023-03-29 12:57:44', NULL, '66', 'No'),
