(20220, 'C2212202000940039', 6, 94, '42', NULL, 'One of our Agent Banking customer reported that his MTB account was credited and then debited without his intervention on December 8, 2022. According to his claim, this is not his money, he did do the transactions and did not use internet banking or mobile apps. Investigation reveals that other BankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s (Al Arafah Bank) customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account was debited and after that it was credited to the MTB accounts. The credited amount has been withdrew through Internet Banking to different account and bkash. The Concerned division investigated the issue and all the relevant emails are attached herewith. Madan Mahan Karmoker, Head of Agent Banking sent the issue to Audit and requested to initiate an audit regarding the issue. An Audit is being conducted by the ICC.', 'An Audit is being conducted by the ICC. Concerned division will take further actions as per audit recommendations.', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Internet Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-29 14:53:22', '2023-03-29 14:53:22', NULL, '6', 'No'),
