(20237, 'C2303141000930019', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Dr. DEBASHIS DEB (ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œMr. DEBASHISÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â) raised a complaint  informing that some transactions took place through his Mutual trust bank Credit card 498851******1428 at Nagad & Bkash on 18th February 2023 between 11:11 pm to 11:18 pm. Mr. DEBASHIS alleged that the transactions were not carried out by him. Our Card Fraud Risk management Team investigated the issue and found that customer\'s mobile was fully hacked by the fraudster and made the said transactions. These were 3D secured/ OTP verified transactions. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (01728517440) & registered email address debasis374@gmail.com and was submitted prior to executing each transaction. The detail investigation is attached herewith.', 'The customer allowed the fraudster to get access to his mobile, email and google drive and thatÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s why the transactions took place. Since the transactions were 3D secured/OTP based, the bank did not have any scope to decline the transactions. As such, the bank is not liable for these transactions. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 29.03.2023 which contains the Investigation report, forwarding letter and other supporting documents.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-03-30 11:00:45', '2023-03-30 11:00:45', NULL, '104', 'No'),
