(20331, 'C2212291002280048', 10, 444, '24', NULL, 'CardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s complain was regarding  VAT related issue, which was  associated with his Google transaction. We have explained several times that, we are unable to reverse it as per regulatory guideline and circular, but cardholder could not accept our statement and insist to reverse his VAT. However we finally contact with Bangladesh Bank for this particular issue & BB given us appointment  last week.  Finally we have visited BB, after discussion all things with  BB they didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t not provide us any guideline to reverse VAT. Today we have discussed the issue with cardholder, explained BBÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s statement and our position (not to reverse VAT) to cardholder. Now we have closed the issue from VOC.', 'CardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s complain was regarding  VAT related issue, which was  associated with his Google transaction. We have explained several times that, we are unable to reverse it as per regulatory guideline and circular, but cardholder could not accept our statement and insist to reverse his VAT. However we finally contact with Bangladesh Bank for this particular issue & BB given us appointment  last week.  Finally we have visited BB, after discussion all things with  BB they didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t not provide us any guideline to reverse VAT. Today we have discussed the issue with cardholder, explained BBÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s statement and our position (not to reverse VAT) to cardholder. Now we have closed the issue from VOC.', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-04-02 15:19:56', '2023-04-02 15:19:56', NULL, '104', 'No'),
