(20611, 'C2304051004040008', 8, 404, '18', NULL, 'Reply from card business: We value our customers and exceptional service is always our priority. Sincerely apologize to our respected customer MD Tariqul Islam for experiencing the problem with airport drop service on January 12, 2023. On that day, the customer asked the driver to stay opposite side of Jatrabari police station. But the traffic police did not allow the driver to stay on that busy road even though he stayed at that place. So the driver had to stay at another place. Tomorrow evening call to MD Tariqul Islam over phone. We sincerely apologize on behalf of our service provider for the way he was treated and unpleasant experience. Card holder accepts our apologies. Also our service provider made an apology call to customer. Rest assured, we have taken the necessary measures and have condemned the action against our service provider .', 'Card business has issued cautionary email to the company and sent a warning letter.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-04-09 16:50:16', '2023-04-09 16:50:16', NULL, '104', 'No'),
