(21117, 'C2304171006290021', 3, 44, '18', NULL, 'We informed the charge debited is solely for verification purpose and the card will not be billed. As for the registration we asked the client to refresh browser or clear the cache/history and try again. Also since the website is maintained by Loungekey they have a support mail as well. Since the error screenshot we received was not clear we couldn\'t forward it lounge key so we suggested If upon refreshing the browser the error remains client may send the error screenshot directly to lounge key to their support team. Thus The client asked to close the ticket', 'We informed the charge debited is solely for verification purpose and the card will not be billed. As for the registration we asked the client to refresh browser or clear the cache/history and try again. Also since the website is maintained by Loungekey they have a support mail as well. Since the error screenshot we received was not clear we couldn\'t forward it lounge key so we suggested If upon refreshing the browser the error remains client may send the error screenshot directly to lounge key to their support team. Thus The client asked to close the ticket', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-04-24 12:34:00', '2023-04-24 12:34:00', NULL, '104', 'No'),
