(21217, 'C2304061000930011', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'we have received the beneficiary details related documents from the acquiring bank. After receiving the document from acquiring bank, we have checked the Nagad account benefiary number (01981688309) and shared the benefiary number with the client. As client shared his card credential with the fraudster along with cards OTP, for these circumstances mentioned transaction was taken place. From this circumstances, we (bank) will not take any responsibility regarding this issue as customer card credential information was shared with the fraudster. We have advised the cardholder when needed, please replace the card through our branch or call center. If customer wants the benefiary details document, please share with him with the respective chaneel.Therefore, based on the above fact findings this review is being closed from our end.', 'we have received the beneficiary details related documents from the acquiring bank. After receiving the document from acquiring bank, we have checked the Nagad account benefiary number (01981688309) and shared the benefiary number with the client. As client shared his card credential with the fraudster along with cards OTP, for these circumstances mentioned transaction was taken place. From this circumstances, we (bank) will not take any responsibility regarding this issue as customer card credential information was shared with the fraudster. We have advised the cardholder when needed, please replace the card through our branch or call center. If customer wants the benefiary details document, please share with him with the respective chaneel.Therefore, based on the above fact findings this review is being closed from our end.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-04-26 11:43:32', '2023-04-26 11:43:32', NULL, '104', 'No'),
