(21487, 'C2304152006080017', 14, 608, '162', NULL, 'We have communicated with the client. Later on the client attended at our branch premises on 16-04-2023. Then she placed an application to change her cell phone number against her Debit Card. Though she is a client of our Principal Branch but as a part of global banking, we have taken the service on our shoulder, leading to solve her application communicating with our Principal Branch. We served her as maximum. We have also offered a Credit Card as a part of cross selling. The client was very much happy & finally expressed her satisfaction regarding our services.', 'We have communicated with the client. Later on the client attended at our branch premises on 16-04-2023. Then she placed an application to change her cell phone number against her Debit Card. Though she is a client of our Principal Branch but as a part of global banking, we have taken the service on our shoulder, leading to solve her application communicating with our Principal Branch. We served her as maximum. We have also offered a Credit Card as a part of cross selling. The client was very much happy & finally expressed her satisfaction regarding our services.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-02 17:15:48', '2023-05-02 17:15:48', NULL, '66', 'No'),
