(21511, 'C2303171000930007', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'There was another fraud transaction on this card from the same merchant on 14/2/2023. Cardholder raise the issue to contact center with VOC C2302171000930006. But card was NOT properly blocked that time. As a result, the second transaction was approved on 16/03/23. As per visa if a transaction previously reported as fraud to visa, we donÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t have further chargeback right under fraud category if another transaction approved from the same card. Visa assume that the issuer blocked the card at the time of first fraud transaction.', 'Contact Center has already informed this issue to customer regarding the resolution', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-03 15:32:34', '2023-05-03 15:32:34', NULL, '104', 'No'),
