(21553, 'C2304262004670002', 14, 583, '170', NULL, 'Actually client has requested us for changing his mobile number and he wanted to use the smart app. We did change the mobile number and as a current account holder he was advised to apply through our web as per procedure. But he actually could not understand then and even didn\'t called us while failed to do so. Generally we offer our phone number to most of the clients regarding any assistance, specially if faces any problem to use card or app. So we communicated with him again where he said the same, that he wanted to use our app. So we requested him to visit branch so that we can assist him to perform the procedure.', 'Actually client has requested us for changing his mobile number and he wanted to use the smart app. We did change the mobile number and as a current account holder he was advised to apply through our web as per procedure. But he actually could not understand then and even didn\'t called us while failed to do so. Generally we offer our phone number to most of the clients regarding any assistance, specially if faces any problem to use card or app. So we communicated with him again where he said the same, that he wanted to use our app. So we requested him to visit branch so that we can assist him to perform the procedure.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-07 10:16:02', '2023-05-07 10:16:02', NULL, '16', 'No'),
