(21842, 'C2304213006950010', 6, 695, '298', NULL, 'Dear Concern, here enclosed files are the relevant documents as we received from acquiring bank. After receiving the document from acquiring bank, they confirmed the beneficiary Bkash wallet is ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œ01946655829ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â belongs to MD. MOSHAROF HOSSAIN. Customer informed us that he identified the actual person his friend Tawfiq who transfer these transactions using the customer card number, expiry date, CVV number and OTP. For this circumstances, customer friend Tawfiq was making the online transactions. Please be informed that mentioned transactions were 3D secured /OTP based transactions, so that, bank will not take any liability as 3D secured /OTP based transactions. We have already been informed to the client accordingly. Client informed us that Mr. Tawfiq already resolved the issue with the customer. Therefore, based on the above fact findings this review is being closed from our end.', 'Dear Concern, here enclosed files are the relevant documents as we received from acquiring bank. After receiving the document from acquiring bank, they confirmed the beneficiary Bkash wallet is ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œ01946655829ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â belongs to MD. MOSHAROF HOSSAIN. Customer informed us that he identified the actual person his friend Tawfiq who transfer these transactions using the customer card number, expiry date, CVV number and OTP. For this circumstances, customer friend Tawfiq was making the online transactions. Please be informed that mentioned transactions were 3D secured /OTP based transactions, so that, bank will not take any liability as 3D secured /OTP based transactions. We have already been informed to the client accordingly. Client informed us that Mr. Tawfiq already resolved the issue with the customer. Therefore, based on the above fact findings this review is being closed from our end.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-10 1