(22022, 'C2305031002190043', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that cardholder made the mentioned online transactions at the website (https://www.namecheap.com) and merchant categories for these transactions were computer programming, data processing, integrated systems, and design services. Therefore, NBR VAT was imposed against the transactions. It is mentionable here that, bank imposes VAT on the transactions that are associated with internet service as per BRPD Circular Letter no 04 dated 03/03/2019', 'Cardholder made the mentioned online transactions at the website (https://www.namecheap.com) and merchant categories for these transactions were computer programming, data processing, integrated systems, and design services. Therefore, NBR VAT was imposed against the transactions. It is mentionable here that, bank imposes VAT on the transactions that are associated with internet service as per BRPD Circular Letter no 04 dated 03/03/2019. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh Bank through letter dated 11 may 2023 (attached).', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-15 10:28:54', '2023-05-15 10:28:54', NULL, '104', 'No'),
