(22028, 'C2305032004830051', 12, 483, '205', NULL, 'We have checked the issue at our end and found out that due to insufficient funds in the source account on 20-03-23, the installment of customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s brick-by-brick account could not be debited. We have communicated with customer regarding the issue and updated him. Later on, customer closed his brick-by-brick account on 28-03-23.', 'We have checked the issue at our end and found out that due to insufficient funds in the source account on 20-03-23, the installment of customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s brick-by-brick account could not be debited. We have communicated with customer regarding the issue and updated him. Later on, customer closed his brick-by-brick account on 28-03-23. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through letter dated 09 May 2023 (Attached)', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-15 10:50:02', '2023-05-15 10:50:02', NULL, '78', 'No'),
