(22030, 'C2305031005840050', 14, 584, '20', NULL, 'We have investigated the issue with the co-operation of our concerned division. Customer has applied for card product conversion on 12/03/2023. As per bankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s process, if any card product is changed, the existing one will be blocked/cancelled. Accordingly, customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s existing card was cancelled and a new card was issued on 13/03/2023.  After that, the new card was dispatched to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s address on 14/03/2023 but it was returned to us from courier service on 16/03/2023 due to address issue. Later on, we sent the returned card to MTB Pallabi branch as per customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request and he has already activated his new card on 24/04/2023. In the meantime, customer visited MTB lounge with his previous card and could not avail the complementary lounge access because the card was inactive by then. Hence, no lounge fee was charged against the MTB card.', 'We have investigated the issue with the co-operation of our concerned division. Customer has applied for card product conversion on 12/03/2023. As per bankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s process, if any card product is changed, the existing one will be blocked/cancelled. Accordingly, customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s existing card was cancelled and a new card was issued on 13/03/2023.  After that, the new card was dispatched to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s address on 14/03/2023 but it was returned to us from courier service on 16/03/2023 due to address issue. Later on, we sent the returned card to MTB Pallabi branch as per customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request and he has already activated his new card on 24/04/2023. In the meantime, customer visited MTB lounge with his previous card and could not avail the complementary lounge access because the card was inactive by then. Hence, no lounge fee was charged against the MTB card. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through letter dated 11 May 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-15 10:57:54', '2023-05-15 10:57:54', NULL, '104', 'No'),
