(22465, 'C2305081000930061', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Dear Concern, here enclosed files is the relevant document as we received from acquiring bank. After receiving the document from acquiring bank, the transactions of the Nagad account benefiary number is (01917759431). As per our previous conversation with the primary cardholder that Fraudster called to the customer through (+16219) number and took all card credentials from the Card member including card CVV and OTP. Our cardholder shared all card credential with the fraudster, for these circumstances mentioned transactions was taken place. We informed the client that bank will not take any responsibility as the mentioned transaction was 3D secured OTP based transaction & our customer shared his card credential information with the fraudster. Customer informed us that he wants the benefiary details document, please share with him with the respective channel.Therefore, based on the above fact findings this review is being closed from our end.', 'CC informed the customer accordingly.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-24 12:12:31', '2023-05-24 12:12:31', NULL, '104', 'No'),
