(22553, 'N2305220012', 18, 498, '308', NULL, 'The mentioned client is a freelancer and freelancers are not eligible for 2.5% cash incentive as per Bangladesh Bank circular number FEPD(LDA)/147(1)/2019-7600, dated 07.10.2019, point no- 4. As a freelancer, the client may be eligible for 4% cash incentive as per Bangladesh Bank FE circular no. 29 dated 20.09.2021. To avail the same, the captioned client needs to comply with the terms & conditions of the circular and submit all the required documents.', 'The mentioned client is a freelancer and freelancers are not eligible for 2.5% cash incentive as per Bangladesh Bank circular number FEPD(LDA)/147(1)/2019-7600, dated 07.10.2019, point no- 4. As a freelancer, the client may be eligible for 4% cash incentive as per Bangladesh Bank FE circular no. 29 dated 20.09.2021. To avail the same, the captioned client needs to comply with the terms & conditions of the circular and submit all the required documents. Accordingly, we have replied back to Bangladesh bank through email dated 25 may 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-25 18:13:46', '2023-05-25 18:13:46', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(22554, 'C2305241005840020', 14, 589, '202', NULL, '-	Our RM checked his previous passport along with valid passport where has found valid endorse amount of $ 1248.82 on new passport and some endorsement in different date of expiry on his previous passport & he process for further endorse from our end rest $ 9500.  Since proper checking of the passport & invalid endorsement of USD; I think our RM has at least minimum knowledge about the endorsement.\r\n\r\n-	VOC has return the request on dated 18.05.2023 due unable to execute the endorsement request because already $12000 quota has violated. (mail attached)\r\n\r\n-	RM also talk with respective department regarding the return issue & let him advice to cancel the previous endorsement of expired passport (27.03.2023) from other bank.\r\n-	Then branch RM convey the issue to client & request to make the available endorsement limit/room as per BB policy i.e. up to USD 12000.', 'Customer lives in Dhaka & Branch personally talked with him over the phone. Hope client is convinced & withdraw the complaint.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-28 10:27:29', '2023-05-28 10:27:29', NULL, '50', 'No'),
