(22560, 'N2305220001', 6, 326, '248', NULL, 'Dear Sir, Greetings from MTB Cumilla branch! This is to inform you that the following complain has been raised from the customer regarding BGDCL bill. we investigate the whole issue and checked the voucher and found deposited taka 6825/- only, we communicated with BGDCL team they shown the received copy of voucher to us where contains 6825/- not 68000/- . In addition we totally close manual bill collection A/C of BGDCL from 09 February 2022. started online bill receive from February 2022 after that we did not receive any single offline bill. Otherwise, they deposited the all utility bill by Caretaker Mr. Joynal (who abscond from April 2023 with large amount of money, which published in local newspaper named ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œ The daily Ruposhi Bangla ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œ dated:14/05/2023 (Copy Attached)} and they complained with GD at Jorarganj Thana Chattogram against him. We checked the all video footage 15 January,2023 & 14 February, 2023 and found no body deposit the offline Gas bill . We also found that, Our Receive Register and BGDCL voucher all are same amount. But they give fake Gas Bill voucher with duplicate our bank seal and bank official sign. In this circumstances, we declared that there is no fraud & forgery by Bank. I attached the sample one copy bill and paper cutting for your kind attention.', 'Dear Sir, Greetings from MTB Cumilla branch! This is to inform you that the following complain has been raised from the customer regarding BGDCL bill. we investigate the whole issue and checked the voucher and found deposited taka 6825/- only, we communicated with BGDCL team they shown the received copy of voucher to us where contains 6825/- not 68000/- . In addition we totally close manual bill collection A/C of BGDCL from 09 February 2022. started online bill receive from February 2022 after that we did not receive any single offline bill. Otherwise, they deposited the all utility bill by Caretaker Mr. Joynal (who abscond from April 2023 with large amount of money, which published in local newspaper named ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œ The daily Ruposhi Bangla ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œ dated:14/05/2023 (Copy Attached)} and they complained with GD at Jorarganj Thana Chattogram against him. We checked the all video footage 15 January,2023 & 14 February, 2023 and found no body deposit the offline Gas bill . We also found that, Our Receive Register and BGDCL voucher all are same amount. But they give fake Gas Bill voucher with duplicate our bank seal and bank official sign. In this circumstances, we declared that there is no fraud & forgery by Bank. I attached the sample one copy bill and paper cutting for your kind attention.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-05-28 11:19:57', '2023-05-28 11:19:57', NULL, '57', 'No'),
