(23102, 'C2305221004260031', 12, 672, '24', NULL, 'Available balance (for USD transaction/deposit) depends on dollar rate. Meaning increment in dollar rate from previous day systematically reduce available balance & vice-versa. For card payment, two system (CBS & CMS) usages different rate as per management decision. For example, rate in CBS 109 (card settlement rate) where rate in CMS 108 (rate from VISA online). Hence cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s deposited amount in taka (against equivalent USD) may not be added always to previous available of the card. However, Credit cardholder can check his/her billing statement and inform bank if any anomalies found.', 'CC informed the customer through email.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-12 16:55:51', '2023-06-12 16:55:51', NULL, '104', 'No'),
