(23284, 'C2304081000930036', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'as customer denied the online transaction happened at Nagad & Bkash. Please be informed that mentioned transactions were 3D secured E-commerce transaction. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801711382158) & registered email address dr.mohitul@yahoo.com. That means using the card credentials mentioned transactions was took place. This is not under fraud purview. We have talked to the client regarding the complaint issue and client informed us that he was received a call from (+8809604016219) in his registered mobile number and fraudster informed had made a transaction at Sailor (EPYLLION HOLDINGS LTD,CHATTOGRAM,BD) amounting BDT 4498.00 on 22/12/22 with his MTB credit card. The caller also informed that the customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card was currently blocked due to security reason since some fraud incidents took place on that day at Sailor. The caller finally said that bank would call him later & unblock the card. Cardholder informed us that he shared Card number including CVV Number, expiry date with the Fraudster. For this circumstances mentioned transactions were taken place. We informed client bank will not take any liabilities as the mentioned transactions were 3D secured OTP based transactions and client shared card credential with the fraudster.as customer wants the benefiary document and we will mail the acquiring bank to share with us the relevant documents where the mentioned amount was transferred. For receiving this type of relevant documents we have to wait 7-30 days minimum.', 'We have already informed customer regading this feedback through e-mail.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-18 11:28:48', '2023-06-18 11:28:48', NULL, '104', 'Yes'),
(23285, 'C2305021000930049', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'mentioned transaction is 3D secured E-commerce transaction. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801725997951) prior executing this transaction. That means using the card credentials mentioned transaction was took place. Customer informed that he was received a call from (+809604016219) and he shared the card credential with the fraudster including OTP for the changes of Pin from 4 digit to 6-digit purpose. We informed client that bank will not take any liability as client shared the card credential with the fraudster. Customer wants the benefiary document and we will mail the acquiring bank to share with us the relevant documents where the mentioned amount was transferred. For receiving this type of relevant documents, we have to wait 7-30 days minimum.', 'Already sent the attachment to customer e-mail.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-18 11:33:41', '2023-06-18 11:33:41', NULL, '104', 'No'),
