(23386, 'C2305251006650017', 13, 665, '18', NULL, 'on March 01, 2023 opening balance of her LBMS was 29150, till March 01 to May 22 the client redeemed total 58,650 points on annual charge waiver and supplementary card charge waiver multiple times on multiple dates. As Multiple redemption on annual charge is not permitted our ops team reversed the same 58650 points on different dates (the very next day) of the points redeemed. Lastly on 22 May the client made a 29000 point redemption on card bill payment which was allowed So the only transaction really executed was 29000 on card payment, Thus her opening balance 29150 was debited by 29000; 29150-29000=150 is currently on her account.', 'CC tried to reach the customer but failed.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-19 13:16:35', '2023-06-19 15:04:05', NULL, '104', 'Yes'),
(23387, 'C2305121006650023', 13, 665, '18', NULL, 'As per campaign terms and condition customer will get in total 10x point. We have checked and found that customer already get (126+130)=256 point from his txn date. After that he got rest of the point 1024. Calculation (Total=256+1024=1280 points).', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-19 13:29:13', '2023-06-19 13:29:13', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(23388, 'C2305166000630016', 4, 63, '98', NULL, 'We found information not matched with previous account. For example, currently registered account number :1301000109968, Account Name: SHAH ALAM STORE. where as previous registered number was 1311000844207 [MOHINUR RAHMAN PIAS]. As information not matching we need proper official confirmation to add virtual card.\" So currenly if customer using 2 different account then suggest him to visit branch and submit a official form to add his payplus card with his current internet banking service as there was an missmatch with his card and account number.', 'We found information not matched with previous account. For example, currently registered account number :1301000109968, Account Name: SHAH ALAM STORE. where as previous registered number was 1311000844207 [MOHINUR RAHMAN PIAS]. As information not matching we need proper official confirmation to add virtual card.\" So currenly if customer using 2 different account then suggest him to visit branch and submit a official form to add his payplus card with his current internet banking service as there was an missmatch with his card and account number.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Internet Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-19 13:49:36', '2023-06-19 13:49:36', NULL, '6', 'No'),
