(23683, 'C2306191006650028', 13, 665, '18', NULL, 'Refer to our comments on previous ticket C2305251006650017, we already mentioned client\'s actual initial points were 29150. The client had multiple annual fee charge redemption which is not allowed. On 16 may She redeemed 19,550 from initial 29,150 points then on next day we reversed the same thus returning the balance to 29,150 . Then again on 17 May she redeemed 19,550 from 29,150 and we returned back the same returning balance to 29150 then on 21 May the same happened. So all her transactions were made on the initial 29150 points. The only transaction that was allowed was 29000 on 22 May which was a card bill payment. Thus point balance (29150-29000=150)', 'Several times Contact Center had tried to reach but somehow customer was unreachable', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-26 12:05:51', '2023-06-26 12:05:51', NULL, '104', 'Yes'),
(23684, 'C2306201006720036', 4, 66, '98', NULL, 'According to investigation it seems user successfully use card payment for the yaqeen account 9991010025734 dated 2023-06-23 11:55:48. However we found one failed transaction from the same account dated 2023-06-20 17:11:59. that seems temporary account validation issue between internet banking and yaqeen API.', 'According to investigation it seems user successfully use card payment for the yaqeen account 9991010025734 dated 2023-06-23 11:55:48. However we found one failed transaction from the same account dated 2023-06-20 17:11:59. that seems temporary account validation issue between internet banking and yaqeen API.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Internet Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-26 12:06:41', '2023-06-26 12:06:41', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(23685, 'C2306125000860024', 6, 86, '298', NULL, 'Dear Concern, after receiving the document from acquiring bank, the transactions of the Bkash account benefiary number is (01406986177) belongs to Mst. Sheka Begum. Please be informed that mentioned transaction was 3D secured E-commerce transaction. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801762780127) prior executing this transaction. That means using the card credentials mentioned transaction was taken place. This is not under fraud purview. Our team already talked with the client regarding this issue and informed the client that mentioned transactions were 3D secured /OTP based transactions. We informed client that bank will not take any liability as 3D secured /OTP based transactions. Customer informed us that he wants the benefiary details document, we already shared with him the beneficiary number verbally. We also informed the client that kindly replace the card through our branch or call center. Therefore, based on the above fact findings this review is being closed from our end.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-26 12:07:52', '2023-06-26 12:07:52', NULL, '104', 'No'),
