(23734, 'C2306203007300030', 18, 730, '19', NULL, 'we have checked the issue and found that the mentioned customer made an ATM transaction on 03-05-2023 at Islami Bank Jamalpur ATM booth using his MTB Debit Card. However, the transaction was unsuccessful.', 'The mentioned customer made an ATM transaction on 03-05-2023 at Islami Bank Jamalpur ATM booth using his MTB Debit Card. However, the transaction was unsuccessful. Customer informed the issue to our contact centre on the same day. After necessary processing, the amount was reversed to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account on 10-05-2023. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 26.06.23 (Email attached).', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-26 15:59:19', '2023-06-26 15:59:19', NULL, '104', 'No'),
