(23737, 'C2306201006290024', 13, 629, '18', NULL, 'we have checked the issue and found that the mentioned card holder was the winner of our Ramadan spending campaign program. Being the winner, he received SMS for booking his reservation at the selected hotel. As per campaign policy, the winners were supposed to call for the reservation on the next day of receiving SMS but the said card holder called on the same day due to which he did not get confirmation. However, later customer made another call on the following day of receiving the SMS and his reservation was confirmed accordingly.', 'we have checked the issue and found that the mentioned card holder was the winner of our Ramadan spending campaign program. Being the winner, he received SMS for booking his reservation at the selected hotel. As per campaign policy, the winners were supposed to call for the reservation on the next day of receiving SMS but the said card holder called on the same day due to which he did not get confirmation. However, later customer made another call on the following day of receiving the SMS and his reservation was confirmed accordingly. We have replied to Bangladesh bank through letter dated 25.06.23', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-06-26 16:26:11', '2023-06-26 16:26:11', NULL, '104', 'No'),
