(24078, 'C2306201002280027', 9, 204, '20', NULL, 'we have checked the issue and found out that the mentioned customer applied for his MTB card under a 50% annual fee waiver campaign. But his card was issued after the campaign period. Therefore, 100% annual fee was charged against the said card.', 'we have checked the issue and found out that the mentioned customer applied for his MTB card under a 50% annual fee waiver campaign. But his card was issued after the campaign period. Therefore, 100% annual fee was charged against the said card. However, based on customer request, we will waive 50% annual fee as an exception. Our concerned division has already informed customer about it. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 06.07.23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-06 16:37:36', '2023-07-06 16:37:36', NULL, '104', 'No'),
