(24083, 'N2306210005', 6, 88, '236', NULL, 'Mr. Majedul Islam applied for a credit card at our Dhanmondi Branch. But as per the CIB report, he has 4 other loans at Brac Bank. After reviewing the report, our concerned branch requested for few documents (Sanction advices of 04 loans, NOC, visiting cards etc) but applicant failed to provide with the required documents. Upon asked again, he informed that he had only applied for those loans in Brac Bank but did not avail yet. The applicant also did not meet other queries that were asked for. In addition, while third party CPV was done, they did not get the applicant over call. Due to the above reasons and circumstances, the credit card request was declined.', 'Mr. Majedul Islam applied for a credit card at our Dhanmondi Branch. But as per the CIB report, he has 4 other loans at Brac Bank. After reviewing the report, our concerned branch requested for few documents (Sanction advices of 04 loans, NOC, visiting cards etc) but applicant failed to provide with the required documents. Upon asked again, he informed that he had only applied for those loans in Brac Bank but did not avail yet. The applicant also did not meet other queries that were asked for. In addition, while third party CPV was done, they did not get the applicant over call. Due to the above reasons and circumstances, the credit card request was declined. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 06.07.23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-06 16:47:00', '2023-07-06 16:47:00', NULL, '142', 'No'),
(24084, 'C2306221005000042', 18, 500, '19', NULL, 'the customer made a transaction on 26-08-22 at DOMINOS and due to cancellation of order, the merchant refunded the amount.  But the acquiring bank (EBL) did not process the reversal on due time. However, based on customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s complaint, our concerned division communicated with the acquiring bank (EBL) and they processed the reversal.', 'The customer made a transaction on 26-08-22 at DOMINOS and due to cancellation of order, the merchant refunded the amount.  But the acquiring bank (EBL) did not process the reversal on due time. However, based on customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s complaint, our concerned division communicated with the acquiring bank (EBL) and they processed the reversal. Accordingly, the amount was refunded to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account on 02-07-2023. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 06.07.23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-06 16:54:29', '2023-07-06 16:54:29', NULL, '104', 'No'),
