(24086, 'C2306222004980041', 18, 498, '308', NULL, 'The mentioned transaction has been routed through Jamuna Bank Limited by BEFTN channel. As such, Jamuna Bank is entitled to disburse 2.5% Government Cash Incentive. Additionally, we have communicated with Jamuna bank after getting the customer compliant. But according to them, they are unable to disburse the same as the account title was non-individual (Apa BD) in this case. Customer may communicate with Jamuna Bank to get it solved.', 'The mentioned transaction has been routed through Jamuna Bank Limited by BEFTN channel. As such, Jamuna Bank is entitled to disburse 2.5% Government Cash Incentive. Additionally, we have communicated with Jamuna bank after getting the customer compliant. But according to them, they are unable to disburse the same as the account title was non-individual (Apa BD) in this case. Customer may communicate with Jamuna Bank to get it solved. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 06.07.23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-06 16:59:20', '2023-07-06 16:59:20', NULL, '105', 'No'),
