(24102, 'C2306283006950043', 6, 695, '298', NULL, 'FRMU has contacted and discussed with complaint and MTB customer Mr. MD. YOUNUS regarding his disputed transactions at nagad.com.bd and found the below mentioned feedback: ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Disputed transactions were e-commerce transactions happened at nagad.com on dated 28-06-23 total amount of BDT 50,000.00 ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ These were 3D secured/ OTP verified transactions. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801630634139) prior executing these transactions. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ The nature of service is ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œAdd money from card to NagadÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Fraudster called to the customer through (01979632368) number and our cardholder shared both side card photo with the fraudster and shared the OTP with the fraudster. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ It was 3D secured/ OTP verified transactions. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801630634139) prior executing the transactions. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ The nature of service is ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œAdd money from card to NagadÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ We have contacted the respective Acquiring Bank and requested for the Nagad beneficiary account details. They confirmed the first beneficiary Nagad wallet is ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œ01923563872ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â & another one beneficiary Nagad wallet is ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œ01983174506ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â. (Attach document) ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ We have communicated and share our findings with cardholder regarding disputed transactions at Nagad. Cardholders understand that Mutual trust bank will not take any liabilities for such kind of OTP based 3D secured transaction. The cardholder is solely responsible for this incident and the bank will not be responsible under any circumstances. We have advised the cardholder when needed, please replace the card through our branch or call center. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Therefore, based on the above fact findings this review is being closed from FRMU end.', 'Contact Center has already informed this issue to customer regarding the resolution', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-09 10:25:55', '2023-07-09 10:25:55', NULL, '104', 'No'),
