(24185, 'C2307013006950014', 6, 695, '298', NULL, 'mentioned transaction was 3D secured E-commerce transaction. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801611486669) prior executing this transaction. Customer informed us that fraudster was calling (01995704793) this number related to Bang bazar fire issue as customer is a shopkeeper of Bang bazar market and he shared his card Photo both sides with the other persons to the fraudster end through emu. After that client shared his OTP with the fraudster. For these circumstances mentioned transactions was taken place. Please be informed that mentioned transaction was 3D secured /OTP based transaction, so that, bank will not take any liability as 3D secured /OTP based transaction. We have communicated and share our findings with cardholder regarding disputed transactions at Nagad. Cardholder understand that Mutual trust bank will not take any liabilities for such kind of OTP based 3D secured transaction.', 'OB informed customer accordingly', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-10 15:11:25', '2023-07-10 15:11:25', NULL, '104', 'No'),
