(24201, 'C2306262000940057', 6, 94, '298', NULL, 'FRMU has contacted and discussed with complaint and MTB customer Mr. MD. FORHAD HOSAN regarding his disputed transactions at bKash and found the below mentioned feedback: ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Disputed transactions were e-commerce transactions happened at nagad.com on dated 26-06-23 total amount of BDT 24,887ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¬.00 ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ These were 3D secured/ OTP verified transactions. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801763112878) prior executing these transactions. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ The nature of service is ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œAdd money from card to bKashÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Fraudster called to the customer through (01324910240) introduced themselves that they were calling from government institutions and give customer allowances for his wife. Our cardholder shared the full Card number including CVV Number, expiry date & OTP with the Fraudster. For these circumstances mentioned transactions were taken place. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ We have contacted the respective Acquiring Bank and requested for the Bkash beneficiary account details. They confirmed the beneficiary Bkash wallet is 01885528424ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â belongs to AL AMIN. (Attach document) ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ We have communicated and share our findings with cardholder regarding disputed transactions at Bkash. Cardholder understand that Mutual trust bank will not take any liabilities for such kind of OTP based 3D secured transaction. The cardholder is solely responsible for this incident and the bank will not be responsible under any circumstances. We have advised the cardholder when needed, please replace the card through our branch or call center. If customer wants the relevant document, please share the document with respective channel.', 'We have already send the documents to customer e-mail. Here is also attached the e-mail.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-11 11:40:51', '2023-07-11 11:40:51', NULL, '104', 'No'),
