(24237, 'C2307052004030024', 8, 403, '277', NULL, 'Branch reply: 	Regarding the above complaint, you are informed that, Millennium Debit Master Card (5236 4100 0001 2654) of the said customer is captured at our MTB Dhanbari SME/Agri Branch ATM Booth on 02-07-2023. In that event, when the client complains to our branch, he is informed that the mentioned captured card will be destroyed as per the Bangladesh Bank policy and MTB Captured Card Policy and the card has been destroyed and reported to the concern department. It is to be mentionable that, our branch manager Sir explained the card policy matter very well by giving special importance to him as a customer. But the customer wants to return the capture card in any way and our branch officials unable to return it by showing reason of legal obligation. After receiving the complaint, we have contracted the customer to explained the matter and now he understood the matter and satisfied. We will be more careful and aware about customer communication in future.', 'Branch communicated with the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-11 12:50:26', '2023-07-11 12:50:26', NULL, '131', 'No'),
