(24243, 'C2307052004030036', 14, 583, '131', NULL, 'On 05.07.2023 at 12 a.m the mentioned customer deposited BDT-85,000/- in his account bearing no -9991010016511. In the same day he issued 8 (Eight) cheques of total amounting BDT 85,000/- favouring him and sent the cheques to the branch through his wife for payment later. when his wife presents the cheques before cash counter then branch officials was communicated with the customer over phone to ensure payment and advised him very politely that as he issued 8 (Eight) cheques in his name and money to be withdrawn by cash through his wife, he may issue one cheque instead of eight cheque for withdrawal of same money. After that branch honored the aforesaid eight cheques and paid the money to his wife. No bank official told him in a rough way. Branch officials always serve the customers by maintaining professionalism.', 'Several times Contact Center had tried to reach but somehow customer was unreachable', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-11 12:53:58', '2023-07-11 12:53:58', NULL, '125', 'Yes'),
