(24357, 'C2306221000930029', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'the mentioned card holder raised a complaint to our contact centre on 01-06-2023 regarding an unauthorized transaction made through his MTB Credit card. Accordingly, chargeback was initiated for the disputed transaction as the client denied the transaction. According to the VISA/MC/CUP dispute settlement procedure, usually it takes minimum 45 days from the claimed date to get feedback. We have informed the customer via email and kept him updated regarding the timeline.', 'the mentioned card holder raised a complaint to our contact centre on 01-06-2023 regarding an unauthorized transaction made through his MTB Credit card. Accordingly, chargeback was initiated for the disputed transaction as the client denied the transaction. According to the VISA/MC/CUP dispute settlement procedure, usually it takes minimum 45 days from the claimed date to get feedback. We have informed the customer via email and kept him updated regarding the timeline. Finally, the mentioned amount has been settled to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card account on 02-07-2023 and we informed customer about it over the phone and via email on 06-07-2023. We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 12 July 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-13 11:14:04', '2023-07-13 11:14:04', NULL, '104', 'No'),
