(24391, 'N2307040008', 18, 498, '308', NULL, 'in order to make sure that the mentioned remittance was wage earners, our concerned division requested for necessary documents (i.e. remitter Passport and valid visa etc.) from the beneficiary. Accordingly, the beneficiary provided with the required documents on 07.06.2023 at 11:12 pm. After verifying/scrutinizing the senderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s documents, the incentive amount of BDT 2750/- was credited to the respective beneficiary account on 13-06-2023.', 'in order to make sure that the mentioned remittance was wage earners, our concerned division requested for necessary documents (i.e. remitter Passport and valid visa etc.) from the beneficiary. Accordingly, the beneficiary provided with the required documents on 07.06.2023 at 11:12 pm. After verifying/scrutinizing the senderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s documents, the incentive amount of BDT 2750/- was credited to the respective beneficiary account on 13-06-2023. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 12 July 23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-13 14:48:57', '2023-07-13 14:48:57', NULL, '105', 'No'),
