(24403, 'C2307054000920028', 6, 92, '218', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that Mr. A. K. Faruque Ahmed, S/O- A.K. Fayez Ahmed has been availing a MTB Personal Loan and a MTB Platinum Credit Card facility from Mutual Trust Bank, CoxÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Bazar Branch. Recently, the above mentioned customer has applied for top up of his existing loan facility in our bank. To expedite the process, we have collected customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s CIB report and observed that another two loans are showing in his CIB Report (CIB report attached). Therefore, we have requested customer to provide the loan statements and sanction advices of the other 02 loans which he is availing from another bank. However, he could not provide the documents. As per customer, he does not have any other loans except the loan and credit card from MTB which he declared before.', 'Mr. A. K. Faruque Ahmed, S/O- A.K. Fayez Ahmed has been availing a MTB Personal Loan and a MTB Platinum Credit Card facility from Mutual Trust Bank, CoxÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Bazar Branch. Recently, the above mentioned customer has applied for top up of his existing loan facility in our bank. To expedite the process, we have collected customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s CIB report and observed that another two loans are showing in his CIB Report (CIB report attached). Therefore, we have requested customer to provide the loan statements and sanction advices of the other 02 loans which he is availing from another bank. However, he could not provide the documents. As per customer, he does not have any other loans except the loan and credit card from MTB which he declared before. It is mentionable here that, the customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s top up loan application has been declined due to high DBR issue. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 12 July 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-13 16:47:18', '2023-07-13 16:47:18', NULL, '52', 'No'),
(24404, 'C2307041002040035', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'we have checked the issue and found out that SMS banking fee was imposed against the credit card of Mr. Avishek Das on 29-12-2022 as per schedule of charges of the bank but cardholder did not pay the SMS banking fee for 04 consecutive months. Our concerned division sent statements and SMS for payment to the cardholder regularly but due to non-payment, late payment fee and interest were imposed. However, based on customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request, our concerned division reversed 02 late payment fees worth BDT 1,840/- and informed customer to pay the rest of the amount. Customer agreed and paid the remaining outstanding bill on 08-06-2023.', 'we have checked the issue and found out that SMS banking fee was imposed against the credit card of Mr. Avishek Das on 29-12-2022 as per schedule of charges of the bank but cardholder did not pay the SMS banking fee for 04 consecutive months. Our concerned division sent statements and SMS for payment to the cardholder regularly but due to non-payment, late payment fee and interest were imposed. However, based on customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request, our concerned division reversed 02 late payment fees worth BDT 1,840/- and informed customer to pay the rest of the amount. Customer agreed and paid the remaining outstanding bill on 08-06-2023. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 12 July 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-13 16:52:09', '2023-07-13 16:52:09', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(24405, 'C2307041000930043', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'the mentioned cardholder made call to our Contact Centre on 19-04-2023 regarding an unauthorized transaction of BDT 16,730.78 made through his MTB Credit card. After investigation, our concerned division initiated a chargeback for the mentioned dispute transaction and the amount was given to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card account on 17-05-2023 as the transaction was non 3DS transaction. Please note that, the mentioned card has also been replaced accordingly.', 'the mentioned cardholder made call to our Contact Centre on 19-04-2023 regarding an unauthorized transaction of BDT 16,730.78 made through his MTB Credit card. After investigation, our concerned division initiated a chargeback for the mentioned dispute transaction and the amount was given to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card account on 17-05-2023 as the transaction was non 3DS transaction. Please note that, the mentioned card has also been replaced accordingly. We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 12 July 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-13 17:00:13', '2023-07-13 17:00:13', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(24406, 'C2307041005000042', 18, 500, '19', NULL, 'Mr. Sajib Datta placed a chargeback request on 17.04.2023. Based on cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request, our concerned division processed chargeback request to VISA but the claim was declined by the acquiring bank/merchant since the cardholder availed the service. The merchant has also provided with the screenshot of email communication between the cardholder and merchant, which proves that the service was registered on cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s name and used by him.\r\n\r\nOur concerned division had communicated with the cardholder and informed him about the feedback from the merchant. Since cardholder did not provide any document or proof to support his claim to get refund, no further action could be taken. We have advised cardholder to communicate with the merchant to resolve the dispute.', 'Our concerned division had communicated with the cardholder and informed him about the feedback from the merchant. Since cardholder did not provide any document or proof to support his claim to get refund, no further action could be taken. We have advised cardholder to communicate with the merchant to resolve the dispute. Accordingly, We have replied to BB through email dated 12 July 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-13 17:04:21', '2023-07-13 17:04:21', NULL, '104', 'No'),
