(24674, 'C2307141000930019', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'mentioned transactions were 3D secured E-commerce transaction. Record shows that the pertinent OTP was delivered into customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s registered mobile number (8801732416533) prior executing these transactions. That means using the full card number, expiry date, and CVV & OTP mentioned transactions was taken place. This is not under fraud purview. Please be informed that mentioned transaction was 3D secured /OTP based transaction, so that, bank will not take any liability as 3D secured /OTP based transaction. Mutual trust bank will not take any liabilities for such kind of OTP based 3D secured transaction. The cardholder is solely responsible for this incident and the bank will not be responsible under any circumstances. We have talked to client regarding this issue and client informed us that his supporting staff was involved this issue. Client understands that his supporting staff was done all the Bkash transactions. We have advised the cardholder when needed, please replace the card through our branch or call center. If Customer wants the benefiary document and where the mentioned amount was transferred then advised client to provide us document, ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œas per statement of Bkash team informed us that any kind of fraud reporting in Bkash they need formal denial letter from customer whether it is handwritten/ Customer registered email for their compliance purpose. Please give us proper written formal letter/ e-mail from Customer registered address where customer will be mentioned that he was not made the mentioned transaction and also mentioned the merchant\'s name & affected the transaction amount with approval code.ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â', 'Contact Center has already informed this issue to customer regarding the resolution', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-18 17:35:01', '2023-07-18 17:35:01', NULL, '104', 'No'),
