(24936, 'C2307172004030031', 10, 443, '190', NULL, 'he mentioned Monthly Benefit Plan account was renewed at same term at 5.88% interest rate automatically after its maturity on 18.05.2023.But the client was reluctant at 5.88% interest rate and asked special interest rate.Then we communicate with our CHO for special rate of interest.After vigorous persuation of Branch Manager CHO agree to special rate at 7.25% for FDR,customer was also agree to open tFDR at 7.25% in place of automatically renewed Monthly Benefit Plan at 5.88 %. As customer chose FDR for higher rate automatically renewed Monthly Benefit Plan was closed an 16.07.2023.In this case customer was given interest rate of angona saving account interest 2.50% for the interium period(18.05.2023 to 17.05.2023) as per bank policy.now the client is mainlining FDR at 7.25% interest rate with us,and agreed to continue to relationship with us.', 'Several times Contact Center had tried to reach but somehow customer was unreachable', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-24 15:12:10', '2023-07-24 15:12:10', NULL, '89', 'Yes'),
