(25067, 'C2307192004030028', 8, 403, '42', NULL, 'NPSB server is maintained by BB. Whenever NPSB fails it because there is a problem with BB server. As per the NPSB dispute is concerned, MTB cannot refund the NPSB ammout without the settlement report generated from BB which take 1-2 days to reach us.MTB always try to refund the amount as soon as get the report form BB.', 'CC informed the same to the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Internet Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-27 11:27:46', '2023-07-27 11:27:46', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(25068, 'C2307253007130042', 10, 713, '162', NULL, 'Branch reply: The above issue is raised because of miss understanding between customer & me. The fact is that client shared with us that his card was captured in ATM of Independent University of Bangladesh which is under maintained of Group Four & made a call to our call center. After that he came to Bashundhara branch to collect his debit card as per replied from call center but unfortunately I missed that the card will be new card. Again & again I searched in out captured card register which we maintained in our branch practice. Today I informed him about his card & also shared everything .Then I apologize to the client for my mistake & he took it easily.', 'The customer received the card and branch apologized to the customer.', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-27 11:31:08', '2023-07-27 11:31:08', NULL, '66', 'No'),
