(25135, 'C2307253007240029', 14, 723, '24', NULL, 'First card issuance (customer creation in CMS) date is 08/06/2014. Renewal (new) card inherits information from old card without changing customer information. Usually information change in account/CIF shall notify to LOD to change in CBS and LOD shall inform COD to change in CMS to handle the issue operationally. This is legacy data and no issue found with renewal operation. However, found information updated from Cards Maintenance & Transaction Processing Team.', 'First card issuance (customer creation in CMS) date is 08/06/2014. Renewal (new) card inherits information from old card without changing customer information. Usually information change in account/CIF shall notify to LOD to change in CBS and LOD shall inform COD to change in CMS to handle the issue operationally. This is legacy data and no issue found with renewal operation. However, found information updated from Cards Maintenance & Transaction Processing Team.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-30 13:28:54', '2023-07-30 13:28:54', NULL, '104', 'No'),
