(25194, 'C2307262004030048', 8, 403, '36', NULL, 'CC reply: Honorable Customer called us on 07/24/2023 at 12:17 PM and wanted to activate his debit and credit both cards (VISA PLATINUM DEBIT: 498875******6639 & VISA SIG CRED GENERAL PRIMARY : 498851******6301). Later on, customer decided to deactivate the to know about annual fee (Tk. 11,500 Including VAT) and CSE blocked the card as per customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s advice. Customer complained that he is IEB member and he was informed by the source that 1st year annual fee is not applicable for this card. CSE checked the card profile status but no such record found in the system. CSE requested customer to contact with the source regarding this issue (branch), as because customer mentioned that they (source) were confirmed it to him and collected necessary document for this. Customer wanted to set yearly annual fee cycle from 1/08/2023, which was not systematically applicable and CSE informed details about card annual fee yearly cycle procedure to convince customer but customer was not convinced. Later on we made outbound call to honorable client he is convinced now. In addition, a feedback has been logged in VOC as per customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s instruction regarding annual fee cycle.', 'CC contacted with the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-07-31 13:27:54', '2023-07-31 13:27:54', NULL, '116', 'No'),
