(25266, 'C2307051002040027', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'Customer claimed that Bank has wrongly imposed VAT in his International transaction. Investigation reveals that Cardholder performed online transactions at PTB*Green World Group and the transactions were authorized under Merchant Category Code (MCC) 7392 but the settlement Merchant Category Code (MCC) was 4816 (Computer Network Services) and according to the NBR circular (through Bangladesh bank) VAT will be imposed on various computer services that is why NBR VAT was imposed on the transactional amount. The bank imposes VAT on transactions associated with as per BRPD Circular Letter No 4 dated 03 March 2019. No error was done from bank\'s side.', 'The bank imposes VAT on transactions associated with as per BRPD Circular Letter No 4 dated 03 March 2019. In addition, we have also responded customer\'s query regarding markup fee, statement generation date, VAT etc. Accordingly, we have replied to BB through email dated 02.08.2023', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-02 11:14:36', '2023-08-02 11:14:36', NULL, '104', 'No'),
