(25270, 'C2307131002040045', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'We have checked the issue and found that the mentioned cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s statement generation date is 25th of each month and he performed the transactions on 22-03-2023 and 25-03-2023. Merchant settled the transactions on 27-03-2023. Meanwhile, on 25-03-2023 one statement generated with zero outstanding as transaction was settled after statement date.\r\n\r\nAs per our bankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s policy, all cardholders will be automatically enrolled for MTB protection plan and if any cardholder is not willing to avail the insurance coverage, then he/she may de-enroll the MTB protection plan facility by informing the concerned division through email or call to our Contact Centre. Our concerned division has already de-enrolled the MTB Protection Plan for the mentioned cardholder on 03-07-2023 based on his request.', 'As per our bankÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s policy, all cardholders will be automatically enrolled for MTB protection plan and if any cardholder is not willing to avail the insurance coverage, then he/she may de-enroll the MTB protection plan facility by informing the concerned division through email or call to our Contact Centre. Our concerned division has already de-enrolled the MTB Protection Plan for the mentioned cardholder on 03-07-2023 based on his request. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 01 August 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-02 11:28:55', '2023-08-02 11:28:55', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(25271, 'C2307131002040041', 9, 204, '20', NULL, 'we have checked the issue and found out that the annual fee of BDT 11,500/- was charged against customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s credit card on 25-06-2023. However, it was reversed to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card account on 04-07-2023 as the cardholder made more than 15 transactions. According to our annual fee waiver policy, a cardholder will get annual fee waiver if he/ she makes 15 transactions in a year (anniversary to anniversary) and no late payment or over limit fee is imposed in the card account during the same period.', 'we have checked the issue and found out that the annual fee of BDT 11,500/- was charged against customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s credit card on 25-06-2023. However, it was reversed to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card account on 04-07-2023 as the cardholder made more than 15 transactions. According to our annual fee waiver policy, a cardholder will get annual fee waiver if he/ she makes 15 transactions in a year (anniversary to anniversary) and no late payment or over limit fee is imposed in the card account during the same period. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 01.08.23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-02 11:36:07', '2023-08-02 11:36:07', NULL, '104', 'No'),
