(25304, 'C2307133007300034', 18, 730, '12', NULL, 'we have checked the issue and found out that the customer Mr. Helal Jabel-E-Noor made a transaction of BDT 20,000/- on 21-05-2023 using his debit card in MTB Cumilla booth but the transaction was not successful. Customer called to our Contact Center and the dispute settlement request was taken on the same date. Accordingly, the mentioned amount has been reversed to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account on 14-06-2023. We have communicated with customer and updated him. It is mentionable here that it took longer time to resolve the issue due to a system error in our core banking system.', 'we have checked the issue and found out that the customer Mr. Helal Jabel-E-Noor made a transaction of BDT 20,000/- on 21-05-2023 using his debit card in MTB Cumilla booth but the transaction was not successful. Customer called to our Contact Center and the dispute settlement request was taken on the same date. Accordingly, the mentioned amount has been reversed to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account on 14-06-2023. We have communicated with customer and updated him. It is mentionable here that it took longer time to resolve the issue due to a system error in our core banking system. The issue is resolved now.  We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 01.08.23', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-02 13:19:59', '2023-08-02 13:19:59', NULL, '6', 'No'),
