(25307, 'C2307131002040032', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'we have verified the issue with the concerned division. According to our annual fee waiver policy, a cardholder will get annual fee waiver if he/ she makes 15 transactions in a year (anniversary to anniversary) and no late payment or over limit fee is imposed in the card account during the same period. This policy is clearly mentioned in our schedule of charges as well as in the credit card application form. \r\n\r\nWe have checked the said cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s transactions and found that he completed the required number of transactions but two (02) late payment fees were charged against the said credit card. As such, annual fee was imposed. However, our concerned division waived the annual fee of BDT 11,500/- on 01-06-2023 as an exception, since the cardholder was unaware of the terms and conditions. It is mentionable here that credit card annual fee is charged at the beginning of the card anniversary year, as per our policy.', 'we have verified the issue with the concerned division. According to our annual fee waiver policy, a cardholder will get annual fee waiver if he/ she makes 15 transactions in a year (anniversary to anniversary) and no late payment or over limit fee is imposed in the card account during the same period. This policy is clearly mentioned in our schedule of charges as well as in the credit card application form.   We have checked the said cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s transactions and found that he completed the required number of transactions but two (02) late payment fees were charged against the said credit card. As such, annual fee was imposed. However, our concerned division waived the annual fee of BDT 11,500/- on 01-06-2023 as an exception, since the cardholder was unaware of the terms and conditions. It is mentionable here that credit card annual fee is charged at the beginning of the card anniversary year, as per our policy. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 01.08.23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-02 13:29:38', '2023-08-02 13:29:38', NULL, '104', 'No'),
