(25414, 'C2307312004030012', 14, 613, '240', NULL, 'Branch statement: Complainant-Mr. Mohammad Ashraful Islam is one of our valued clients and son of Mr. Zahirul Islam. Mr. Zahir is secretary of Annexco Tower Market Committee, Bongobazar Market Complex and Dhaka Trade Centre. He is one of our landlords, well-wisher of our bank and a leading business man. Since inception of branch , Mr. Zahir & his sons have been maintaining account relationship with us. Our relation with them is tested and trusted like family members. Notable that Mr. Asharful would look after a portion of his fatherÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s business. Now, Mr. Zahir is sponsoring/financing his sonÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s business. A few days back, Mr. Zahir came to our branch with some deposit accounts(Where undeclared beneficial owner is Mr. Zahir) to avail Cash Line OD in the name of his sonÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s name solely for the purpose of his sonÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s business. While checking, a mismatch was found between current balance and available balance in CBS. While digging out the anomaly, it is found that Mr. Ashraful has been availing 02 Credit Cards and one Cash Line OD against his deposit accounts form elsewhere. Then, Mr. Zahir decided and availed Cash Line TL of BDT3M against lien of his own deposit(FDR of BDT4M) and gave a significant portion of the TL to his son as learnt. Later on, Mr. Zahir asked a statement of his sonÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s deposit accounts for giving his son to check anomaly. Upon persuasions, I gave the said statement to him on good faith. Till then, father ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Å“son relationship was good as learnt. Later on, Mr. Ashraful lodged the complaint on being insisted by someone as assumed. Consequently, I talked to Mr. Ashraful over phone with humble submission. During my 27 years of service in different banks(04 banks), I didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t do it except the above instance. However, I beg apology to my management and assured them not to repeat such event in future.', 'Already BM has already been communicated with customer and customer withdraw his complaint as letter format', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', 'Hold for response from branch', NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-06 16:31:45', '2023-08-09 11:03:57', NULL, '31', 'No'),
