(25443, 'N2307300005', 1, 19, '50', NULL, 'Md. Moniruzzaman (former employee) claimed that bank has wrongfully dismissed him from the service. Considering the evidences & reports, Mr. Md. MoniruzzamanÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s dismissal was inevitable. Submission of fake certificate is a major fraud/ /forgery on the institution, which is punishable according to the EmployeeÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Services Rules of MTB and the punishment form is Dismissal from the services. There are a number of instances of dismissal for submission of fake academic certificates.', 'Considering the evidences & reports, Mr. Md. MoniruzzamanÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s dismissal was inevitable. Submission of fake certificate is a major fraud/ /forgery on the institution, which is punishable according to the EmployeeÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Services Rules of MTB and the punishment form is Dismissal from the services. There are a number of instances of dismissal for submission of fake academic certificates.  Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh Bank along with all necessary supporting documents through email & hard copy letter ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/48 dated August 02, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Miscellaneous', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-07 12:50:05', '2023-08-07 12:50:05', NULL, '6', 'No'),
