(25491, 'C2307261002190017', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'Customer claimed that annual fee was charged wrongly against his card. We have verified the issue with the concerned division. No annual fee was imposed for the first year against the mentioned card. However, Annual fee for the second year was imposed against the said card. According to our annual fee waiver policy, a credit cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s second year annual fee will be waived if he/she completes at least 15 transactions using his/her credit card without having a single late payment or over limit fee throughout one year period (one annual fee charging date to another). This policy is clearly mentioned in our schedule of charges as well as in the credit card application form. We have checked the said cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s transactions and found that she made only 04 (four) transactions last year (from June 2022 to June 2023). As such, we could not reverse the annual fee against the mentioned credit card. \r\n\r\nIn addition, SMS fee is applicable for all cards as per our schedule of charges and it is charged once in a year.  The said cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s SMS fee were charged twice but in different years (one is for the year of 2022 and another is for the year of 2023).', 'No Annual fee was charged for the first year. However, Annual fee was charged for second year, We have checked the said cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s transactions and found that she made only 04 (four) transactions last year (from June 2022 to June 2023). As such, we could not reverse the annual fee against the mentioned credit card.   In addition, SMS fee is applicable for all cards as per our schedule of charges and it is charged once in a year.  The said cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s SMS fee were charged twice but in different years (one is for the year of 2022 and another is for the year of 2023). Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 07 Aug 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-08 10:39:20', '2023-08-08 10:39:20', NULL, '104', 'No'),
