(25500, 'C2307173007020038', 8, 702, '1', NULL, 'Agent banking reply: Bhashanchar is an underprivileged and hostile island where we are the only bank serving through agent. The computers used in the center became useless and both of them (officer and user) went to Noakhali by sea. That is why they immediately pulled a notice and left. As there is no electricity system in the entire Bhashanchar, all the offices are dependent on solar power. We already talked with agent for setup IPS and provide laptop for daily GB services.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-08 10:49:19', '2023-08-08 10:49:19', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(25501, 'C2307266004820022', 12, 482, '74', NULL, 'Customer claimed that she paid credit card bill of Islami Bank through EFT using Smart banking App of MTB but the payment was not deposited.we have checked the issue and found out that the customer paid her Islami Bank Bangladesh ltd. (IBBL) credit card bill of 66,500/- from MTB Smart Banking Apps using EFT channel on 05-07-23 but the amount was not deposited to her IBBL credit card. Customer called to our Contact Center on the next day and the dispute settlement request was taken on the same date. Our concerned division communicated with IBBL regarding this issue & IBBL confirmed that the BEFTN transaction has been credited on 11-07-2023.', 'we have checked the issue and found out that the customer paid her Islami Bank Bangladesh ltd. (IBBL) credit card bill of 66,500/- from MTB Smart Banking Apps using EFT channel on 05-07-23 but the amount was not deposited to her IBBL credit card. Customer called to our Contact Center on the next day and the dispute settlement request was taken on the same date. Our concerned division communicated with IBBL regarding this issue & IBBL confirmed that the BEFTN transaction has been credited on 11-07-2023. We informed customer accordingly. We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 07 Aug 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Internet Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-08 10:53:03', '2023-08-08 10:53:03', NULL, '6', 'No'),
