(25552, 'N2307310015', 8, 398, '326', NULL, 'We have investigated the issue with the co-operation of our concerned department. Please note that, we operate 04 (Four) exchange booths at Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport in four different locations. We sell foreign currency from 02 (Two) departure booths and buy foreign currency from 02 (Two) arrival booths. When respected customer Mr. Narayan Prasad Paudel (Former Executive Director of Nepal Rastra Bank ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Å“ The Central Bank of Nepal) visited our booth at departure lounge, we could not meet his requirement due to unavailability of US Dollars at that particular booth.', 'We have investigated the issue with the co-operation of our concerned department. Please note that, we operate 04 (Four) exchange booths at Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport in four different locations. We sell foreign currency from 02 (Two) departure booths and buy foreign currency from 02 (Two) arrival booths. When respected customer Mr. Narayan Prasad Paudel (Former Executive Director of Nepal Rastra Bank ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Å“ The Central Bank of Nepal) visited our booth at departure lounge, we could not meet his requirement due to unavailability of US Dollars at that particular booth. We sincerely apologized to the customer for the inconvenience. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 07 Aug 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-08 16:22:14', '2023-08-08 16:22:14', NULL, '6', 'No'),
