(25567, 'N2307260003', 14, 608, '206', NULL, 'we have checked the issue and found out that Mr. Md Parbes visited our Jubilee Road branch on 28.05.2023 and requested for payment of an inward remittance. In this regard, concerned official of the branch requested him to provide with remitterÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s information as per Bangladesh Bank Letter No. BRPD (M)204/MISC/2018-9639 dated 24-12-2018 but he could not provide the information and left the branch. As a result, branch could not release the cash remittance.', 'We have checked the issue and found out that Mr. Md Parbes visited our Jubilee Road branch on 28.05.2023 and requested for payment of an inward remittance. In this regard, concerned official of the branch requested him to provide with remitterÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s information as per Bangladesh Bank Letter No. BRPD (M)204/MISC/2018-9639 dated 24-12-2018 but he could not provide the information and left the branch. Later, Mr. Parbes again visited the branch on 08-06-2023. The concerned official of the branch explained the requirements in detail and also apologized to him for the inconvenience. The issue is resolved now. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 08 Aug 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-09 10:32:02', '2023-08-09 10:32:02', NULL, '23', 'No'),
