(25578, 'N2308030006', 18, 498, '307', NULL, 'Due to delay in releasing the remittance, complaint was raised. Investigation reveals that the remittance amount of BDT 2,800,000/- and BDT 2,500,000/- (Totaling BDT 5,300,000) were released separately to beneficiary account on 04-06-2023 by our concerned division after necessary scrutiny and proceedings.', 'We have checked the issue and found out that the remittance amount of BDT 2,800,000/- and BDT 2,500,000/- (Totaling BDT 5,300,000) were released separately to beneficiary account on 04-06-2023 by our concerned division after necessary scrutiny and proceedings. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 08 Aug 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-09 11:13:52', '2023-08-09 11:13:52', NULL, '105', 'No'),
