(25584, 'C2308031000930029', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'We have checked the issue and found out that customer Mr. Md Anwar Hossain informed our contact centre on 02-07-2023 regarding a card transaction of USD 7.11 (equivalent to BDT 747.50) that was made without his concern on 18-06-2023. Accordingly, chargeback process was initiated on 03-07-2023 for the mentioned disputed transaction. In this regard, the amount of USD 7.11 had been reversed to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card account on 27-07-2023 through the chargeback process as the mentioned fraud transaction was non 3DS transaction.', 'we have checked the issue and found out that customer Mr. Md Anwar Hossain informed our contact centre on 02-07-2023 regarding a card transaction of USD 7.11 (equivalent to BDT 747.50) that was made without his concern on 18-06-2023. Accordingly, chargeback process was initiated on 03-07-2023 for the mentioned disputed transaction. In this regard, the amount of USD 7.11 had been reversed to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card account on 27-07-2023 through the chargeback process as the mentioned fraud transaction was non 3DS transaction. We have communicated with the customer and informed him accordingly. We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 08 Aug 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-09 11:23:26', '2023-08-09 11:23:26', NULL, '104', 'No'),
