(25622, 'N2307040010', 6, 86, '325', NULL, 'Complainant Ms. Rokeya Sultana claimed that customer Mr. Ahad Ullah gave her name as guarantor without her consent and forging her signature. We have checked the issue and found out that personal guarantor (PG) for the mentioned Loan has been changed and concerned division has informed the previous PG Ms. Rokeya Sultana regarding the issue.', 'We have checked the issue and found out that personal guarantor (PG) for the mentioned Loan has been changed and our concerned division has  informed the previous PG Ms. Rokeya Sultana regarding the issue. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 09 August 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-09 16:13:16', '2023-08-09 16:13:16', NULL, '107', 'No'),
