(25846, 'C2306221003280034', 6, 93, '23,38', NULL, 'Investigation reveals that it was a case of Identity theft where Mr. A B M Fakrul IslamÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s (the complainant) own brother, Mr. ABM Mainul Islam was involved. Mr. A B M Mainul Islam used his younger brotherÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s (Mr. A B M Fakrul Islam, the complainant) identity and documents to avail the said card. The card was issued in January 2014 in the name of A B M Fakrul Islam and his CIB was showing BLW status. Our concerned division asked Mr. A B M Mainul Islam (Fraudulent person and elder brother of the complainant) to pay back all the outstanding of the card and he agreed to pay back the full amount. Accordingly, Mr. ABM Mainul Islam made full payment of the outstanding of the card. Upon realization of the full outstanding amount, our bank has submitted for the termination of card in BB CIB batch June, 2023. The credit card is now terminated in BB CIB database.', 'It was a case of Identity theft where Mr. A B M Fakrul IslamÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s (the complainant) own brother, Mr. ABM Mainul Islam was involved. Mr. A B M Mainul Islam used his younger brotherÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s (Mr. A B M Fakrul Islam, the complainant) identity and documents to avail the said card. The card was issued in January 2014 in the name of A B M Fakrul Islam and his CIB was showing BLW status. Our concerned division asked Mr. A B M Mainul Islam (Fraudulent person and elder brother of the complainant) to pay back all the outstanding of the card and he agreed to pay back the full amount. Accordingly, Mr. ABM Mainul Islam made full payment of the outstanding of the card. Upon realization of the full outstanding amount, our bank has submitted for the termination of card in BB CIB batch June, 2023. The credit card is now terminated in BB CIB database. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 16 August 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-17 11:06:39', '2023-08-17 11:06:39', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(25847, 'C2308091006650033', 13, 665, '109', NULL, 'Cards & ADC Technology Unit Reply: This contract closed issue. The client was cancelled Due to the contract close report sent to the LBMS side. But This Client get a new contract with the existing client, For this reason, we manually activated client from the LBMS side. Now is client activated. During the Close contract report run from TWCMS side if a new contract was exists then we consider it not close. But if when all contract is closed & have no contract is open during the run Close contract report then we consider it closed contract. Accordingly, LBMS close the client. This is the reason for this issue', 'Now Customer account is activated.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-17 11:15:05', '2023-08-17 11:15:05', NULL, '104', 'No'),
