(25852, 'C2307132000940036', 6, 94, '1', NULL, 'Our concerned division checked the issue at their end and found that the account is suspected of being involved in a Bkash fraud transaction. The issue is now under investigation. Therefore, the debit transaction of the said account is blocked as per management decision.', 'Our concerned division checked the issue at their end and found that the account is suspected of being involved in a Bkash fraud transaction. The issue is now under investigation. Therefore, the debit transaction of the said account is blocked as per management decision. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 16 Aug 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-17 11:34:30', '2023-08-17 11:34:30', NULL, '118', 'No'),
