(25854, 'C2308032005930030', 14, 593, '162', NULL, 'We have verified the issue with the co-operation of our concerned branch and found that the said customer visited our Bashundhara Branch for depositing money. After counting and necessary checking, the concerned cash officer noticed a doubtful note. Therefore, she brought it to the attention of the customer. The client then without any bargaining, asked the teller to refund his full money as he would change the notes from Brac Bank, Bashundhara Branch, which is approximately 2 to 3 minutes walking distance. He returned shortly with changed note and deposited the money accordingly. No misbehavior occurred during the period. According to the CCTV footage, neither the customer was angry, nor the cash officer showed negative attitude. Nonetheless, the concerned branch manager and operation manager expressed their apology to the customer and invited him to visit the branch. They also warned the concerned officer to be more careful in future while providing services.', 'We have verified the issue with the co-operation of our concerned branch and found that the said customer visited our Bashundhara Branch for depositing money. After counting and necessary checking, the concerned cash officer noticed a doubtful note. Therefore, she brought it to the attention of the customer. The client then without any bargaining, asked the teller to refund his full money as he would change the notes from Brac Bank, Bashundhara Branch, which is approximately 2 to 3 minutes walking distance. He returned shortly with changed note and deposited the money accordingly. No misbehavior occurred during the period. According to the CCTV footage, neither the customer was angry, nor the cash officer showed negative attitude. Nonetheless, the concerned branch manager and operation manager expressed their apology to the customer and invited him to visit the branch. They also warned the concerned officer to be more careful in future while providing services. Accordingly, We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 16 August 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-17 11:42:14', '2023-08-17 11:42:14', NULL, '66', 'No'),
