(26087, 'C2306041004680044', 10, 253, '164', NULL, 'As per ticket no. S2307051007590099 & S2307131007590253 branch didn\'t forward the request to central verification unit for CPV. Later on, after receiving the complaint, they sent it to the concerned unit for CPV and address change.', 'Address is changed and customer declared that the issue has been resolved.', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-23 13:51:47', '2023-08-23 13:51:47', NULL, '19', 'No'),
(26088, 'C2308162004980015', 18, 498, '244', NULL, 'We have communicated with the client on the following date: 1. Upon receiving remittance information as on 06.08.2023 from Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department, we have communicated with the client on the same date. 2. Client provided document as on 10.08.2023 and we have sent the request to Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department on the same date. 3. Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department provided query as on 10.08.2023 and we delivered it to the customer on the same date. But customer replied at 9;28 p.m. on Thursday after banking hour. Then we have replied it to Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department as on 13.08.2023 on Sunday. 4. Then Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department again placed query to us as on 16.08.2023 and we have forwarded their query to the customer on the same date. But he has replied as on 18.08.2023, Friday and subsequently we have sent the reply to your end 20.08.2023 on Sunday. 5. Finally as on 21.08.2023, client directly talked to Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department and fund was credited to the client\'s account on that same date. So due to lack of proper documents Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department could not credit the fund to the client\'s account and finally they have credited on 21.08.2023 after communicating with the client.', 'We have communicated with the client on the following date: 1. Upon receiving remittance information as on 06.08.2023 from Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department, we have communicated with the client on the same date. 2. Client provided document as on 10.08.2023 and we have sent the request to Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department on the same date. 3. Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department provided query as on 10.08.2023 and we delivered it to the customer on the same date. But customer replied at 9;28 p.m. on Thursday after banking hour. Then we have replied it to Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department as on 13.08.2023 on Sunday. 4. Then Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department again placed query to us as on 16.08.2023 and we have forwarded their query to the customer on the same date. But he has replied as on 18.08.2023, Friday and subsequently we have sent the reply to your end 20.08.2023 on Sunday. 5. Finally as on 21.08.2023, client directly talked to Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department and fund was credited to the client\'s account on that same date. So due to lack of proper documents Centralized Remittance and FC Accounts Department could not credit the fund to the client\'s account and finally they have credited on 21.08.2023 after communicating with the client.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-23 14:47:48', '2023-08-23 14:47:48', NULL, '92', 'No'),
