(26118, 'C2308205004060025', 8, 406, '20', NULL, 'CC reply: Please inform customer NBR charged is not related to our bank fees and charges. As per (National Board of Revenue), circular number 08.01.0000.068.09.0003.12/32. Cardholder need to provide 15% VAT on online (E-commerce) transactions through cards on service delivered from outside Bangladesh for following merchant category: 1. Advertising Services. 2. Computer Programming, Integrated Systems Design and Data Processing Services. 3. Direct Marketing - Continuity/Subscription Merchant. 4. Computer network services, internet access, cyber locker, file sharing and cloud storage. As per your mentioned transactions we found that the merchant category was: Direct Marketing - Continuity/Subscription Merchants. So NBR VAT has been applied accordingly.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-24 12:18:57', '2023-08-24 12:18:57', NULL, '104', 'No'),
