(26363, 'C2308161000930001', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Dear Concern, we have checked the transaction in the fimi and found that POS Entry Mode 012 - manual key entry (cannot accept PIN) and Pos condition is -87 - Channel encrypted VSEC .We refer the issue to the chargeback & settlement team to retrieve the document from acquiring bank and also take necessary action to retrieve the fund. Without any document fraud risk management team have no rights to judge the issue whether it is fraud or not. Refer to the mentioned complaint, please arrange to initiate chargeback option for the mentioned disputed transaction as client denied the mentioned transaction. Please be informed that mentioned card status is blocked in the TWCMS. Please do needful & take necessary action as appropriate.', 'The customer has been informed through email by CC.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-30 15:25:57', '2023-08-30 15:25:57', NULL, '104', 'No'),
