(26387, 'N2308270003', 1, 408, '222', NULL, 'Some documents were missing for opening the account. Which takes some time to collect. Later when the account is sent to LOD some queries have to be met up. Which causes some more delay. Two holidays pass in between. All in all, some delay is created. Account is currently activated. The client is informed very politely. And the delay is regretted. The latter is committed to providing maximum smooth service. The client is satisfied with the resolution of his problem. And said that they will increase more transactions with us later.', 'Some documents were missing for opening the account. Which takes some time to collect. Later when the account is sent to LOD some queries have to be met up. Which causes some more delay. Two holidays pass in between. All in all, some delay is created. Account is currently activated. The client is informed very politely. And the delay is regretted. The latter is committed to providing maximum smooth service. The client is satisfied with the resolution of his problem. And said that they will increase more transactions with us later.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-08-31 10:36:39', '2023-08-31 10:36:39', NULL, '88', 'No'),
