(26802, 'N2309050012', 1, 19, '63', NULL, 'Silk Route Design Ltd  complained that the client ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œIshayat Fashion LimitedÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â delayed to pay pending service charges against buying house commission. We have checked the issue and found that the client ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œIshayat Fashion LimitedÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â has made the payment (pending service charges) as per the request of the buying house named ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œSilk Route Design Ltd.ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â', 'The client ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œIshayat Fashion LimitedÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â has already made the payment (pending service charges) as per the request of the buying house named ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œSilk Route Design Ltd.ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â Accordingly, we have informed Bangladesh Bank through email dated 11 September 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Export Related', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-12 10:47:25', '2023-09-12 10:47:25', NULL, '113', 'No'),
(26803, 'C2308271006720038', 12, 672, '20', NULL, 'Our concerned division has communicated with the customer and he confirmed that he has made the transaction (visa processing fee purpose) on 14-08-2023. We have also checked the system and found that the transaction was successful as the value was less than USD 300.', 'Our concerned division has communicated with the customer and he confirmed that he has made the transaction (visa processing fee purpose) on 14-08-2023. We have also checked the system and found that the transaction was successful as the value was less than USD 300. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 11 Sep 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-12 10:56:47', '2023-09-12 10:56:47', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(26804, 'C2308271001990035', 9, 199, '20', NULL, 'Our investigation reveals that our bank imposes VAT on transactions associated with Google as per BRPD Circular Letter No. 04 dated 03-03-2019. As Bangladesh Bank has not provided us any instructions regarding VAT reversal, we sent a letter to Bangladesh Bank with the documents provided by the cardholder for more clarification regarding VAT reversal issue. We also visited Bangladesh Bank for this particular issue but Bangladesh Bank did not provide any guidelines to reverse the VAT which imposed against the transactions. Also, we do not have any guidelines from NBR that prohibits us imposing VAT on the transactions stated by cardholder. As such, we have recommended the cardholder not to make any transactions in that particular area if he disagrees to pay VAT against such transactions.', 'As Bangladesh Bank has not provided us any instructions regarding VAT reversal, we sent a letter to Bangladesh Bank with the documents provided by the cardholder for more clarification regarding VAT reversal issue. We also visited Bangladesh Bank for this particular issue but Bangladesh Bank did not provide any guidelines to reverse the VAT which imposed against the transactions. Also, we do not have any guidelines from NBR that prohibits us imposing VAT on the transactions stated by cardholder. As such, we have recommended the cardholder not to make any transactions in that particular area if he disagrees to pay VAT against such transactions. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 11 Sep 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-12 11:04:19', '2023-09-12 11:04:19', NULL, '104', 'No'),
