(26832, 'C2309092004670002', 14, 608, '229', NULL, 'Bormi branch reply: We had received a request of debit card mobile no. change from customer through chandra Br.on 10-07-2023 (Ticket No. : S2307103003070207) which is already resolved. But we didn\'t found any request regarding IB Mobile No. Change. Also communicate to customer& request to visit BR. & submit a request through proper form & he agrees to visit bormi br.', 'Branch shared the reply', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-12 13:06:44', '2023-09-12 13:06:44', NULL, '93', 'No'),
