(27086, 'N2309130006', 12, 671, '64', NULL, 'We have forwarded the letter to our concerned division for their information and necessary action. Subsequently, they have checked the issue at their end and informed us that the aforesaid matter is under sub-judice of law. The necessary documents are enclosed herewith for your reference.', 'We have forwarded the letter to our concerned division for their information and necessary action. Subsequently, they have checked the issue at their end and informed us that the aforesaid matter is under sub-judice of law. The necessary documents are enclosed herewith for your reference. Accordingly, we have replied to BB through email dated 18.09.23', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Import Bill (Foreign)', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-18 13:40:10', '2023-09-18 13:40:10', NULL, '113', 'No'),
