(27088, 'C2309131002040040', 9, 204, '20', NULL, 'Cardholder deposited his total credit card outstanding amount on BDT part instead of USD part on 02-08-2023. Due to this reason late payment fee was imposed on his cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s USD portion on 12-08-2023. However, cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s payment has already been transferred to USD portion on 03-09-2023 and our concerned division has also reversed the late payment fee of USD portion on 07-09-2023 based on cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request.', 'Cardholder deposited his total credit card outstanding amount on BDT part instead of USD part on 02-08-2023. Due to this reason late payment fee was imposed on his cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s USD portion on 12-08-2023. However, cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s payment has already been transferred to USD portion on 03-09-2023 and our concerned division has also reversed the late payment fee of USD portion on 07-09-2023 based on cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request. Customer is duly informed about the matter.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-18 15:42:54', '2023-09-18 15:42:54', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(27089, 'C2309132004990041', 18, 499, '42', NULL, 'We have checked the issue and found that the mentioned NPSB transactions were failed due to the reason ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œdestination not availableÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â. But the amounts have already been refunded to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account on August 29, 2023.', 'We have checked the issue and found that the mentioned NPSB transactions were failed due to the reason ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œdestination not availableÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â. But the amounts have already been refunded to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account on August 29, 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Internet Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-18 16:24:08', '2023-09-18 16:24:08', NULL, '6', 'No'),
