(27091, 'C2309135002060043', 9, 206, '20', NULL, 'We have checked the issue and found that cardholder performed a foreign transaction with his MTB virtual VISA prepaid card on 28-08-2023 for an amount of USD 5.75 at FACEBOOK. The merchant settled the transaction on 31-08-2023 and on that day VISA USD rate was 109.5. As a result, transaction settled at BDT 629.23 (5.75*109.5).  The mentioned transaction was settled as per the VISA settlement USD rate and 15 % NBR VAT was charged (as per the BRPD Circular Letter No 4 dated 03 March 2019) which was BDT 94.17. Hence, cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s total transaction amount along with NBR VAT is BDT 723.8 as per calculation.', 'We have checked the issue and found that cardholder performed a foreign transaction with his MTB virtual VISA prepaid card on 28-08-2023 for an amount of USD 5.75 at FACEBOOK. The merchant settled the transaction on 31-08-2023 and on that day VISA USD rate was 109.5. As a result, transaction settled at BDT 629.23 (5.75*109.5).  The mentioned transaction was settled as per the VISA settlement USD rate and 15 % NBR VAT was charged (as per the BRPD Circular Letter No 4 dated 03 March 2019) which was BDT 94.17. Hence, cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s total transaction amount along with NBR VAT is BDT 723.8 as per calculation. Customer was duly informed by our Contact Center in this regard.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-18 16:50:40', '2023-09-18 16:50:40', NULL, '104', 'No'),
