(27220, 'C2309132004980044', 18, 498, '297', NULL, 'We have received a fund intimation from Citibank N.A. favoring Nilufar Yeasmin, a customer of MTB Babubazar Branch. Subsequently, we have forwarded the intimation letter to MTB Babu Bazar Branch for collecting the supporting documents from the client as required by CitiBank N.A., Dhaka . The client declared the purpose as ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œpersonal fundÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â and declined to provide any supporting documents to establish the relation with the remitter entity (Accounting and Taxation-Sydney) against her letter dated 16.08.2023.\r\n\r\nIn addition, the client requested that the funds be returned to the sender in case Citibank N.A couldn\'t credit the fund. We forwarded the application to Citibank N.A and they returned the fund since they could not establish the relationship between remitter and beneficiary.', 'The client requested that the funds be returned to the sender in case Citibank N.A couldn\'t credit the fund. We forwarded the application to Citibank N.A and they returned the fund since they could not establish the relationship between remitter and beneficiary.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-20 16:00:02', '2023-09-20 16:00:02', NULL, '6', 'No'),
