(27301, 'C2309171004040027', 8, 404, '20', NULL, 'Customer claimed that his credit card has been closed but it is still showing at CIB. investigation reveals that mentioned card contract was closed on 11/02/2021 and CIB report rectified accordingly. Our concerned division also reported to BB as UC after the card is closed.', 'Customer claimed that his credit card has been closed but it is still showing at CIB. investigation reveals that mentioned card contract was closed on 11/02/2021 and CIB report rectified accordingly. Our concerned division also reported to BB as UC after the card is closed.  Accordingly, we have informed customer about the update and also requested him to contact with BB for CIB update. As per customer voice, he was apply for personal  loan from city bank but they decline his request for bad CIB. So customer will apply for personal  loan from our bank.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-24 11:56:12', '2023-09-24 11:56:12', NULL, '104', 'No'),
