(27405, 'C2309171000930034', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Our Contact Centre agents informed the cardholder that this card need to be blocked for further chargeback and investigation purpose. But the cardholder said that he has deactivated the foreign part but he did not agree to block his Credit Card. If any Chargeback need to initiate, ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œVisa recommends that the account number be block/closed as issuers will not be liable for further fraudulent transactions.ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â But the cardholder did not agreed to block his card.   Regarding his dispute issue we have checked and found  cardholder previously made same transaction on 12/07/23 at tantanapp.com. We have communicated with the cardholder regarding this issue and he informed us that mentioned transaction was made by him. After that we informed him  as he made transaction in same merchant previously ,so on dated 13/08/23 payment was related to recurring/subscription payment. customer also  informed us that he already contacted with the merchant regarding the issue. As transaction was recurring/subscription payment, customer understand the scenario and withdraw his dispute complaint. He also replaced his card as well.', 'Customer already replaced his card (S2308281001780046) as well as he withdrawal his dispute complaint which was occurred at tantanapp.com because the payment was related to recurring/subscription payment.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-25 12:36:02', '2023-09-25 12:36:02', NULL, '104', 'No'),
