(27425, 'N2309130005', 18, 498, '308', NULL, 'Freelancers are not eligible for 2.5% incentive against remittance according to Bangladesh Bank circular number FEPD (LDA)/147(1)/2019-7600, dated 07.10.2019 (point no-4).  As a Freelancer, customer may be eligible for a 4% Cash Incentive as per Bangladesh Bank FE circular no. 29 dated 20.09.2021. Customer may apply for the 4% cash incentive through his beneficiary bank (BANK ASIA LTD in this case). For this, he needs to comply the terms & conditions mentioned in the circular.', 'As a Freelancer, customer may be eligible for a 4% Cash Incentive as per Bangladesh Bank FE circular no. 29 dated 20.09.2021. We have advised customer to apply for the 4% cash incentive through his beneficiary bank (BANK ASIA LTD in this case). For this, he needs to comply the terms & conditions mentioned in the circular. We have communicated with customer over phone and informed him the update.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-25 16:13:21', '2023-09-25 16:13:21', NULL, '105', 'No'),
