(27474, 'C2309171004040035', 8, 399, '238', NULL, 'There were some confusion regarding number of document submission for credit card limit enhancement. Customer visited Dilkusha branch along with Bank Statement, E- Tin certificate & return copy. In order to smooth service as well as requirements of CHO authority our branch official requested him to provide a copy of NID along with a Passport size photo. To comply CDD/ CPV, our official wants to know his present address. On query Mr. Mahdi Zulfikar felt annoyed & not interested to provide NID & PP, rather raised objection regarding inconsistence of our Contract Centre information and branch information.', 'There were some confusion regarding number of document submission for credit card limit enhancement. Customer visited Dilkusha branch along with Bank Statement, E- Tin certificate & return copy. In order to smooth service as well as requirements of CHO authority our branch official requested him to provide a copy of NID along with a Passport size photo. To comply CDD/ CPV, our official wants to know his present address. On query Mr. Mahdi Zulfikar felt annoyed & not interested to provide NID & PP, rather raised objection regarding inconsistence of our Contract Centre information and branch information. Later, our concerned branch talked to customer over phone and convinced him. They also apologized to him for inconvenience. Customer will visit branch soon along with required documents.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-27 12:22:59', '2023-09-27 12:26:46', NULL, '17', 'No'),
