(27484, 'C2309172004570008', 14, 608, '244', NULL, 'SMS ALERT CHARGE purpose system charged 200+30 vat = 230 tk. Due to insufficient account balance, system partially recovered (119.13+17.87 vat =137tk) against this charged amount And imposed a hold against rest of unrecovered amount 93tk during half year end on 29-06-2023. After that, the customer deposited exact installment amount 2000 tk in her link account on 17-07-2023 but due to hold amount available balance of link account became less than the actual installment amount. Hence, the DPS account didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t able to collect installment for the month on time. And ItÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s regularized with Penalty Charge after availability of fund for the month of July and August 2023. Also be informed that, the installment realization still not executed for the month of September 2023 due to same reason.', 'Contact Center has already informed this issue to customer regarding the resolution', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-27 12:39:02', '2023-09-27 12:39:02', NULL, '92', 'No');
