(27488, 'C2309172001980036', 9, 227, '223', NULL, 'While applying for simple account respective customer didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t choose our SMS banking option but as per his complain he had been charged for SMS banking charge twice. As per attached mail from CHO dated: 11/12/2022 we set enrollment for SMS banking charge in account level from branch end and thatÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s why system imposed SMS charge as per schedule of charges.', 'While applying for simple account respective customer didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t choose our SMS banking option but as per his complain he had been charged for SMS banking charge twice. As per attached mail from CHO dated: 11/12/2022 we set enrollment for SMS banking charge in account level from branch end and thatÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s why system imposed SMS charge as per schedule of charges. Now we stop the SMS alert charge and revised the SMS alert charge for the year 2022 & 2023 to the customer account. The issue is now resolved.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-09-27 12:46:44', '2023-09-27 12:46:44', NULL, '45', 'No'),
