(27834, 'N2309250010', 12, 671, '64', NULL, 'Expo Accessories Ltd is a nominated supplier of the buying house named ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œCotton HeritageÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â who have provided a sales contract to them for export. They got the SC no. KBK/ROOCHI/01/21 Date: 07.12.2021 For USD 3,18,854.88 from Cotton Heritage. As informed by the client, the buying house, did not take the full shipment after inspection. Since the buying house did not take the full shipment, Khan Brothers Knitwear Industries Ltd. could not acceptance of the said bill/s.', 'After getting the letter from Bangladesh Bank, we pursued the client to settle the issue without delay.   On 25.09.2023 Khan Brothers Knitwear Industries Ltd invited the concern person of Expo Accessories Ltd to solve the issue. Two officials of Expo Accessories Ltd. came to the office of Khan Brothers Knitwear Industries Ltd and discussed about solving the issue mutually. Khan Brothers Knitwear Industries Ltd. informed us that they are working with the supplier to solve the issue as early as possible. In this regard, they sent us a letter (Ref: KBKIL/2023/MTB/127 dated 02.10.23) which is enclosed herewith. Accordingly we have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 04.10.23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Import Bill (Foreign)', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-04 15:51:09', '2023-10-04 15:51:09', NULL, '6', 'No'),
