(27841, 'C2309252000210031', 1, 21, '171', NULL, 'During the renewal of the MTB Cash Line Overdraft loan, clientÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s CIB was fetched and as per the CIB report dated 18.06.2023, client was identified as default (BL) in his account(s) with one or more lending institution(s). We requested the client to regularize his defaulted loan account(s) with other lending institution(s) to process renewal of his MTB Cash Line Overdraft loan with us. The client requested us vide his letter dated 19.06.2023 to allow him 3 monthsÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ time for regularizing his defaulted loan account(s) with other lending institution(s) as he is not in a position to adjust his liabilities with us. Based on his written commitment (letter attached) to regularize his default loan account(s) with other lending institution(s), we renewed the MTB Cash Line Overdraft loan account with no withdrawal.\r\n\r\nNow, three months have already passed, but the client has not provided NOC about regularization of his defaulted loan with other lending institution(s) yet. In spite of several communications, Client is not cooperating with us.', 'The client has not provided NOC about regularization of his defaulted loan with other lending institution(s) yet. In spite of several communications, Client is not cooperating with us. It is mentionable that whenever we request the client to provide NOC from his current lending institution, the client gives reference of higher authority and harass branch officials. In this circumstances, we called the client on Branch premises and requested him to submit NOC or arrange to adjust his loan liabilities with us immediately. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 03.10.23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-04 16:02:53', '2023-10-04 16:02:53', NULL, '8', 'No'),
