(27844, 'C2309251002040033', 9, 204, '20', NULL, 'we have checked the issue and found that cardholder deposited the outstanding amount of his credit card for the month of July, 2023 to his cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s BDT part through EFT on 30-07-2023 and 14-08-2023 respectively. After making the payment, cardholder did not request us to transfer the payment to USD part that is why late payment fee was imposed in the USD part.', 'Based on customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request, cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s payment has already been transferred to USD portion and the late payment fee of USD portion was also reversed on 17-09-2023. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 03.10.2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-04 16:19:43', '2023-10-04 16:19:43', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(27845, 'C2309252006470034', 12, 647, '201', NULL, 'Customer has been maintaining a Millionaire Plan account with MTB Agrabad Branch since 18-08-2019. He provided his TIN Certificate at the time of account opening to the branch but inadvertently TIN was not updated in the system and as a result 15% source tax was deducted from the account instead of 10%. As a result, complaint was raised.', 'After identifying the matter, our concerned branch reversed 5% additional source tax amount of BDT 8904/- to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s savings account on 02-10-2023. Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh bank through email dated 03.10.23.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-04 16:31:25', '2023-10-04 16:31:25', NULL, '10', 'No'),
