r 2023) along with necessary documents.Accordingly, we have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 03.10.23  (Ref:Ref: MTB/CHO/SQ/2023/51)', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-04 16:54:59', '2023-10-04 16:54:59', NULL, '6', 'No'),
