(27882, 'C2310021006650059', 13, 665, '18', NULL, 'We have checked and found that mentioned point has already been reversed on dated 21 September, 2023 and it also added to his total points. We also checked and found that after reversal customer again made a txn o dated 27 September, 2023. So please inform him accordingly to see his Mrewardz history. ***Note: As per our Mrewardz system calculate customers total earning point and total spend point where also adjust his reversal point and spend point. Actually customers total actual earning point was 46758ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¬ and rest of the point shown due to spend and reversal. Customer made successful spend only 1 which is 25000 point on dated 27 September, 2023 but our system counts total 50000 with previous one which is also similar point on dated 20 September, 2023. Same condition has been applied with his earning point where also add his reversal point. If you feel any confusion, then please communicate with us and also you may check his LBMS transaction summary statement.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-05 13:41:03', '2023-10-05 13:41:03', NULL, '104', 'No'),
