(28094, 'C2310013007300058', 18, 730, '19', NULL, 'Due to POS dispute, complaint was raised. The cardholder made a POS transaction with his MTB Visa Platinum Debit Card at Uttara Aarong on 14-09-2023 for an amount of BDT 1719/- but the transaction was unsuccessful. Subsequently, customer placed a dispute claim request to our contact center on the same day. The claimed amount has been reversed to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account on 19-09-2023.', 'The cardholder made a POS transaction with his MTB Visa Platinum Debit Card at Uttara Aarong on 14-09-2023 for an amount of BDT 1719/- but the transaction was unsuccessful. Subsequently, customer placed a dispute claim request to our contact center on the same day. The claimed amount has been reversed to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account on 19-09-2023 and we have informed customer accordingly. We have also replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 10 October 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-10 17:44:10', '2023-10-10 17:44:10', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(28095, 'C2310012003980066', 18, 499, '42', NULL, 'The IBFT incoming transaction of BDT 1175/- was credited to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account but we did not receive fund through NPSB settlement on 10-09-2023. Hence, the amount of BDT 1175/- was marked as hold. We have communicated with EBL to retrieve the fund but they have rejected it. Therefore, we have collected the amount of BDT 1175/- from the customersÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ account on 08-10-2023. In addition, the SMS charge of BDT 229.49/- was also on hold due to insufficient fund in customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account.', 'The IBFT incoming transaction of BDT 1175/- was credited to customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account but we did not receive fund through NPSB settlement on 10-09-2023. Hence, the amount of BDT 1175/- was marked as hold. We have communicated with EBL to retrieve the fund but they have rejected it. Therefore, we have collected the amount of BDT 1175/- from the customersÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ account on 08-10-2023. In addition, the SMS charge of BDT 229.49/- was also on hold due to insufficient fund in customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s account. Now, both the funds have been realized. We have communicated with customer and updated him on this.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-10 18:17:40', '2023-10-10 18:17:40', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(28096, 'C2310011002190064', 9, 219, '20', NULL, 'Customer was unaware of charges, therefore complaint was raised. the cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s credit card was issued on July 2022 with first year annual fee waiver. However, the annual fee for the second year was imposed on July 2023. Please note that customer did not pay the outstanding amount for two consecutive months. Therefore, late payment fees were also imposed against the card. According to our annual fee waiver policy, a cardholder will get annual fee waiver if he/ she makes 15 transactions in a year (anniversary to anniversary) provided that no late payment or over limit fee is imposed during the same period. This policy along with all fees and charges are clearly mentioned in our schedule of charges. Our concerned division has communicated with the cardholder and is going to reverse the late payment fees as an exception.', 'The cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s credit card was issued on July 2022 with first year annual fee waiver. However, the annual fee for the second year was imposed on July 2023. Please note that customer did not pay the outstanding amount for two consecutive months. Therefore, late payment fees were also imposed against the card. According to our annual fee waiver policy, a cardholder will get annual fee waiver if he/ she makes 15 transactions in a year (anniversary to anniversary) provided that no late payment or over limit fee is imposed during the same period. This policy along with all fees and charges are clearly mentioned in our schedule of charges. Our concerned division has communicated with the cardholder and is going to reverse the late payment fees as an exception. We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 10 Oct 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-10 18:26:04', '2023-10-10 18:26:04', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(28097, 'C2310016002220062', 9, 222, '20', NULL, 'Customer was unaware of charges imposed against his card. Therefore, complaint was raised. The cardholder has been using ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œMTB Visa International Prepaid CardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â since 12/02/2017 and it was renewed on September 2022 as ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œPayplus Prepaid CardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â. Payplus prepaid cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s annual fee for the year 2022 and MTB Visa International Prepaid CardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s annual fee for 03 consecutive years (2019-2021) were not realized due to insufficient balance in the card account. Later, we realized these annual fees on July 2023 when card balance was available.', 'The cardholder has been using ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œMTB Visa International Prepaid CardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â since 12/02/2017 and it was renewed on September 2022 as ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œPayplus Prepaid CardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â. Payplus prepaid cardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s annual fee for the year 2022 and MTB Visa International Prepaid CardÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s annual fee for 03 consecutive years (2019-2021) were not realized due to insufficient balance in the card account. Later, we realized these annual fees on July 2023 when card balance was available. However, as per cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s request, our concerned division has given 3 yearsÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ annual fee waiver (total amount of USD 34.5) for customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s satisfaction and informed him accordingly. The cardholder is now satisfied and the issue is resolved. We have replied to Bangladesh Bank through email dated 10 oct 2023.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-10 18:30:47', '2023-10-10 18:30:47', NULL, '104', 'No'),
