(28130, 'C2309262004030005', 8, 403, '162', NULL, 'Branch reply :To the above issue is raised for misunderstanding which is already shared with us by customer himself. He also added that he again contacted with our contact center to share his misunderstand regarding renewal charge deducted from his account. The fact is that on dated 03/09/2023, the complaint customer opened a account 1311001374660 in our branch . From his account the mentioned amount was deducted by Panthapath branch for renewal charge after one year which was he informed earlier. After all, MTB Bashundhara branch is not related to the above complaint.', 'Branch communicated with the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-11 12:43:09', '2023-10-11 12:43:09', NULL, '66', 'No'),
