(28132, 'C2309201000930005', 6, 93, '298', NULL, 'Dear Concern, please check the attach file also & we have checked the transaction in the fimi and found that POS Entry Mode 010 - manual key entry (unknown) and 62 - Recurring payment - Non-secure VSEC.We refer the issue to the chargeback & settlement team to retrieve the document from acquiring bank and also take necessary action to retrieve the fund. Without any document fraud risk management team have no rights to judge the issue whether it is fraud or not. Refer to the mentioned complaint, please arrange to initiate chargeback option for the mentioned disputed transaction as client denied the mentioned transaction. Please be informed that mentioned card status is blocked in the TWCMS. Please do needful & take necessary action as appropriate.', 'Informed C/H accordingly Reversed on 09/10/2023 and suggested to replace the card.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-11 12:45:03', '2023-10-11 12:45:03', NULL, '104', 'No'),
