(28137, 'C2310051004790026', 12, 479, '206', NULL, 'Branch reply: Refer to this matter we wish to inform you that the customer has submitted a clearing Cheque (City Bank , Cheque # 1238373) amounting BDT 1,11,000 on 17.09.2023 to adjust outstanding balance of card before last day of payment. Subsequently branch has deposited Cheque in Clearing house account payable and from where this Cheque supposed to be deposited in customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card A/C through Card GL account . But inadvertently branch forgot to debit clearing house payable account to clientÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card a/c through Card GL A/C. As a result overdue fee of BDT 1150 is levied in his card on 26.09.2023 which was later waived. In whatever way, we expressed deepest apologies to customer for this once isolated incident and inconvenience.', 'Branch communicated with the customer.', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-11 13:56:08', '2023-10-11 13:56:08', NULL, '23', 'No'),
