(28247, 'N2309170012', 1, 19, '63', NULL, 'Our client Oxford Shirt Ltd. and Oxford Knit Composite Ltd. received two export order through the said buying House D- Fashion Ltd. During the execution of 1st contract the said buying house placed another contract and our client asked for the pending export from old contract first. In response to that persuasion D-Fashion undertake to arrange the pending shipment and requested the client/exporter to take new order. The buyer took the export of 2nd order partially but made the payment after long time and they are yet to take the shipment form the 1st contract of $ 5,91,818.75. Our client is negatively impacted due to the failure of D Fashion /their buyer to keep their commitment regarding the shipment and payment. The impacts are: ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Financial Loss for creating forced loan and foreign exchange loss. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Poor Utilization of Credit limit for long pending export that hampered the overall business of our client. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Country will lose hard earned foreign currency due to non-execution of export against which client imported raw materials under bond facility. As communicated by the client they are preparing for legal action against the said buying house for the inconvenience occurred. Necessary documents are attached herewith.', 'Our client Oxford Shirt Ltd. and Oxford Knit Composite Ltd. received two export order through the said buying House D- Fashion Ltd. During the execution of 1st contract the said buying house placed another contract and our client asked for the pending export from old contract first. In response to that persuasion D-Fashion undertake to arrange the pending shipment and requested the client/exporter to take new order. The buyer took the export of 2nd order partially but made the payment after long time and they are yet to take the shipment form the 1st contract of $ 5,91,818.75. Our client is negatively impacted due to the failure of D Fashion /their buyer to keep their commitment regarding the shipment and payment. The impacts are: ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Financial Loss for creating forced loan and foreign exchange loss. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Poor Utilization of Credit limit for long pending export that hampered the overall business of our client. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Country will lose hard earned foreign currency due to non-execution of export against which client imported raw materials under bond facility. As communicated by the client they are preparing for legal action against the said buying house for the inconvenience occurred. Necessary documents are attached herewith.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Export Related', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-12 17:38:09', '2023-10-12 17:38:09', NULL, '6', 'No'),
