(28441, 'C2310032004980055', 18, 498, '308', NULL, 'Regulators, Branch and Remittance Partners Relationship Management reply: Freelancers are not eligible for a 2.5% Cash Incentive according to Bangladesh Bank circular number FEPD (LDA)/147(1)/2019-7600, dated 07.10.2019 (point no-4). However, as a Freelancer, you may be eligible for a 4% Cash Incentive as per Bangladesh Bank FE Circular. We kindly request you to apply for the 4% cash incentive through your beneficiary bank (MTB in this case). Please provide the following documents: ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Freelancer ID issued by the ICT Division ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Source of earnings and statements ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Market Place Profile (55 Market places) ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Statement- Market Place Payment/Credit Confirmation Report ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Remittance Certificate from the remittance originating bank (MTB in this case) ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Earning Verify (Not Membership certificate) from the Bangladesh Freelancer Development Society (BFDS).', 'OB informed customer accordingly', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-22 10:27:17', '2023-10-22 10:27:17', NULL, '105', 'No'),
(28442, 'C2310032004670031', 14, 608, '143', NULL, 'Branch has communicated with customer several times to resolve the issue by offering him account closure service but customer could not be reached', 'OB apologised to customer on branch behalf and with hispermission ticket is being closed.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-22 10:35:19', '2023-10-22 10:35:19', NULL, '97', 'No'),
(28443, 'C2310021004040006', 8, 404, '23', NULL, 'misunderstanding between customer and sales person', '1 lounge key service charge has been reversed.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-22 10:46:21', '2023-10-22 10:46:21', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(28444, 'C2310011006760028', 13, 676, '18', NULL, 'Please inform client that foreign lounges under lounge key network or any of their staff are not affiliated with MTB. They are service partners for lounge key and they serve passengers from all over the world thus they can never have any knowledge about MTB\'s card offerings or supplementary card arrangement. It is clearly mentioned in our website/edm\'s/posts that the benefit can be availed by Visa Signature/Mastercard World Primary Credit Cardholders only. If cardholder is showing any card other than primary signature/world card it is not possible for lounge staff to know the type. They will only debit the card. There is no identification transaction for supplementary card as MTB only reverses the transactions made through primary card. Since the card was presented a supplementary card & MTB have public communication through websites regarding these thus MTB cant refund such transaction.', 'OB informed customer accordingly', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-22 10:49:46', '2023-10-22 10:49:46', NULL, '104', 'No'),
