(28464, 'C2310072003650008', 7, 365, '20', NULL, 'Reply from Card Customer Service: Dear CC, plz find the reply from SSL. We have checked this issue and found that your mentioned SMS was delivered to the respective Telco on time from our system on your mentioned number. We have noticed no significant delay or failure at our server. Note: Please check the below handset instructions if the customer doesnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t receive an SMS: ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Turn off & on the handset. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Shift the SIM to a different handset. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ If the mobile operating system is Android/iPhone, check the spam \"Spam folder/ Block folder\" from the massage setting for the SMS. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ If the mobile brand is a NOKIA Button phone, check the \"screen message\" option from the massage setting option for the SMS. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ If the mobile brand is Walton/Symphony/HTC, check the spam folder for the SMS. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Delete all the SMS he has received from masking and then restart the handset. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ System shows SMS Delivery Success only when the userÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s handset acknowledged the delivery and responded accordingly. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Please ask the customer to try with a different handset.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-22 13:21:29', '2023-10-22 13:21:29', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(28465, 'C2310055007440034', 7, 744, '42', NULL, 'The system is ok. we found successful email generate from our end. Customer needs to check Spam, Junk, Trash/Bin folder.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-22 13:24:22', '2023-10-22 13:24:22', NULL, '6', 'No'),
(28466, 'C2310052006130035', 14, 613, '162', NULL, 'Branch reply: The above issue was raised for the purpose of CDD A/C documents collection. The documents are NID, source of fund, address verification document etc. It is sure that for the purpose of document collection we call customer several time but very politely. There is no option to do rude behave with them. Rather then the mentioned client did not support us by giving the required documents. It is mentionable that before sharing the above scenario, we awarded properly of the concern officer to the above issue.', 'branch manager contacted to the customer to the above issue and say sorry for the unexpected behavior with him.  Branch has got all documents from him & CDD is done in system.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-22 13:27:06', '2023-10-22 13:27:06', NULL, '66', 'No'),
