(28471, 'C2309301004040035', 8, 404, '175', NULL, 'Branch reply: Ms. FARZANA RAHMAN is the chairman of INNOVA Properties Ltd. and her husband Md. Khaza Nazibullah Chowdhury is the Managing Director INNOVA Properties Ltd. Both of them is availing MTB Yaqeen VISA Signature Credit Card. Credit card of Ms. FARZANA RAHMAN was procured through reference and request of her husband Mr. Md. Khaza Nazibullah Chowdhury. At the time of signing card application form, both of them was physically present. Mr. Md. Khaza Nazibullah Chowdhury was approached for supplementary credit card for her wife and son since 02 supplementary card is free for Signature Credit Card. But he informed that they frequently travel abroad and that is why his wife also need primary card. They were well communicated that offered card is first year annual free under certain campaign and for subsequent years, annual fee will be waived based on 15 transaction. However, they asked to know that If there is any card that is annual fee free and RM clearly informed them that there is no such credit card of MTB. In addition to this, RM tried to contact both of them over phone as on 31.08.2023 but could not reach and send message to Mr. Md. Khaza Nazibullah Chowdhury over whats app and ask to know whether they completed 15 transaction or not. RM informed Mr. Md. Khaza Nazibullah Chowdhury that If 15 transaction is not completed, they should do it immediately otherwise annual fee will be charged after anniversary of the card since.', 'Branch informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-22 13:39:56', '2023-10-22 13:39:56', NULL, '12', 'No'),
(28472, 'C2310163007100037', 14, 723, '36', NULL, 'We have investigated the issue and identified that our honorable client called to our helpline on 11th SeptÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢23 for his Captured Card Replacement (FOC) request and our respective Customer Service Executive (CSE) logged the request using our defined module (VoC) but mistakenly inputs previous call caller ID in the module. As a consequence, this particular customer did not get his desire service timely. This was totally unintentional mistakes considering a human error.', 'As soon as we know the matter from customer on 27th SeptÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢23, we have taken necessary corrective measures and resolve the issue immediately. We have also apologized customer sincerely due to this human error. Customer new card has already been delivered to his mentioned address on 1st OctÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢23 and he has already activated the card on 10th OctÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢23 by calling to our helpline.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- Yes', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-22 13:43:38', '2023-10-22 13:43:38', NULL, '116', 'No'),
