(29006, 'C2310226000630025', 9, 222, '20', NULL, 'On 4th Oct 2023 one USD transaction was settled as a result Markup fee imposed on that day. When Cardholder performed his transaction on 3rd Oct 2023 available balance was 159.42 and the Markup fee of $6.37 ( approx. equivalent BDT 703.8) imposed on 4th Oct 2023 that is why on 5th Oct 2023 cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card balance showed -544.47 ( Markup fee BDT 703.8- previous available balance BDT 159.42 = BDT 544.47). After that customer made the payment and doing regular transactions.', 'On 4th Oct 2023 one USD transaction was settled as a result Markup fee imposed on that day. When Cardholder performed his transaction on 3rd Oct 2023 available balance was 159.42 and the Markup fee of $6.37 ( approx. equivalent BDT 703.8) imposed on 4th Oct 2023 that is why on 5th Oct 2023 cardholderÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s card balance showed -544.47 ( Markup fee BDT 703.8- previous available balance BDT 159.42 = BDT 544.47). After that customer made the payment and doing regular transactions.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-30 13:16:49', '2023-10-30 13:16:49', NULL, '104', 'No'),
