(29067, 'N2310220017', 6, 88, '248', NULL, 'As per our findings, the client (HL-1077) received a home loan of BDT 45 Lac from MTB since 2017. His payment is irregular since 2018 and after 2022, he did not pay any installment. The loan became BL in December 2022. The client did not pay any amount though repeated request. Therefore, concerned branch taken legal action against the client. After that client visited branch and deposited BDT 5 lac on 27/09/23 and 04/10/23 respectively. Accordingly client also taken time extension to pay the loan. Therefore, client\'s complaint is baseless. The details are attached herewith (ref: MTB/Cumilla/MTBL-14896/4040/2023).', 'As per our findings, the client (HL-1077) received a home loan of BDT 45 Lac from MTB since 2017. His payment is irregular since 2018 and after 2022, he did not pay any installment. The loan became BL in December 2022. The client did not pay any amount though repeated request. Therefore, concerned branch taken legal action against the client. After that client visited branch and deposited BDT 5 lac on 27/09/23 and 04/10/23 respectively. Accordingly client also taken time extension to pay the loan.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-10-31 10:42:24', '2023-10-31 10:42:24', NULL, '57', 'No'),
