(29216, 'N2310160012', 18, 498, '308', NULL, 'This particular transaction was on hold due to the names of both Sender and Beneficiary, which seems similar to foreign names. Therefore our concerned division had to ask for the documents. Mr. Shovon Joseph Costa given us his documents previously, but we have been lack of technical support to put it in our system. Hence delay of executing the incentive took place (for holding transactions). However, we are in process to release hold transactions automatically, which are hold for names & other reasons and documents received. We try to minimize the errors for our valued clients. Hopefully from next, we will be able to proceed in due time.', 'This particular transaction was on hold due to the names of both Sender and Beneficiary, which seems similar to foreign names. Therefore our concerned division had to ask for the documents. Mr. Shovon Joseph Costa given us his documents previously, but we have been lack of technical support to put it in our system. Hence delay of executing the incentive took place (for holding transactions). However, we are in process to release hold transactions automatically, which are hold for names & other reasons and documents received. We try to minimize the errors for our valued clients. Hopefully from next, we will be able to proceed in due time. Accordingly, we communicated with customer and apologized for the delay.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-02 17:36:48', '2023-11-02 17:36:48', NULL, '6', 'No'),
