n consume the lounge food as much as they want inside the lounge premises only but it is not allowed to carry outside the lounge premises. Additionally duty officer mentioned politely that, this policy has strictly monitored by CAAB authority. For this reason, respected card member has become so angry on duty officer and showed his maximum level of dissatisfaction. After requesting several times, they have returned two soft drinks which was carried in hand. But card member was strongly disagree with our duty officer and mentioned they havenÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t take anymore and leave the lounge right away without return other two cans which was bagged earlier.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-06 09:41:40', '2023-11-06 09:41:40', NULL, '6', 'No'),
