(29528, 'C2311011004680019', 14, 609, '169', NULL, 'Customer claimed that he has submitted his return slip acknowledgement for his new credit card file back in March, 2021. Whereas, his TIN Certificate creation date is MARCH 21,2021. It is not possible to submit tax return acknowledgement slip on the next day of TIN creation. Also, I\'ve attached his Income tax certificate for \'assessment year 2022-2023\', which he has submitted few days back at our branch. The TIN Certificate was the only document for tax purpose which was submitted for his credit card file. I\'ve attached this for proof.', 'Customer claimed that he has submitted his return slip acknowledgement for his new credit card file back in March, 2021. Whereas, his TIN Certificate creation date is MARCH 21,2021. It is not possible to submit tax return acknowledgement slip on the next day of TIN creation. Also, I\'ve attached his Income tax certificate for \'assessment year 2022-2023\', which he has submitted few days back at our branch. The TIN Certificate was the only document for tax purpose which was submitted for his credit card file. I\'ve attached this for proof.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-12 10:39:04', '2023-11-12 10:39:04', NULL, '51', 'No'),
