(29576, 'N2311020015', 18, 499, '42', NULL, 'We have checked the issue at our end and found that the amount was successfully credited to MTB account no. 0980310006841 on December 11, 2022 but we did not receive fee collection request from Islami Bank Bangladesh Limited (IBBL) to retrieve the fund. After receiving the complaint, we have communicated with customer and requested him to communicate with IBBL to retrieve the fund.', 'We have checked the issue at our end and found that the amount was successfully credited to MTB account no. 0980310006841 on December 11, 2022 but we did not receive fee collection request from Islami Bank Bangladesh Limited (IBBL) to retrieve the fund. After receiving the complaint, we have communicated with customer and requested him to communicate with IBBL to retrieve the fund. Our concerned branch also hold the available fund in the account as per complaint. After getting fee collection request from IBBL, MTB may take further steps as per process.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-12 13:57:45', '2023-11-12 13:57:45', NULL, '6', 'No'),
