(30142, 'C2311214006830016', 10, 683, '111', NULL, 'Branch reply: Mr. MD SHAHAB UDDIN has been enjoying a personal loan (A/C: 5030182001561) for BDT 700,000/- since 12.02.2020 from MTB Laksam SME/Agri Branch. At the begging of enjoying the loan facility, he did not paid his loan monthly installment on regular basis. After that, the loan account was turned into classified as Sub Standard (SS)on 31.12.2022. Subsequently, we have communicated with the client and realized BDT 150,000/- and the account became regular loan account as STD. After that, he did not pay his loan installment on regular basis. But Mr. SHAHAB UDDIN has raised a complaint to our Service Quality Department regarding system does not realize his loan installment since two years. The customer complaint is absolutely false. For your kind information that the client was deposited BDT 15,100/- on 31.08.2023 and BDT 20,000/- on 26.09.2023 but our system did not realize the deposited amount. We have already communicated with our CBS team and Asset Operations Department and resolve the problem. In the meantime, we have informed the matter to SHAHAB UDDIN.', 'After the withdrawal of the restriction by the branch user on 21.11.2023, system automatically  recovered the amount and the issue is now resolved.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-23 16:22:40', '2023-11-27 15:50:52', NULL, '6', 'No'),
