(30180, 'C2311162004670037', 1, 21, '209', NULL, 'The mentioned account was credited through an NPSB IBFT incoming transaction but we didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t get fund through Bangladesh Bank settlement on that time. Therefore, our concerned branch hold the amount. Finally the fund is recovered and they released the hold on 21.11.23.', 'The mentioned account was credited through an NPSB IBFT incoming transaction but we didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t get fund through Bangladesh Bank settlement on that time. Therefore, our concerned branch hold the amount. Finally the fund is recovered and they released the hold on 21.11.23. In this regard, our concerned branch communicated with customer and updated him.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-26 11:01:23', '2023-11-26 11:01:23', NULL, '61', 'No');
