(30186, 'C2311142002030014', 6, 88, '192', NULL, 'The Client M/S. Chokder Enterprise is one of the BL Client since long. At present, NI Act suite case is going on. Our concerned branch has been trying to recover the bad loan in several way since last 02 (Two) years. After rescheduling customer didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t pay any amount. Our concerned branch/dept. communicated with customer physically, by telephone and by sending reminder letter several times but he didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t respond. Recently customer visited our competent authority of CHO for settlement the outstanding amount with negotiation. Now customer also approached branch and make commitment that before December-2023, he will make 50% payment and rest of the amount will be paid soon.', 'The Client M/S. Chokder Enterprise is one of the BL Client since long. At present, NI Act suite case is going on. Our concerned branch has been trying to recover the bad loan in several way since last 02 (Two) years. After rescheduling customer didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t pay any amount. Our concerned branch/dept. communicated with customer physically, by telephone and by sending reminder letter several times but he didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t respond. Recently customer visited our competent authority of CHO for settlement the outstanding amount with negotiation. Now customer also approached branch and make commitment that before December-2023, he will make 50% payment and rest of the amount will be paid soon. Now, our concerned branch standing on the decision that if the client fail to make payment as per his commitment, then they will file suite case at Arthorin Adalot.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Loans and Advances', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-26 11:43:29', '2023-11-26 11:43:29', NULL, '32', 'No'),
