(30189, 'C2311143007000013', 3, 694, '109', NULL, 'According to the CH transaction history the customer did some ecom transaction on bKash and daraz for which CH did not receive any OTP. The reason was acquiring bank didnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t send MTB the OTP request to initiate. Issuing bank did not initiate the OTP without acquiring bank request. It can be network issue too as nationwide an internet connection problem was ongoing at that time. We have also checked and found after 16th October 2023 Cardholder performed several online transactions on bKash. Our Contact center also communicated with customer and customer confirmed that OTP issue is resolved.', 'We have checked and found after 16th October 2023, cardholder performed several online transactions on bKash. Our Contact center also communicated with customer and customer confirmed that OTP issue is resolved.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', 'Previous tickets C2310313006940040\r\nC2310316000550038', NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-26 12:06:00', '2023-11-26 12:06:00', NULL, '6', 'No'),
