(30256, 'N2311160009', 18, 499, '308', NULL, 'Customer requested to expedite the remittance and incentive payment. As per customer, he need to contact MTB every time when he send remittance. We have sent the complaint to our concerned division but they could not trace the customer as complainer did not provide any account number, reference number or contact details (phone number, email address etc). As we did not get any contact details and could not trace the customer, we called Noman Chowddury, Deputy Director, Bangladesh Bank over phone and requested for details (if any). He instruct us to close the complaint as customer did not provide any contact details (Phone, email etc) or account number.', 'We have sent the complaint to our concerned division but they could not trace the customer as complainer did not provide any account number, reference number or contact details (phone number, email address etc). As we did not get any contact details and could not trace the customer, we called Noman Chowddury, Deputy Director, Bangladesh Bank over phone and requested for details (if any). He instruct us to close the complaint as customer did not provide any contact details (Phone, email etc) or account number.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Remittance', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-27 16:39:20', '2023-11-27 16:39:20', NULL, '6', 'No'),
