(30299, 'N2311200007', 1, 19, '238', NULL, 'We have forwarded the Legal Notice to our Legal Division and subsequently, out Legal team sent the notice to our concerned branch (Dilkusha) for further information. Md. Enayet Ullah, Branch Manager of Dilkusha informed us that as per customer request they have opened a CD account in the name of Orbit Construction Ltd., on 19.07.2023, having A/C Number:1301000188883 (pre generated). As per CD account opening requirements, the company has failed to provided necessary documents & by this time they have not done any financial transaction & the account was not active. Our branch has closed the account on 11.09.2023 regarding failure of documents.', 'We have forwarded the Legal Notice to our Legal Division and subsequently, out Legal team sent the notice to our concerned branch (Dilkusha) for further information. Md. Enayet Ullah, Branch Manager of Dilkusha informed us that as per customer request they have opened a CD account in the name of Orbit Construction Ltd., on 19.07.2023, having A/C Number:1301000188883 (pre generated). As per CD account opening requirements, the company has failed to provided necessary documents & by this time they have not done any financial transaction & the account was not active. Our branch has closed the account on 11.09.2023 regarding failure of documents. We have also communicated with Mr. Abul Bashar of Legal Division. He informed us that the account was not open properly and already closed due to non-submission of documents. Therefore, no further action can be taken from bank end.', 0, 'Bangladesh Bank- No', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-28 13:31:28', '2023-11-28 13:31:28', NULL, '17', 'No'),
(30300, 'C2311241000440012', 3, 44, '109', NULL, 'Cards & ADC Technology Unit reply: We didn\'t find ay transaction reflection also. So it is unknown to us the declined reason. But there is no problem with the card, cardholder performed both POS and ecommerce transaction 11/26/23 10:46:46 pm, 11/18/23 10:30:51 am', 'OB informed customer accordingly', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-11-28 14:10:33', '2023-11-28 14:10:33', NULL, '104', 'No'),
