(30459, 'C2311261004040036', 14, 609, '204', NULL, 'Client visited our branch and wanted to pay his credit card dues, then we check the dues in USD part where his statement in TWSMS shows 491.53 dated 14/11/23, as per statement he also pay his payment through Internet banking dated 22/11/23 where POS int charged shows USD 7.42 dated 25/11/2023. we also communicated with the client and apologised for his payment inconvienience, we also advised him for dues payment, he also agreed for his payment.', 'Client visited our branch and wanted to pay his credit card dues, then we check the dues in USD part where his statement in TWSMS shows 491.53 dated 14/11/23, as per statement he also pay his payment through Internet banking dated 22/11/23 where POS int charged shows USD 7.42 dated 25/11/2023. we also communicated with the client and apologised for his payment inconvienience, we also advised him for dues payment, he also agreed for his payment.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-04 10:31:10', '2023-12-04 10:31:10', NULL, '14', 'No'),
