(30548, 'C2311281002280049', 9, 228, '19', NULL, 'The realized amount did not cover minimum due amount for the cycle (statement dt: 25-10-23) and that is why system charged card account for LPC. The payment was updated on 13-11-23 due to system issue. The statement date due was BDT 1, 55,162.33 and the collected amount (via auto debit) was BDT 2151 which is not equal to the minimum payment due for that cycle.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-05 17:39:03', '2023-12-05 17:39:03', NULL, '104', 'No'),
(30549, 'C2311302002520034', 14, 608, '174', NULL, 'First of all, we apologies for the said delay issue. We do hereby also confirm that we will more cautious in future to avoid the said situation again. Our Branch Manager have already been talked with the client regarding the matter with his utmost care and said his apology to the client for the delay issuing of the said Sanchaypatra. It may be mentioned here that, we have already issued the said Sanchaypatra today and duly informed to the client. The concern client has been convinced already regarding the delay matter. Our Branch Manager also talked with the concern officer regarding the delay issue and found that during this inconvenience period of the last 09 (Nine) working days the officer was physically sick and was under huge working pressure due to availed leave by another GB officer for two days and on job duty by another officer in CoxÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Bazar from November 21, 2023 to November 27, 2023 for playing Cricket tournament. In view of this, the concern officer did not able send the said Sanchaypatra to our Bond department in proper time. Please consider the matter at your end with your kind perusal. Solved the issue', 'First of all, we apologies for the said delay issue. We do hereby also confirm that we will more cautious in future to avoid the said situation again. Our Branch Manager have already been talked with the client regarding the matter with his utmost care and said his apology to the client for the delay issuing of the said Sanchaypatra. It may be mentioned here that, we have already issued the said Sanchaypatra today and duly informed to the client. The concern client has been convinced already regarding the delay matter. Our Branch Manager also talked with the concern officer regarding the delay issue and found that during this inconvenience period of the last 09 (Nine) working days the officer was physically sick and was under huge working pressure due to availed leave by another GB officer for two days and on job duty by another officer in CoxÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s Bazar from November 21, 2023 to November 27, 2023 for playing Cricket tournament. In view of this, the concern officer did not able send the said Sanchaypatra to our Bond department in proper time. Please consider the matter at your end with your kind perusal. Solved the issue', 0, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-06 09:42:53', '2023-12-06 09:42:53', NULL, '140', 'No'),
