(30559, 'C2311281006140052', 17, 509, '202', NULL, 'Today customer came to our branch regarding his complain. Actually there was misunderstanding arise about the annual fee. He was informed about the 50% waver of 1st year annual fee but he thought this fee will be impose at end of 1st year. As an existing MTB credit card user he does not have any experience regarding the annual fee of MTB credit card due to 15 transaction in every year. Now he is understand about the MTB policy regarding impose of 1st year annual fee. He is now satisfied about our service and will continue relationship with us.', 'Today customer came to our branch regarding his complain. Actually there was misunderstanding arise about the annual fee. He was informed about the 50% waver of 1st year annual fee but he thought this fee will be impose at end of 1st year. As an existing MTB credit card user he does not have any experience regarding the annual fee of MTB credit card due to 15 transaction in every year. Now he is understand about the MTB policy regarding impose of 1st year annual fee. He is now satisfied about our service and will continue relationship with us.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-06 11:21:15', '2023-12-06 11:21:15', NULL, '50', 'No'),
