(30825, 'C2312072004670012', 10, 467, '205', NULL, 'Branch reply: Customer opened this account on 19.11.2023, We have submitted request for CPV through online app. But as customer did not pick up the call of CPV officer, it was not possible to unfreeze the account. Then we tried to communicate with the customer several times, but he did not replied our call. Finally he communicated us on 05.12.23 and then we have submitted request for re-CPV. After getting positive CPV report, we have unfreeze the account through LOD on 06.12.2023. Mentionable here that meanwhile customer has visited our branch yesterday and today afternoon. We have explained the total fact to him and he understood. He also said that he just informed about his problem to CC, but did not made compliant. Whatever, he is satisfied now and we expressed our best positive attitude to him in this regard.', 'Issue has been resolved', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-12 12:08:31', '2023-12-12 12:08:31', NULL, '78', 'No'),
