(30952, 'C2309222004570009', 14, 608, '169', NULL, 'According to CBS team the penalty charge will increase in compound rate. As customer missed the EMI on 20/08/2023 the due amount become 20000+2% penalty, in total 20400 taka. So every time automatic system tried to deduct 20400 taka but it fails due to insufficient balance. Finally the account balance was available on 02/11/2023. So the total amount of BDT 21200 (principle + 2% penalty for 03(Aug, Sep & Oct.) months) has deducted on 02/11/2023.', 'According to CBS team the penalty charge will increase in compound rate. As customer missed the EMI on 20/08/2023 the due amount become 20000+2% penalty, in total 20400 taka. So every time automatic system tried to deduct 20400 taka but it fails due to insufficient balance. Finally the account balance was available on 02/11/2023. So the total amount of BDT 21200 (principle + 2% penalty for 03(Aug, Sep & Oct.) months) has deducted on 02/11/2023.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-14 13:21:05', '2023-12-14 13:21:05', NULL, '51', 'No'),
