(31120, 'C2312161006650004', 13, 665, '18', NULL, 'Card business reply: Please inform client as part of transaction monitoring; the bank observed that the client has been making unusual number of transactions at same/similar merchant points repeatedly. (NOWRIN MEDIA CENTER, TELCO DISTRIBUTION,) The transaction pattern does not reflect actual consumer transactions that one can make to match his/her regular lifestyle requirements. Subsequently, the client have placed redemption requests with the Reward Points earned through such irregular transactions, which breaches the terms and condition of Mrewardz portal and regulatory compliance. (1. Reward Points will be earned on personal, non-commercial transactions only. The bank may nullify earned Reward Points if transactions are found to be of commercial nature, 2. The bank reserves the right not to give Reward Points or nullify earned Reward Points for any particular transaction or for transactions done at any specific merchant point or merchant category.) We have already issued a cautionary letter through mail but the client continued to make such transactions. Thus the bank in compliance with its policy decided to close the reward ID of the client and further issued mail to close the secured credit card. Find the attached a copy of our Terms & Conditions associated with Reward Points for your ready reference.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-20 11:45:30', '2023-12-20 11:45:30', NULL, '104', 'No'),
