(31235, 'C2312132004670029', 14, 608, '234', NULL, 'We have communicated with our client several times and as well as discussed the issue. In this connection kindly be informed that MR. FARAZ SHAMSI wants to come office for resolving the issue but he canÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t manage time right now. We will process the request again when he is available. We have also assured him about our extreme co-operation for all times. However, we should be more prudent and cautious while giving any services to our customers in the future.', 'We have communicated with our client several times and as well as discussed the issue. In this connection kindly be informed that MR. FARAZ SHAMSI wants to come office for resolving the issue but he canÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t manage time right now. We will process the request again when he is available. We have also assured him about our extreme co-operation for all times. However, we should be more prudent and cautious while giving any services to our customers in the future.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-26 15:43:53', '2023-12-26 15:43:53', NULL, '9', 'No'),
