(31239, 'C2312211006650016', 13, 665, '18', NULL, 'Card Products & Business Development reply: as part of transaction monitoring; the bank observed that the client has been making unusual number of transactions at same/similar merchant points repeatedly. (SANDWIP WATCH,MOBILE PARK,HM DOT. COM >C,G,BD ) The transaction pattern does not reflect actual consumer transactions that one can make to match his/her regular lifestyle requirements. Subsequently, the client have placed redemption requests with the Reward Points earned through such irregular transactions, which breaches the terms and condition of Mrewardz portal and regulatory compliance. (1. Reward Points will be earned on personal, non-commercial transactions only. The bank may nullify earned Reward Points if transactions are found to be of commercial nature, 2. The bank reserves the right not to give Reward Points or nullify earned Reward Points for any particular transaction or for transactions done at any specific merchant point or merchant category.) We have already issued a cautionary letter through mail but the client continued to make such transactions. Thus the bank in compliance with its policy and regulatory compliance; decided to nullify & close the reward ID.', 'OB tried to reach customer several times but was unreachable', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2023-12-26 16:28:54', '2023-12-26 16:28:54', NULL, '104', 'No'),
