(31616, 'C2312272003650001', 7, 365, '42', NULL, 'IB support reply: Please check the below handset instructions if the customer doesnÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢t receive an SMS: ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Turn off & on the handset. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Shift the SIM to a different handset. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ If the mobile operating system is Android/iPhone, check the spam \"Spam folder/ Block folder\" from the massage setting for the SMS. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ If the mobile brand is a NOKIA Button phone, check the \"screen message\" option from the massage setting option for the SMS. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ If the mobile brand is Walton/Symphony/HTC, check the spam folder for the SMS. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Delete all the SMS he has received from masking and then restart the handset. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ System shows SMS Delivery Success only when the userÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s handset acknowledged the delivery and responded accordingly. ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¢ Please ask the customer to try with a different handset.', 'As per customer voice Problem resolved.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2024-01-04 13:33:41', '2024-01-04 13:33:41', NULL, '6', 'No'),
