(31635, 'C2312241004040012', 14, 609, '162', NULL, 'Please be informed that the above mentioned complaint raised on 24.12.2023 to our branch end for updating date of birth and mailing address of the customer which is mistakenly did not send through VOC. On dated 26/12/2023 we sent the request & finally, on dated 28/12/2023 the service is done which ticket no is S2312261007590070. We apologies to the customer for the delay service & also committed to ensure smooth customer service in coming days.', 'Please be informed that the above mentioned complaint raised on 24.12.2023 to our branch end for updating date of birth and mailing address of the customer which is mistakenly did not send through VOC. On dated 26/12/2023 we sent the request & finally, on dated 28/12/2023 the service is done which ticket no is S2312261007590070. We apologies to the customer for the delay service & also committed to ensure smooth customer service in coming days.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2024-01-04 17:08:27', '2024-01-04 17:08:27', NULL, '66', 'No'),
(31636, 'C2312041002040022', 14, 614, '5', NULL, 'Following your guidance we would like to inform you, our first priority is always politely ask for payment in order to get access for additional guests according to lounge access policy. Mostly customer denied to pay additional charges, and they would like to proceed with any Lounge Membership Program. So we provide options to our customers to make them delightful without feeling any disappointment right away. We know, customers are well aware about their beneficiations and they would like to choose the comfortable one. Here, If a customer come across with MTB loungekey, we always inform them to use it in abroad. But considering as a Loungekey member, we are unable to repudiate directly according to our international agreement with them. If we do, it will hamper the international agreement and furthermore our future commitment with Lounge Membership Partner. Please note, bill has been settled already for the month of June 2023. And disbursement of said monthly bill has been completed by the Lounge Membership provider. Hope we will try our best to meet the expectation through our service on his next visit at MTB Air Lounge.', 'Following your guidance we would like to inform you, our first priority is always politely ask for payment in order to get access for additional guests according to lounge access policy. Mostly customer denied to pay additional charges, and they would like to proceed with any Lounge Membership Program. So we provide options to our customers to make them delightful without feeling any disappointment right away. We know, customers are well aware about their beneficiations and they would like to choose the comfortable one. Here, If a customer come across with MTB loungekey, we always inform them to use it in abroad. But considering as a Loungekey member, we are unable to repudiate directly according to our international agreement with them. If we do, it will hamper the international agreement and furthermore our future commitment with Lounge Membership Partner. Please note, bill has been settled already for the month of June 2023. And disbursement of said monthly bill has been completed by the Lounge Membership provider. Hope we will try our best to meet the expectation through our service on his next visit at MTB Air Lounge.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'General Banking', NULL, NULL, '2024-01-04 17:09:42', '2024-01-23 14:30:37', NULL, '119', 'No'),
