(32248, 'C2401211006650005', 13, 629, '18', NULL, 'The customer needs to know our service provider for air redemption is a foreign entity giving service to multiple countries. As per their current settings Passport number is mandatory. However we have instructed them to make this field optional for domestic booking but the process is in progress. In the mean time customer can book by directly mailing support@giift.com, by giving information about his client ID, Reward point balance, Intended date & Time of flight, Destination, No of passengers, Passengers information.', 'CC informed the customer.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2024-01-24 12:25:37', '2024-01-24 12:25:37', NULL, '104', 'No'),
