(32253, 'C2401201004040008', 13, 676, '316', NULL, 'We are extremely sorry for the inconvenience caused and thank you very much for raising your concern to us. Please convey our heartfelt thanks to our honorable card holder for choosing MTB Air Lounge during his air travel. Following the VOC Ticket No. : C2401201004040008 we have investigated the issue. Respected customer MR. MOHAMMAD TAIMUR HOSSAIN TALUKDER (Client ID ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Å“ 574076), VISA Signature Card Holder (498851******1582) came to our domestic lounge along with his family at Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport around 2 PM. During that time most of the scheduled flight has been delayed to depart. As a result, the lounge was totally full with heavy guest flow. So, respected customer was very much disappointed to see the lounge circumstances and showed his dissatisfaction towards us. He asked duty officerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s to manage some seats for their family. Our duty officer tried to managed some temporary seats (Stool) for respected customers and politely informed to spare some moment for empty seats. Respected customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s desire was seating at couch only along with his family. Also he advised our duty officer to move some customers who have seated for long time and give some opportunity for seating whoever in queue on that moment. From our site, such type of approach towards customers is unaccepted and inappropriate in terms of lounge service. Here, our duty officer apologized for the circumstances which was not in their hand. Considering above, hope you will understand the circumstances. We will try our best to meet the respected customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s expectation through our service on his next visit at MTB Air Lounge.', 'We are extremely sorry for the inconvenience caused and thank you very much for raising your concern to us. Please convey our heartfelt thanks to our honorable card holder for choosing MTB Air Lounge during his air travel. Following the VOC Ticket No. : C2401201004040008 we have investigated the issue. Respected customer MR. MOHAMMAD TAIMUR HOSSAIN TALUKDER (Client ID ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Å“ 574076), VISA Signature Card Holder (498851******1582) came to our domestic lounge along with his family at Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport around 2 PM. During that time most of the scheduled flight has been delayed to depart. As a result, the lounge was totally full with heavy guest flow. So, respected customer was very much disappointed to see the lounge circumstances and showed his dissatisfaction towards us. He asked duty officerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s to manage some seats for their family. Our duty officer tried to managed some temporary seats (Stool) for respected customers and politely informed to spare some moment for empty seats. Respected customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s desire was seating at couch only along with his family. Also he advised our duty officer to move some customers who have seated for long time and give some opportunity for seating whoever in queue on that moment. From our site, such type of approach towards customers is unaccepted and inappropriate in terms of lounge service. Here, our duty officer apologized for the circumstances which was not in their hand. Considering above, hope you will understand the circumstances. We will try our best to meet the respected customerÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s expectation through our service on his next visit at MTB Air Lounge.', 0, 'No', NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'Debit Card or Credit Card or ATM Card', NULL, NULL, '2024-01-24 14:52:26', '2024-01-24 14:52:26', NULL, '119', 'No'),
