(1, 'This is a test message. Your {form_request} request has been received successfully. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: PRIME UAT Team.', 'This is a test message. Your {form_request} complaint has been received successfully. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: PRIME UAT Team.ttt', 'This is a test message.\r\nYour {form_request} request has been received successfully. Ticket No {reference_no}. Query: 16. Thank you for staying with Prime Bank.\r\nRegards,\r\nPRIME UAT Teamttt', 'This is a test message.. \r\nYour {form_request} complaint has been received successfully. Ticket No {reference_no}. Thank you for informing us. \r\nRegards,\r\nPRIME UAT Teamttt', 'This is a test message.\r\nYour {form_request} request has been resolved successfully. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: PRIME UAT Team.ttt', 'This is test message.  Your {form_request} complaint has been solved. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: PRIME UAT Team.ttt', 'This is a test message.\r\nYour {form_request} request has been resolved successfully. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: PRIME  UAT Team. ttt\r\nRegards,\r\nPRIME UAT Team', 'This is a test message.\r\nYour {form_request} complaint has been solved. Ticket no {reference_no}. Query: PRIME UAT Team.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nPRIME UAT Team ttt', 'Use OTP: {otp_code} to proceed with service/complaint lodgement. This OTP will be valid for 3 minutes. Please do not shareÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â ÃƒÆ', 'Dear Customer,\r\n \r\nYour OTP is {otp_code} to proceed with your current Internet Banking activity and will be valid for next 3 minutes. For security, please do not share this with anyone. \r\n\r\nFor queries: call 16 (Local); +8802556, +8802, +8809 (Overseas).\r\n\r\nSincerely, \r\nUAT-BRACÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€š