e to serve you and make your experience even better. Query No: {reference_no} ttttttttttttt', 'This is a test message. Thank you from Prime Bank. We want to continue to serve you and make your experience even better.. Query No: {reference_no} ttttttttttt', 'This is a test message.\r\nEscalation eMail has been generated for issue {form_request} and the Ticket No: {reference_no} and group name is {group_name}. Please have a look.\r\nRegards, \r\nPrime UAT Team ttttttttttttt', NULL, 1, 1, '::1', '', '', '2024-11-20 10:53:23', '2024-11-20 10:53:23');
